(window.PL_LANG_Q = window.PL_LANG_Q || []).push([{"Three turns are all I need!":"3 回合就夠我用了！","The referee is watching. Let us give them a good show!":"裁判正看著呢。讓我們打一場精彩的對戰吧！","In here, nobody switches out. It is all guts!":"在這裡誰都不能換下場。全憑毅力！","I will win on points if I have to!":"必要的話，我靠評分也要贏！","My Pokémon never back down. Do yours?":"我的寶可夢從不退縮。你的呢？","Beaten fair and square...":"輸得心服口服……","Even the referee could see you were better.":"連裁判都看得出你比我強。","No regrets. That was a real fight!":"沒有遺憾。這才是真正的對戰！","My guts were not enough this time...":"這次光靠毅力還不夠……","So you are the one everybody is talking about! I am Greta, the Arena Tycoon. In my Arena, guts beat everything. Show me yours!":"原來大家都在說的人就是你！我是競技場主將黃瓜香。在我的競技場裡，毅力勝過一切。讓我看看你的毅力吧！","You again! Good, I have been waiting. This time I am giving it everything I have got!":"又是你！太好了，我一直在等你。這次我要使出全力！","Whoa, you have got guts! Fine, this is yours.":"哇，你真有毅力！好吧，這個歸你了。","Ha ha! That was the best battle I have had in ages. You earned it!":"哈哈！這是我好久沒打過的精彩對戰。這是你應得的！","Welcome to the Battle Arena! Here, Pokémon battle one on one, three turns at a time.":"歡迎來到對戰競技場！在這裡，寶可夢一對一對戰，每組最多 3 回合。","Enter three Pokémon. They come out in the order you choose them, and they cannot be switched out.":"請報名 3 隻寶可夢。牠們會按你選擇的順序出場，中途不能替換。","If neither Pokémon has fainted after three turns, the referee judges Mind, Skill and Body. The loser is out, and the winner battles on with the HP it has left.":"如果 3 回合後雙方都沒有倒下，裁判就會按心、技、體來評分。輸的一方出局，贏的一方帶著剩下的 HP 繼續對戰。","Win seven in a row to finish a set and earn Battle Points. Pokémon above level 50 battle at level 50, items from the Bag cannot be used, and your Pokémon will be just as they were.":"連勝 7 場就完成一輪，可以獲得對戰點數。超過 50 級的寶可夢按 50 級對戰，不能使用背包裡的道具，你的寶可夢也不會有任何改變。","The Arena Tycoon has come to battle you herself!":"競技場主將親自前來和你對戰了！","Greta recognizes your guts. You earned the Silver Guts Symbol!":"黃瓜香認可了你的毅力。你得到了銀色毅力象徵！","Greta recognizes your guts. You earned the Gold Guts Symbol!":"黃瓜香認可了你的毅力。你得到了金色毅力象徵！","The door to the battle room. Challengers must register at the counter first.":"通往對戰房間的門。挑戰者要先在櫃檯報名。","Mind is about attacking without holding back. Hiding behind Protect costs you points.":"心看的是有沒有全力進攻。躲在守住後面會扣分。","Skill is about hitting where it hurts. Moves that do not work well count against you.":"技看的是有沒有打中要害。效果不好的招式會扣分。","Body is about the HP your Pokémon keeps. Think about the order: a winner stays in with the HP it has left.":"體看的是寶可夢保住了多少 HP。出場順序要想清楚：贏的一方會帶著剩下的 HP 繼續打。","They say the Arena Tycoon herself comes out for Trainers who win twenty-eight battles in a row.":"聽說連勝 28 場的訓練家，競技場主將會親自出來和他們對戰。","Mind, Skill and Body. After three turns, I judge every match-up fairly.":"心、技、體。3 回合之後，我會公正地判定每一組對決。","Welcome to the Contest Hall! Here we hold the {a} and the {b}.":"歡迎來到華麗大賽會場！這裡舉辦{a}和{b}的比賽。","Welcome to the Contest Hall! Here we hold the {a}.":"歡迎來到華麗大賽會場！這裡舉辦{a}的比賽。","There are three rounds. In the Visual round, the judges look at your Pokémon's condition: Pokéblocks help.":"比賽共有三個階段。視覺審查時，評審會看寶可夢的狀態：寶可方塊能幫上忙。","{mon} needs the {ribbon} to enter here. It is won in the {rank} at {town}.":"{mon}需要{ribbon}才能在這裡參賽。這枚獎章要在{town}的{rank}比賽中贏得。","{mon} may now enter the {rank} of the {cat} contest, held in {town}.":"{mon}現在可以參加{cat}組的{rank}了，比賽在{town}舉辦。","The Fearless Stride":"無畏的步伐","Light on Still Water":"靜水之光","A Smile for Everyone":"給每個人的笑容","The Quiet Thinker":"沉靜的思考者","Strength That Stands Firm":"屹立不倒的力量","What a performance! I paint for the Lilycove Museum. May I paint {mon} for its gallery?":"多麼精彩的表演！我為水靜市美術館作畫。可以讓我為美術館畫下{mon}嗎？","The museum has a painting in its {cat} frame already. Mine would take its place.":"美術館的{cat}畫框裡已經有一幅畫了。我的畫會取代它。","Let the artist paint it?":"要讓畫家畫牠嗎？","I understand. Win again, and I will ask again!":"我明白了。再贏一次的話，我會再來問你！","There! \"{title}\". It will hang on the second floor of the Lilycove Museum.":"畫好了！《{title}》。它會掛在水靜市美術館的二樓。","An empty frame. Its plate reads: \"{cat} Contest, Master Rank.\"":"空的畫框。名牌上寫著：「{cat}組 大師級」。","{mon}, champion of the {cat} Contest, Master Rank. Given by {ot}.":"{mon}，{cat}組大師級冠軍。由{ot}贈送。","A painting: \"{title}\". {plate}":"一幅畫：《{title}》。{plate}","Every frame upstairs holds a painting now, and every one of them is your Pokémon! Please, take this as our thanks.":"樓上的每個畫框都掛上畫了，而且全都是你的寶可夢！請收下這個，聊表謝意。","Our second floor is complete, thanks to you. Visitors stand in front of those paintings for hours.":"託你的福，我們的二樓完整了。參觀的人會在那些畫前站上好幾個小時。","Upstairs, {n} of the five frames hold a painting of a Master Rank champion. We hope to fill them all.":"樓上的五個畫框中，已經有{n}個掛上了大師級冠軍的畫。希望能把它們全部掛滿。","Upstairs, five frames wait for paintings of the Master Rank champions of our Contest Hall.":"樓上有五個畫框，等著掛上本市華麗大賽會場大師級冠軍的畫。","This is the Berry Blender! Put berries in, and it makes Pokéblocks. Pokémon love them, and they make them shine in contests.":"這是樹果混合器！放進樹果就能做出寶可方塊。寶可夢很愛吃，還能讓牠們在比賽中大放光彩。","{player} received a Pokéblock Case!":"{player}得到了寶可方塊盒！","Use berries of different kinds. Flavors that clash cancel out, so think about what goes together!":"要用不同種類的樹果。相衝的口味會互相抵消，所以想想哪些搭配得好！","Blend berries":"混合樹果","Feed a Pokéblock":"餵寶可方塊","Come back any time. The blender never sleeps!":"歡迎隨時再來。混合器從來不休息！","You have no berries to blend. The clerk sells some.":"你沒有可以放進去的樹果。店員那裡有賣。","Blend!":"開始混合！","In the blender: {list}":"混合器裡：{list}","Your Pokéblock Case is full.":"你的寶可方塊盒已經滿了。","{player} made a {block}! Level {n}, feel {f}.":"{player}做出了{block}！等級{n}，細膩度{f}。","Your Pokéblock Case is empty. Blend some first!":"你的寶可方塊盒是空的。先做一些吧！","{block} Lv. {n}":"{block} Lv. {n}","Which Pokéblock?":"哪一塊寶可方塊？","{mon} can't eat any more Pokéblocks.":"{mon}已經吃不下寶可方塊了。","{mon} ate the {block}!":"{mon}吃了{block}！","Plain berries, perfect for the Berry Blender!":"普通的樹果，最適合放進樹果混合器！","Blender host":"混合器負責人","Curator":"館長","My first contest was here! Win the Normal Rank, then try the Super Rank in Fallarbor Town.":"我第一次參賽就是在這裡！先贏下普通級，再去秋葉鎮挑戰超級級別吧。","Never put two of the same berry in the blender: the Pokéblock comes out black. For Beauty, a Chesto Berry with an Oran Berry makes a fine blue one.":"千萬別把兩顆一樣的樹果放進混合器：做出來的寶可方塊會是黑色的。想提升美麗的話，零餘果配橙橙果能做出很好的藍色方塊。","Pokéblocks raise a Pokémon's condition, but it can only eat so many. Make every one count!":"寶可方塊能提升寶可夢的狀態，可是能吃的數量有限。每一塊都要用得值得！","I paint the champions of the Master Rank for the Lilycove Museum. Win one, and I will ask to paint your Pokémon!":"我為水靜市美術館畫大師級的冠軍。只要你贏下一場，我就會請求畫你的寶可夢！","The Master Rank! Only Pokémon with a Hyper Rank ribbon in the same category may enter.":"大師級！只有擁有同一組別高級級別獎章的寶可夢才能參加。","This floor shows paintings of Pokémon that won the Master Rank at the Contest Hall. One frame for each category.":"這一層展出在華麗大賽會場贏得大師級的寶可夢的畫。每個組別一個畫框。","A poster: \"Normal Rank contests, every day! Show the judges what your Pokémon can do.\"":"海報：「普通級比賽，每天舉行！讓評審看看你的寶可夢有多厲害。」","A poster: \"Super Rank contests. Only Pokémon that won the Normal Rank may enter.\"":"海報：「超級級別比賽。只有贏過普通級的寶可夢才能參加。」","A poster: \"A Pokémon in fine condition shines from the very first round.\"":"海報：「狀態好的寶可夢，從第一個階段就會大放光彩。」","A poster: \"Hyper Rank and Master Rank contests. The best Pokémon in Hoenn compete here.\"":"海報：「高級級別與大師級比賽。豐緣最出色的寶可夢在這裡一較高下。」","A poster: \"Master Rank champions are painted for the Lilycove Museum.\"":"海報：「大師級冠軍的畫像會掛進水靜市美術館。」","My name is Steven. I am interested in rare stones, so I travel all over looking for them.":"我叫大吾。我對稀有的石頭很感興趣，所以到處旅行尋找它們。","These caves hold stones you will not find anywhere else. Is that not wonderful?":"這些洞窟裡有在別處找不到的石頭。很棒吧？","My name is Steven. I am interested in rare stones... Oh? A letter for me?":"我叫大吾。我對稀有的石頭很感興趣……哦？有我的信？","{player} handed over the Letter.":"{player}交出了信。","From my father? ...Thank you for bringing it all this way. And I hear you got the Devon Goods back, too.":"是我父親寫的？……謝謝你特地送來。聽說你還把得文貨物搶回來了。","You seem like a Trainer who will go far. Please take this TM. Steel Wing: hard wings that strike like steel.":"你看起來是會大有作為的訓練家。請收下這個招式學習器。鋼翼：用像鋼鐵一樣堅硬的翅膀攻擊。","I have more stones to look for. Maybe we will meet again somewhere. Take care.":"我還有別的石頭要找。說不定我們會在哪裡再見。保重。","Slateport City is to the north, across the sea. Mr. Briney can take you there, I bet.":"凱那市在北邊的海對面。哈奇老人一定能載你過去。","Mr. Briney's boat cut through the waves, with Peeko flying beside it...":"哈奇老人的船破浪前進，Peeko在一旁飛著……","You already have a fishing rod! Cast it in any water and see what bites.":"你已經有釣竿了！隨便找片水域甩下去，看看會釣到什麼吧。","Fishing is the best! Here, take this Old Rod and see for yourself.":"釣魚最棒了！來，拿著這根破舊釣竿，自己試試看吧。","Face the water, use the rod, and wait for a bite!":"面對水面用釣竿，然後等魚上鉤！","Yo, Champion! Brawly uses Fighting-type Pokémon. They hit Normal and Rock types hard.":"嘿，冠軍！藤樹用的是格鬥屬性的寶可夢。牠們對一般和岩石屬性很有效。","Flying and Psychic moves are the way to go. A Taillow from Route 104 or a Wingull from the beach would do great!":"飛行和超能力屬性的招式最好用。104號道路的傲骨燕或海邊的長翅鷗都很合適！","With one Hoenn badge, your Pokémon from home listen up to level 25. Win this one and it goes up to 30!":"有一枚豐緣徽章，你從家鄉帶來的寶可夢在25級以下會聽話。贏下這枚就會提高到30級！","Here you go: the Knuckle Badge. You earned it, no question.":"給你：拳頭徽章。這是你應得的，沒話說。","{player} received the Knuckle Badge from Brawly!":"{player}從藤樹那裡得到了拳頭徽章！","With two Hoenn badges, Pokémon up to level 30 will obey you, even ones from far away.":"有了兩枚豐緣徽章，30級以下的寶可夢都會聽你的話，就算是從遠方來的也一樣。","Take this too. TM08 is Bulk Up: it raises your Pokémon's Attack and Defense. Great for riding out a storm!":"這個也給你。招式學習器08是健美：能提高寶可夢的攻擊和防禦。頂住暴風雨正合適！","Brawly surfs the big waves around the island every morning. That is how he trains!":"藤樹每天早上都在島周圍衝大浪。那就是他的修行方式！","West along the beach is Granite Cave. A young man in a fancy suit went in there to look at rocks.":"沿著海灘往西就是石之洞窟。有個穿著講究的年輕人進去看石頭了。","Everyone in Dewford Hall is always talking about the newest trend. I can never keep up!":"武鬥鎮會館裡的人總在聊最新的流行。我根本跟不上！","There is no Mart on this island. Stock up on Potions before you take a boat over!":"這座島上沒有友好商店。坐船過來之前要先備好傷藥！","Welcome to Dewford Hall! Here we talk about whatever is popular. This week? Rare stones, of all things!":"歡迎來到武鬥鎮會館！我們在這裡聊各種流行的話題。這星期？竟然是稀有的石頭！","They say the walls of Granite Cave hold an ancient picture of a huge Pokémon. Spooky!":"聽說石之洞窟的牆上有一幅古老的畫，畫著一隻巨大的寶可夢。好可怕！","Laura":"勞拉","Body and mind, trained as one! That is how we fight in Brawly's Gym!":"身心合一地修行！這就是藤樹道館的戰鬥方式！","My focus slipped...":"我分心了……","Meditite trains its mind by meditating. Its strength comes from inside.":"瑪沙那靠冥想鍛鍊心靈。牠的力量來自內心。","Takao":"高尾","Hoo... hah...":"呼……哈……","Brawly learned his moves riding the big waves. His Pokémon never give up.":"藤樹是在大浪裡練出這些招式的。他的寶可夢從不放棄。","Yo! I am Brawly, Dewford's Gym Leader. I have ridden the roughest waves around this island, and they made me strong. A Champion from Kanto, huh? Let us see if you can handle a big swell!":"喲！我是武鬥鎮道館的館主藤樹。我在這座島周圍衝過最猛的浪，是大浪讓我變強的。關都來的冠軍是吧？讓我看看你能不能頂住大浪！","Whoa, you swallowed my wave whole! You really are something.":"哇，我的大浪全被你吞掉了！你真的很了不起。","Shh! You will scare the fish. ...Too late. Battle me, then!":"噓！你會把魚嚇跑的。……來不及了。那就跟我對戰吧！","The one that got away...":"讓牠跑掉了……","The sea around Dewford is rough. Only strong Pokémon live out there.":"武鬥鎮周圍的海很兇。只有強壯的寶可夢才住得下去。","Granite Cave is dark inside, deeper down. A Pokémon that knows Flash will light your way.":"石之洞窟深處很暗。會閃光的寶可夢能幫你照亮道路。","The ladder there goes down into the dark. Somebody went down earlier, muttering about stones...":"那邊的梯子通往黑暗的深處。剛才有個人一邊唸叨著石頭一邊下去了……","Dennis":"丹尼斯","Granite Cave is my favourite place in all of Hoenn! Battle me in its honour!":"石之洞窟是我在豐緣最喜歡的地方！為了它，跟我對戰吧！","My Pokémon are as hard as granite... but you are harder.":"我的寶可夢跟花崗岩一樣硬……可是你更硬。","Aron eats iron ore from the cave walls. Do not let it near your bike!":"可可多拉會吃洞窟牆上的鐵礦石。別讓牠靠近你的自行車！","Joyce":"喬伊斯","I train down here in the dark to sharpen my senses. Hyah!":"我在這片黑暗裡修行，磨練自己的感官。嘿呀！","Brawly's Gym is my goal. I will beat him one day!":"我的目標是藤樹的道館。總有一天我會打敗他！","Dewford Town. A tiny island in the rough sea, with a big Gym.":"武鬥鎮。洶湧海中的小島，有一座大道館。","Dewford Town Pokémon Gym. Leader: Brawly, a big wave of fighting spirit.":"武鬥鎮寶可夢道館。館主：藤樹，鬥志如巨浪般洶湧。","Granite Cave. Visitors must watch their step in the dark.":"石之洞窟。來訪者在黑暗中請注意腳下。","Ahoy! Peeko and I owe you one. Where shall we sail?":"喂！我和Peeko欠你一個人情。要開船去哪裡？","Here we are! Just say the word when you want to sail again.":"到了！想再出海的時候說一聲就好。","First round":"第一輪","Quarterfinal":"八強賽","Semifinal":"準決賽","The crowd is watching. Let us make it a match to remember!":"觀眾都在看著。讓我們打一場難忘的比賽吧！","I read your data. I know what you will send out!":"我看過你的資料了。我知道你會派誰出場！","Only one of us goes on to the next round!":"我們之中只有一個人能晉級！","This tournament is mine!":"這次冠軍賽是我的！","I have waited all season for this match.":"這場比賽我等了整整一季。","You go on to the next round. Good luck!":"你晉級了。祝你好運！","So that is why you are ranked where you are...":"原來這就是你排名那麼高的原因……","My tournament ends here...":"我的冠軍賽就到此為止了……","Win the whole thing for me, will you?":"替我拿下冠軍吧，好嗎？","Welcome to the stage, challenger! I am Tucker, the Dome Ace, and this crowd came to see a show. Let us give them one!":"歡迎登上舞台，挑戰者！我是巨蛋超級巨星石南，觀眾們是來看精彩表演的。讓我們好好表演一場吧！","The crowd is roaring for you this time! But the star of this Dome is still me!":"這次觀眾都在為你歡呼！不過這座巨蛋的巨星依然是我！","Bravo! The crowd loves you. This is yours, champion.":"精彩！觀眾都愛上你了。這個歸你了，冠軍。","What a finale! Today the Dome has a new star.":"多麼精彩的決賽！今天，巨蛋誕生了新的巨星。","Favors tricky status moves.":"擅長使用變化招式。","Favors all-out attacks.":"擅長全力進攻。","Mixes attacks and tricks.":"攻守平衡。","Rank {rank}. {style} Trained for {stat}.":"排名第 {rank}。{style}主要能力：{stat}。","Welcome to the Battle Dome! Here, sixteen Trainers battle in a tournament.":"歡迎來到對戰巨蛋！在這裡，16 位訓練家會進行淘汰賽。","Enter three Pokémon. Before each match, you choose two of them to battle.":"請報名 3 隻寶可夢。每場比賽前，從中選 2 隻出戰。","Win four matches in a row to become the champion and earn Battle Points. Before each match, you may look at the tournament tree and at your opponent's data.":"連贏 4 場就能成為冠軍，獲得對戰點數。每場比賽前，可以查看對陣表和對手的資料。","Tournaments won in a row: {n}. Your best: {best}.":"連續奪冠次數：{n}。最佳紀錄：{best}。","{round}: your opponent is {foe}.":"{round}：你的對手是{foe}。","What will you do?":"要怎麼做？","Opponent's data":"對手資料","You retired from the tournament.":"你退出了這次冠軍賽。","In the final, the Dome Ace takes the stage himself!":"決賽中，巨蛋超級巨星親自登場了！","You are out of the tournament. Please try again!":"你被淘汰了。請再接再厲！","You won! On to the next round.":"你贏了！進入下一輪。","Congratulations! You won the tournament!":"恭喜！你拿下了冠軍！","Tucker recognizes your tactics. You earned the Silver Tactics Symbol!":"石南認可了你的戰術。你得到了銀色戰術象徵！","Tucker recognizes your tactics. You earned the Gold Tactics Symbol!":"石南認可了你的戰術。你得到了金色戰術象徵！","Look at the tournament tree before each match. The better ranked Trainers usually win their way through, but not always.":"每場比賽前看看對陣表吧。排名高的訓練家通常會晉級，不過也不一定。","Your opponent's data shows their three Pokémon. They will send out the two that do best against yours, so choose your two well.":"對手資料裡能看到他們的 3 隻寶可夢。他們會派出最能克制你的 2 隻，所以你也要好好挑選。","They say the Dome Ace himself waits in the final of every fifth tournament for a Trainer who keeps winning.":"聽說對於一直贏下去的訓練家，巨蛋超級巨星會在每第 5 次冠軍賽的決賽裡親自等著。","Ross":"羅斯","Vince":"文斯","Jamal":"賈馬爾","Tess":"苔絲","Welcome to the Battle Dome! This counter is for the double battle tournament.":"歡迎來到對戰巨蛋！這個櫃檯負責雙打淘汰賽。","Enter three Pokémon. Before each match, you choose two of them, and both battle at once in a double battle.":"請報名 3 隻寶可夢。每場比賽前從中選兩隻，兩隻會一起上場進行雙打。","Only in the single battle tournament, mind you. In the double battle tournament, your two Pokémon fight side by side against two.":"不過只限單打淘汰賽哦。在雙打淘汰賽裡，你的兩隻寶可夢會並肩對抗對手的兩隻。","Rented Pokémon, rented luck. Let us see whose choices were better!":"租來的寶可夢，租來的運氣。來看看誰選得更好吧！","I picked my team in under a minute. That is all I needed!":"我不到一分鐘就選好了隊伍。這樣就夠了！","You do not know my Pokémon, and I do not know yours. Fair enough!":"你不了解我的寶可夢，我也不了解你的。很公平！","A good Trainer can win with any Pokémon. Prove it!":"好的訓練家用什麼寶可夢都能贏。證明給我看吧！","I have studied every rental in this place. Ready?":"這裡的每一隻租借寶可夢我都研究過了。準備好了嗎？","Your picks were better than mine...":"你選得比我好……","You made those rentals look like your own.":"那些租來的寶可夢在你手上，就像是你自己的一樣。","I should have chosen differently...":"我應該選別的才對……","Well played. Maybe you would like one of mine?":"打得漂亮。要不要換一隻我的寶可夢？","So you are the one winning with rentals! I am Noland, the Factory Head. Here, knowing Pokémon matters more than owning them. Let me see what you know!":"原來用租借寶可夢連連獲勝的就是你！我是工廠頭目達拉。在這裡，了解寶可夢比擁有寶可夢更重要。讓我看看你懂多少吧！","Back again? This time I thought it all through. My rentals are ready for you!":"又來了？這次我可是全都想好了。我的租借寶可夢已經準備好了！","Ha! You really know your Pokémon. You earned this.":"哈！你是真的很了解寶可夢。這是你應得的。","Amazing... There is nothing left I can teach you about Pokémon.":"了不起……關於寶可夢，我已經沒有什麼能教你的了。","{mon} holding {item}: {moves}.":"{mon}（攜帶{item}）：{moves}。","Choose rental Pokémon {k} of {n}.":"請選擇第 {k} 隻租借寶可夢（共 {n} 隻）。","Will you battle with these Pokémon?":"要用這些寶可夢出戰嗎？","Would you like to swap one of your Pokémon for one your opponent used?":"要不要用你的一隻寶可夢，換一隻對手剛才用過的寶可夢？","No thanks":"不用了","Give up":"交出","Which Pokémon will you give up?":"要交出哪隻寶可夢？","Which Pokémon will you take?":"要換來哪隻寶可夢？","{old} went back to the Factory, and {mon} joined your team.":"{old}回到了工廠，{mon}加入了你的隊伍。","Welcome to the Battle Factory! This counter is for double battles.":"歡迎來到對戰工廠！這裡是雙打對戰的櫃檯。","Welcome to the Battle Factory! This counter is for single battles.":"歡迎來到對戰工廠！這裡是單打對戰的櫃檯。","Here, you battle with rented Pokémon. Out of the six we offer, choose three for single battles, or four for double battles.":"在這裡要用租借的寶可夢對戰。從我們提供的 6 隻裡，單打選 3 隻，雙打選 4 隻。","After each win, you may swap one of your Pokémon for one that your opponent used.":"每贏一場，你都可以用自己的一隻寶可夢，換一隻對手用過的寶可夢。","Win seven in a row to finish a set and earn Battle Points. The more you win, the stronger the rentals and your opponents become.":"連勝 7 場就完成一輪，可以獲得對戰點數。贏得越多，租借寶可夢和對手就會越強。","These are the six Pokémon we can rent to you.":"這些是我們可以租給你的 6 隻寶可夢。","The Factory Head has come to battle you himself!":"工廠頭目親自前來和你對戰了！","Noland recognizes your knowledge. You earned the Silver Knowledge Symbol!":"達拉認可了你的知識。你得到了銀色知識象徵！","Noland recognizes your knowledge. You earned the Gold Knowledge Symbol!":"達拉認可了你的知識。你得到了金色知識象徵！","Your rentals go back to the Factory. Next time, you will rent new ones and start from battle No. {n}.":"租借的寶可夢要還給工廠了。下次你會租到新的寶可夢，並從第 {n} 場開始。","Nobody here battles with their own Pokémon. What wins at the Battle Factory is knowing what each rental can do.":"這裡沒有人用自己的寶可夢對戰。在對戰工廠，能贏的是了解每隻租借寶可夢能做什麼的人。","Read the moves and the held item of each Pokémon before you rent it. And after a win, the Pokémon you just beat may be better than one of yours!":"租借之前，先看看每隻寶可夢的招式和攜帶的道具。還有，贏了之後，剛被你打敗的寶可夢說不定比你手上的更好哦！","They say the Factory Head battles in person against Trainers who win twenty-one single battles in a row.":"聽說單打連勝 21 場的訓練家，工廠頭目會親自出來和他們對戰。","Please, give it back! That meteorite is the fruit of years of my research!":"求求你們還給我！那塊隕石是我多年研究的成果啊！","Research? Professor, this stone holds more power than you know. Poured into the volcano, it will make the land grow, and people need more land to live on.":"研究？博士，這塊石頭蘊藏的力量遠超你的想像。把它的能量注入火山，陸地就會擴張，而人們需要更多的土地來生活。","Boss! A kid followed us in here!":"老大！有個小鬼跟著我們進來了！","So you are the child who keeps meddling with Team Aqua. I am Maxie, the leader of Team Magma. The land will grow, and nobody will stop it.":"原來你就是一直在跟海洋隊糾纏的那個小孩。我是熔岩隊的首領赤焰松。陸地終將擴張，誰也阻止不了。","Maxie! I knew we would find you here.":"赤焰松！我就知道會在這裡找到你。","Archie. Late, as always. The meteorite is ours. Team Magma, to Mt. Chimney!":"水梧桐，還是一樣慢吞吞。隕石已經是我們的了。熔岩隊，前往煙囪山！","Team Magma wants to make the land bigger by heating up the volcano. If they get their way, the sea will shrink! That I will never allow.":"熔岩隊想加熱火山，讓陸地變大。要是讓他們得逞，大海就會縮小！我絕不允許。","Kid, they are heading for the top of Mt. Chimney. Their grunts will not be guarding the cable car on Route 112 any more. We are going too!":"小鬼，他們要去煙囪山頂。112號道路纜車那裡不會再有他們的手下看守了。我們也走！","My meteorite... I thought they wanted to help with my research. I will go home to Fallarbor and wait. I hope somebody can get it back...":"我的隕石……我還以為他們是想幫忙我的研究。我回秋葉鎮的家等著吧。希望有人能把它拿回來……","Go-Goggles! Those would keep the sand out of your eyes. But the storm is so wild today that nobody can even find the path. Better wait until it dies down.":"是ＧＯＧＯ護目鏡！有了它沙子就不會進眼睛了。不過今天沙暴大得連路都找不到。還是等它小一點再說吧。","A sandstorm rages in the desert ahead. Without goggles, the sand would blind you after a few steps.":"前面的沙漠颳著沙暴。沒有護目鏡的話，走不了幾步眼睛就會被沙子迷住。","My husband came home looking so sad. Those people in red took his precious meteorite...":"我丈夫回來的時候好傷心。那些穿紅衣服的人搶走了他珍貴的隕石……","Some people in red hoods asked my husband to take them to Meteor Falls. He was so happy that someone cared about his research...":"有幾個戴紅色兜帽的人請我丈夫帶他們去流星瀑布。終於有人關心他的研究，他高興得不得了……","Meteor Falls is north-west of town, past Route 114.":"流星瀑布在鎮子的西北邊，穿過114號道路就到。","Thank you again. I will keep studying this meteorite, and one day I will learn where it came from.":"再次謝謝你。我會繼續研究這塊隕石，總有一天會弄清楚它是從哪裡來的。","Is that... my meteorite? You brought it back from Mt. Chimney!":"這是……我的隕石？你把它從煙囪山帶回來了！","{player} gave the meteorite back to Professor Cozmo.":"{player}把隕石還給了Cozmo博士。","Thank you! Please, take this. It is TM27, Return: the more a Pokémon loves its Trainer, the harder it hits.":"謝謝你！請收下這個。這是招式學習器27，報恩：寶可夢越喜歡訓練家，威力就越大。","They took my meteorite up Mt. Chimney... What could they want with it? I study the sky, not volcanoes...":"他們把我的隕石帶上煙囪山了……他們到底想拿它做什麼？我研究的是天空，又不是火山……","Welcome to the Mt. Chimney Cable Car! Shall we take you up to the summit?":"歡迎搭乘煙囪山纜車！要送您到山頂嗎？","The cable car swayed gently as it climbed the steep side of Mt. Chimney...":"纜車輕輕搖晃著，沿著煙囪山陡峭的山坡往上爬……","This is the summit of Mt. Chimney. Please watch your step: the ground is hot!":"這裡是煙囪山的山頂。請小心腳下：地面很燙！","Professor Cozmo":"Cozmo博士","Cozmo's Wife":"Cozmo博士的妻子","Attendant":"工作人員","Travis":"崔維斯","I camped right by the desert last night. Sand got into everything, even my battle plans!":"昨晚我就在沙漠邊露營。沙子鑽進了所有東西裡，連我的對戰計劃都是！","Buried in the sand...":"被沙子埋了……","Sandshrew loves the desert. It curls up into a ball when the sandstorm gets too strong.":"穿山鼠最喜歡沙漠了。沙暴太強的時候，牠會把身體蜷成一團。","Irene":"艾琳","A picnic is no fun without a battle first!":"野餐之前不先對戰一場就沒意思了！","My sandwiches went flat...":"我的三明治被壓扁了……","Mt. Chimney is to the west. I would love a picnic at the top, but they say the cable car is closed.":"煙囪山在西邊。真想去山頂野餐，可是聽說纜車停開了。","Hayden":"海登","My flames burn hotter than the desert sun!":"我的火焰比沙漠的太陽還要熾熱！","Snuffed out...":"被撲滅了……","Fire types love the heat around Mt. Chimney. Lavaridge Town, at its foot, has the hottest Gym in Hoenn.":"火屬性寶可夢最喜歡煙囪山一帶的熱氣了。山腳下的釜炎鎮有豐緣最火熱的道館。","Slipped off the trail...":"從山路上滑下來了……","Mt. Chimney is a volcano, you know. The Fiery Path goes right through it to the other side.":"煙囪山可是一座火山哦。火焰小徑直接穿過山體通到另一邊。","Trent":"特倫特","I carried these Pokémon up a hundred mountains. Now they can carry me to victory!":"我背著這些寶可夢爬過上百座山。現在輪到牠們帶我走向勝利了！","What a rockslide...":"真是一場山崩……","The ledge to the west comes down from Lavaridge Town. You cannot climb back up that way.":"西邊的崖坡是從釜炎鎮下來的。從那裡是爬不回去的。","Team Magma is using the cable car today. Nobody else goes up the mountain!":"今天纜車被熔岩隊包下了。其他人一律不准上山！","Our boss went off to Meteor Falls with some professor... Hey, forget I said that!":"我們老大跟一個博士去流星瀑布了……喂，當我沒說！","Phew, it is hot! Steam comes up through the rock everywhere. Grimer and Koffing love the fumes in here.":"呼，好熱！岩石裡到處都在冒蒸氣。臭泥和瓦斯彈最喜歡這裡的煙了。","Lawrence":"勞倫斯","The ash on this road is warm and soft. Perfect for a battle!":"這條路上的火山灰又暖又軟。最適合對戰了！","Covered in ash...":"滿身都是灰……","Spinda's spots are different on every single one. No two are alike!":"每隻晃晃斑的斑點都不一樣。找不到兩隻相同的！","Sophie":"蘇菲","Ash fell in my lunch box again. Now I am in a bad mood. Battle!":"火山灰又掉進我的便當裡了。我現在心情很差。來對戰！","Not my day at all...":"今天真倒楣……","Fallarbor Town is just west of here. Its Pokémon Center is a good place to shake off the ash.":"秋葉鎮就在西邊。去那裡的寶可夢中心抖掉身上的火山灰吧。","Jaylen":"傑倫","My bird Pokémon fly right through the falling ash!":"我的鳥寶可夢能直接穿過飄落的火山灰飛行！","Swablu's wings are as soft as cotton. It loves to sit on people's heads.":"青綿鳥的翅膀像棉花一樣柔軟。牠最喜歡停在人的頭上。","The ash from Mt. Chimney makes our fields rich. Everything grows well here!":"煙囪山的火山灰讓我們的田地很肥沃。這裡種什麼都長得好！","Professor Cozmo lives in the house by the fields. He studies meteorites: stones that fell from the sky!":"Cozmo博士住在田邊的那棟房子裡。他研究隕石，就是從天上掉下來的石頭！","West of town, Route 114 leads to Meteor Falls. They say a shower of falling stars made the falls long ago.":"從鎮子往西，114號道路通往流星瀑布。據說很久以前是一場流星雨造就了那片瀑布。","Travellers pass through Fallarbor on their way to Meteor Falls. Everyone wants to see the place where the stars fell.":"去流星瀑布的旅人都會經過秋葉鎮。大家都想看看星星墜落的地方。","Ash gets in everywhere here, even inside the Mart. They sweep three times a day!":"這裡火山灰無孔不入，連商店裡面都有。店員一天要掃三次地！","Pokémon Contests are held in the hall across the road: Pokémon show off how cool or cute they are. It is closed for now, though.":"馬路對面的會場會舉辦華麗大賽：寶可夢在那裡展示自己有多帥氣或多可愛。不過現在暫時關閉了。","The river here is full of fish, and my Pokémon are full of fight!":"這條河裡全是魚，我的寶可夢也全是鬥志！","Barboach hides in the mud at the bottom of the river. They say it can feel an earthquake before it comes.":"泥泥鰍躲在河底的泥巴裡。聽說牠能在地震來臨前就感覺到。","I am on my way to Meteor Falls, to see where the stars came down!":"我正要去流星瀑布，看看星星落下的地方！","I am seeing stars...":"眼冒金星……","Meteor Falls is through the cave mouth to the north-west. Bring sturdy boots!":"流星瀑布在西北邊的洞口裡面。記得穿雙結實的鞋！","I was picking flowers by the river. A battle first, though!":"我正在河邊摘花。不過先來對戰吧！","My flowers got trampled...":"我的花被踩爛了……","Lotad likes to float down the river and nap in the sun.":"蓮葉童子喜歡順著河水漂流，在陽光下打瞌睡。","North: the desert. A sandstorm blows there day and night, so the road is closed for now.":"北：沙漠。那裡日夜颳著沙暴，道路目前封閉。","Route 111. South: Mauville City. West: Route 112 and Mt. Chimney.":"111號道路。南：紫堇市。西：112號道路和煙囪山。","Route 112. East: Route 111. North: the Mt. Chimney Cable Car and the Fiery Path.":"112號道路。東：111號道路。北：煙囪山纜車和火焰小徑。","Mt. Chimney Cable Car. To the summit in a few minutes!":"煙囪山纜車。幾分鐘就能到山頂！","The Fiery Path. It is hot inside: mind your step!":"火焰小徑。裡面很熱：請小心腳下！","Route 113. West: Fallarbor Town. Ash from Mt. Chimney falls on this road all year round.":"113號道路。西：秋葉鎮。煙囪山的火山灰一年到頭都落在這條路上。","Fallarbor Town. A quiet farming town where the ash falls like soft snow.":"秋葉鎮。火山灰如細雪般飄落的寧靜農村。","Pokémon Contest Hall. The stage where Pokémon show off their charm.":"寶可夢華麗大賽會場。寶可夢展現魅力的舞台。","Route 114. East: Fallarbor Town. North-west: Meteor Falls.":"114號道路。東：秋葉鎮。西北：流星瀑布。","The sandstorm died down when the weather went back to normal. With goggles on, you can cross the desert now.":"天氣恢復正常以後，沙暴也減弱了。現在戴上護目鏡，就能穿過沙漠了。","Glass Workshop. We turn the ash of Route 113 into glass.":"玻璃工房。我們把113號道路的火山灰做成玻璃。","{player}! I heard you chased Team Aqua out of the Weather Institute. Dad will be so impressed!":"{player}！聽說你把海洋隊趕出了天氣研究所。爸爸一定會很佩服的！","I have been training hard since Route 110. This time I am going to win for real!":"從110號道路之後我一直在努力訓練。這次我一定要贏！","Still not enough... You and your Pokémon really are a team.":"還是不夠……你和你的寶可夢真是好搭檔。","I won! I knew all that training would pay off!":"我贏了！我就知道訓練不會白費！","Fortree City is just up ahead. Its Gym Leader, Winona, flies like the wind. Good luck!":"茵鬱市就在前面了。那裡的道館館主娜琪飛得像風一樣快。祝你好運！","Team Aqua does not need this place any more. We know how to call the rain now... Let's go!":"海洋隊已經用不著這裡了。我們已經知道怎麼召喚雨水了……走吧！","Thank you! They wanted our research on rain and storms... I dread to think what they mean to do with it.":"謝謝你！他們想要我們關於降雨和暴風雨的研究……真不敢想像他們打算拿來做什麼。","Please, take this Pokémon as thanks. It is Castform: its form changes with the weather!":"請收下這隻寶可夢作為謝禮。牠是飄浮泡泡：牠的樣子會隨著天氣改變！","Thank you for saving the institute! We can get back to our forecasts now.":"謝謝你救了研究所！我們終於可以回去做天氣預報了。","Team Aqua burst in and took over! They want our research on rain and storms... The chief is upstairs!":"海洋隊闖進來把這裡佔領了！他們想要我們關於降雨和暴風雨的研究……所長在樓上！","Castform changes its form with the weather: sunshine, rain or hail. It is a weather forecast with a face!":"飄浮泡泡會隨著天氣改變樣子：晴天、雨天或冰雹。簡直就是長了臉的天氣預報！","Help! That woman says Team Aqua will use our research to bring endless rain!":"救命！那個女人說海洋隊要用我們的研究帶來下不完的雨！","Team Aqua is borrowing this place. Scram!":"海洋隊徵用這裡了。滾開！","Our Admin is upstairs. She will deal with you!":"我們的幹部在樓上。她會收拾你的！","The weather data in here is just what our boss needs. Keep out!":"這裡的氣象數據正是我們老大需要的。別進來！","Tch...":"嘖……","With the sea and the rain on our side, Team Aqua cannot lose!":"有大海和雨水站在我們這邊，海洋隊不可能輸！","You made it up here? Then you will have to get past me!":"你居然上來了？那你得先過我這關！","Shelly will not go easy on you. She never does.":"阿泉可不會手下留情。她從來不會。","Ahaha! So you are the brat who keeps getting in Team Aqua's way. The research in this place is ours now: we need to know how to bring the rain!":"啊哈哈！原來你就是老在妨礙海洋隊的小鬼。這裡的研究現在歸我們了：我們得知道怎麼把雨召來！","Ahaha... I lost? Fine. We have what we came for anyway.":"啊哈哈……我輸了？算了。反正我們要的東西已經到手了。","{player}! Good timing. Something I cannot see is blocking this bridge. Watch...":"{player}！來得正好。有個看不見的東西擋在橋上。你看……","Steven held up the Devon Scope. An invisible Pokémon appeared on the bridge!":"大吾舉起了得文偵測鏡。一隻看不見的寶可夢出現在橋上了！","That was a Kecleon. It changes the colour of its body to blend into whatever is around it.":"那是變隱龍。牠會改變身體的顏色，和周圍融為一體。","This Devon Scope was made by my father's company. I have a feeling you will need it more than I do. Take it.":"這個得文偵測鏡是我父親的公司做的。我覺得你會比我更需要它。拿去吧。","Use it on anything that blocks your way but cannot be seen. Until next time, {player}!":"遇到看不見卻擋住去路的東西，就用它吧。下次見，{player}！","Something you cannot see is standing in the doorway. You cannot get past it.":"有個看不見的東西擋在門口。你過不去。","{player} used the Devon Scope! A Kecleon was hiding in the doorway!":"{player}使用了得文偵測鏡！原來有隻變隱龍躲在門口！","The way into the Gym is clear now.":"現在可以進入道館了。","The sky over Hoenn is wide. I hope you keep flying higher, {player}.":"豐緣的天空很遼闊。希望你能越飛越高，{player}。","Yo, Champion! Winona uses Flying-type Pokémon. Electric, Ice and Rock moves will bring them back down to earth!":"嘿，冠軍！娜琪用的是飛行屬性的寶可夢。電、冰和岩石屬性的招式能把牠們打回地面！","Careful with her Altaria: it is part Dragon, and it knows Earthquake!":"小心她的七夕青鳥：牠也是龍屬性，而且會地震！","Please take the Feather Badge. You earned it in the most beautiful battle I have had in a long time.":"請收下羽翼徽章。這是我很久以來最美妙的一場對戰，你贏得了它。","{player} received the Feather Badge from Winona!":"{player}從娜琪那裡得到了羽翼徽章！","With six Hoenn badges, Pokémon up to level 60 will obey you, wherever they come from.":"有了六枚豐緣徽章，60級以下的寶可夢都會聽你的話，不管牠們來自哪裡。","And this is TM40, Aerial Ace. It strikes so fast that it never misses.":"這是招式學習器40，燕返。出招快得絕不會落空。","I am Winona, the Leader of the Fortree Gym. My bird Pokémon and I have soared through the skies together for years. Let us see if you can keep up!":"我是茵鬱道館的館主娜琪。我和我的鳥寶可夢已經一起翱翔天空好多年了。看看你能不能跟得上吧！","You flew higher than I ever imagined. I have never seen a Trainer guide their Pokémon so gracefully.":"你飛得比我想像的還要高。我從沒見過能如此優雅地指揮寶可夢的訓練家。","Institute Chief":"研究所所長","Hugh":"休","The rain hardly ever stops on Route 119. My birds do not mind one bit!":"119號道路幾乎天天下雨。我的鳥寶可夢一點也不在乎！","Soaked through...":"全身濕透了……","Tropius grows fruit around its neck. Children in the south love to eat it!":"熱帶龍的脖子上會長出果實。南方的孩子們最愛吃了！","This grass is so tall I can barely see you. Good thing my Zangoose can!":"這裡的草高得我都快看不見你了。還好我的貓鼬斬看得見！","Lost in the grass...":"迷失在草叢裡……","Zangoose and Seviper have been enemies forever. They fight whenever they meet.":"貓鼬斬和飯匙蛇自古以來就是死對頭。一碰面就打起來。","Shh! The fish are biting... Oh, all right, a battle first.":"噓！魚正在上鉤……唉，好吧，先對戰。","They all got away...":"全都跑掉了……","They say a rare fish hides in this river. It only bites in a few special spots.":"聽說這條河裡藏著一種稀有的魚。只有在少數幾個地方才釣得到。","Gwen":"格溫","I came to see the Weather Institute. Want to battle in the rain?":"我是來參觀天氣研究所的。要不要在雨中對戰？","My umbrella blew away...":"我的傘被吹走了……","The scientists at the Weather Institute can tell you what the weather will be tomorrow!":"天氣研究所的科學家能告訴你明天的天氣！","Everyone in Fortree lives up in the trees. The view from my window is amazing!":"茵鬱市的人都住在樹上。從我家窗戶看出去的風景超棒！","Something is wrong with the Gym. Whenever I try to go in, I bump into thin air!":"道館怪怪的。我每次想進去，都會撞到空氣！","East of town, Route 120 crosses a river on a long bridge. A young man with silver hair went that way.":"從城鎮往東，120號道路有一座長橋跨過河流。一個銀髮的年輕人往那邊去了。","Winona flies with her bird Pokémon every morning. She looks so free up there.":"娜琪每天早上都和她的鳥寶可夢一起飛翔。她在天上看起來好自由。","Flying types are weak to Electric, Ice and Rock moves. Keep that in mind before you visit the Gym!":"飛行屬性怕電、冰和岩石屬性的招式。去道館之前記住這一點！","Revive brings a fainted Pokémon back to the fight. Do not leave home without one!":"活力碎片能讓昏厥的寶可夢重新戰鬥。出門一定要帶一個！","This house is built around the trunk of a great tree. When the wind blows, the whole house sways a little.":"這棟房子是繞著一棵大樹的樹幹蓋的。風一吹，整棟房子都會輕輕搖晃。","Kecleon can change colours to blend into anything around it. Some say they hide right in the middle of town!":"變隱龍能變色，和周圍的任何東西融為一體。聽說有的就躲在城鎮正中央！","Winona taught us to battle like the wind. Let me show you!":"娜琪教我們像風一樣對戰。讓我展示給你看！","Blown off course...":"被吹偏了……","Winona never loses her calm, even when her Pokémon are in trouble. That is what makes her strong.":"娜琪就算寶可夢陷入困境也從不慌張。這正是她強大的地方。","Darius":"達瑞斯","My Pokémon read the wind before they take off. Can you read it too?":"我的寶可夢起飛前會先看風向。你也會看嗎？","The wind turned...":"風向變了……","Xatu stares at the sun all day. They say it can see the future in it.":"天然鳥整天盯著太陽。聽說牠能從太陽裡看見未來。","Humberto":"胡貝托","Skarmory's wings are as hard as steel. Your attacks will just bounce off!":"盔甲鳥的翅膀像鋼鐵一樣堅硬。你的攻擊只會被彈開！","Feathers of steel, and still...":"明明是鋼鐵的羽毛……","Skarmory is part Steel. Fire and Electric moves are what it fears most.":"盔甲鳥也是鋼屬性。牠最怕的是火和電屬性的招式。","Jennifer":"珍妮弗","I love the river under this bridge. Let us battle beside it!":"我最喜歡這座橋下的河了。我們就在河邊對戰吧！","Splash...":"撲通……","If you look closely at the bridge, sometimes it looks like the air is shimmering...":"仔細看那座橋的話，有時候好像空氣在閃爍……","Colin":"科林","My birds saw you coming from all the way across the river!":"我的鳥寶可夢從河對岸就看到你過來了！","Grounded again...":"又被打落地面了……","Natu cannot fly very well yet. It hops from branch to branch instead.":"天然雀還飛不太好。牠會在樹枝間跳來跳去。","Route 119. South: Route 118. North: Fortree City.":"119號道路。南：118號道路。北：茵鬱市。","Weather Institute. Studying the skies of Hoenn, rain or shine.":"天氣研究所。不論晴雨，研究豐緣的天空。","Fortree City. A city of homes built high up among the trees.":"茵鬱市。房子都建在高高樹上的城市。","Fortree City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Winona, who rides the wind with her bird Pokémon.":"茵鬱市寶可夢道館。館主：娜琪，與鳥寶可夢一同乘風翱翔的人。","Route 120. West: Fortree City. Over the bridge, the road turns south.":"120號道路。西：茵鬱市。過了橋，道路轉向南方。","South: Route 121, to Lilycove City.":"南：121號道路，通往水靜市。","Ancient Tomb. Nobody remembers who built it, or what sleeps inside.":"古代墓穴。沒有人記得是誰建造了它，也不知道裡面沉睡著什麼。","Glassblower":"玻璃工匠","Mt. Chimney drops its ash on this road every single day. Everyone else sweeps it away. I melt it down and blow it into glass!":"煙囪山每天都把火山灰灑在這條路上。別人都把灰掃掉，我卻把它熔化，吹成玻璃！","If you want something made, bring me ash. Here, collect it in this.":"想讓我做點東西的話，就把火山灰帶來。來，用這個收集吧。","Walk through the ashy grass outside and the ash drops right into the sack. Come back when it feels heavy.":"走過外面積了火山灰的草叢，灰就會掉進袋子裡。等袋子沉甸甸的時候再回來吧。","No Soot Sack, no ash. And no ash, no glass!":"沒有集灰袋就沒有火山灰，沒有火山灰就沒有玻璃！","Let me have a look in that sack of yours...":"讓我看看你的袋子……","Hardly any ash in here yet. Walk {n} more steps through the ashy grass and I can make you a {item}.":"裡面幾乎沒有灰。再在積灰的草叢裡走{n}步，我就能幫你做{item}了。","Now that is a fine heap of ash!":"這可是一大堆火山灰啊！","{item} ({n} steps of ash)":"{item}（{n}步的灰）","What shall I make for you?":"要我幫你做什麼呢？","Nothing? Your ash will keep. Come back when you have made up your mind.":"什麼都不要嗎？你的灰我會留著，想好了再來吧。","A {item} takes the ash of {n} steps. You need {left} more. Pick something else?":"做{item}要{n}步的灰，你還差{left}步。要換別的嗎？","A {item}, for the ash of {n} steps. Shall I make it?":"{item}，要用{n}步的灰。要做嗎？","Leave it to me!":"交給我吧！","There! Freshly blown, still warm from the fire.":"好了！剛吹好的，還帶著爐火的溫度呢。","Blowing into a glass flute makes the clearest sound you ever heard. One day I will make my own!":"吹玻璃哨會發出你聽過最清亮的聲音。總有一天我要自己做一個！","So you followed us all the way up here. Look: the meteorite is already in the machine.":"你居然一路跟到這裡來了。看吧：隕石已經裝進機器裡了。","Its energy will stir the magma deep below. The volcano will pour new land into the sea, and people will finally have room to live!":"它的能量會攪動地底深處的岩漿。火山會把新的陸地傾瀉進大海，人們終於能有地方生活了！","I will not let a child stand in the way of that. Come!":"我不會讓一個小孩擋住這一切。來吧！","Beaten by a child... Perhaps our plan was not as ready as I believed.":"居然輸給了一個小孩……看來我們的計劃還沒有我想的那麼周全。","Keep the meteorite. Team Magma has no use for it... for now. Team Magma, we are leaving!":"隕石你拿去吧。熔岩隊暫時……用不著它了。熔岩隊，撤退！","You beat Maxie? Ha! Not bad at all, kid. Team Magma ran off down the mountain.":"你打敗了赤焰松？哈！真不賴嘛，小鬼。熔岩隊已經逃下山了。","But do not think Team Aqua owes you anything. The sea is our business. Stay out of it!":"不過別以為海洋隊欠你什麼。大海是我們的事。你少插手！","Is the Egg keeping warm? The hot sand gave it a good start, I am sure.":"蛋還暖和嗎？熱沙子一定讓它有了個好開始。","I found this Egg warming itself in the hot sand. I am too old to raise a Pokémon. Would you take it?":"我發現這顆蛋在熱沙子裡取暖。我年紀太大，養不了寶可夢了。你願意收下它嗎？","Take the Egg?":"要收下蛋嗎？","Oh well. It is quite cosy where it is.":"那好吧。它在那裡也挺舒服的。","Keep it with you as you travel, and it will hatch before long.":"旅行時把它帶在身邊，它很快就會孵化的。","{player}! You beat Flannery? That makes four Hoenn badges already!":"{player}！你打敗亞莎了？這樣就已經有四枚豐緣的徽章了！","Dad asked me to give you these. They are Go-Goggles: with them you can face the sandstorm in the desert on Route 111.":"爸爸讓我把這個交給你。這是ＧＯＧＯ護目鏡：戴上它就能抵擋111號道路沙漠裡的沙暴。","Oh, and with four badges you can challenge Norman, the Gym Leader of Petalburg City. They say he is the toughest yet!":"對了，有四枚徽章就能挑戰橙華市的道館館主千里了。聽說他是目前最強的！","I am off to look for more Pokémon. See you around, {player}!":"我要去找更多寶可夢了。再見，{player}！","I will keep training until I am a Leader everyone can count on. Come back and battle me again sometime!":"我會繼續努力，直到成為大家都能依靠的道館館主。有空再來和我對戰吧！","Hold it right there! The boss is busy, and I, Tabitha, will not let you near him!":"站住！老大正忙著，我火村絕不會讓你靠近他！","Hmph... The boss will not go down so easily.":"哼……老大可沒那麼容易被打倒。","Shall we take you back down to Route 112?":"要送您回112號道路嗎？","The cable car glided down the side of the mountain...":"纜車順著山坡緩緩滑下……","We have arrived at the foot of Mt. Chimney. Please come again!":"我們已經到達煙囪山山腳。歡迎再次搭乘！","Please enjoy the view from the summit!":"請盡情欣賞山頂的風景！","Yo, Champion! Flannery's Gym is full of Fire types. Water, Ground and Rock types will keep you cool in here!":"嘿，冠軍！亞莎的道館全是火屬性的寶可夢。水、地面和岩石屬性能讓你在這裡保持冷靜！","Watch out for Sunny Day: in the sunshine, Fire moves burn even hotter and Water moves lose their punch.":"小心大晴天：陽光下，火屬性招式會更猛烈，水屬性招式則會變弱。","A Grass type would have a rough time here. If your partner is a Grovyle, bring a friend who can stand the heat!":"草屬性在這裡會很辛苦。如果你的搭檔是森林蜥蜴，記得帶個耐熱的夥伴！","Here, the Heat Badge. You earned it fair and square!":"給你，火熱徽章。這是你堂堂正正贏來的！","{player} received the Heat Badge from Flannery!":"{player}從亞莎那裡得到了火熱徽章！","With four Hoenn badges, Pokémon up to level 40 will obey you, wherever they come from.":"有了四枚豐緣徽章，40級以下的寶可夢都會聽你的話，不管牠們來自哪裡。","Take this too: TM50, Overheat. It is the hottest Fire move there is, but it leaves the user worn out afterwards.":"這個也給你：招式學習器50，過熱。這是最熾熱的火屬性招式，不過用完之後會很疲憊。","Old Woman":"老奶奶","You came up on the cable car? Too bad: Team Magma owns this mountain today!":"你是坐纜車上來的？可惜：今天這座山是熔岩隊的地盤！","Melted...":"熔化了……","The boss says the meteorite will wake up the volcano. Then the land will grow and grow!":"老大說隕石會喚醒火山。然後陸地就會越來越大！","Not one step closer to the crater! The boss is busy!":"不准再靠近火山口一步！老大正忙著呢！","Too hot to handle...":"太燙了，招架不住……","Team Aqua thinks the sea should cover everything. We know better: people need land!":"海洋隊以為大海應該淹沒一切。我們才明白：人們需要的是陸地！","Go on, then. See what the boss thinks of you.":"那你就去吧。看看老大怎麼收拾你。","Maxie is up by the crater with that meteorite. We will keep his grunts busy: go and stop him!":"赤焰松拿著那塊隕石在火山口那邊。我們來拖住他的手下：你快去阻止他！","Leave this one to me! Go!":"這傢伙交給我！快去！","Team Aqua, always in the way! ...Hey, you too?":"海洋隊總是礙事！……喂，你也來了？","On a clear day you can see half of Hoenn from up here. Lavaridge Town is down the Jagged Pass, to the south.":"天氣晴朗時，從這裡能看到半個豐緣。往南走下凹凸山道就是釜炎鎮。","Eric":"埃里克","Going down is harder on the knees than going up! Let me rest them with a battle.":"下山比上山更傷膝蓋！讓我用一場對戰歇歇腳。","My knees gave out...":"膝蓋撐不住了……","Mind the ledges. Once you jump down, there is no climbing back up.":"小心崖坡。一旦跳下去就爬不回來了。","Autumn":"秋子","The hot springs in Lavaridge are waiting for me, but you are in my way!":"釜炎鎮的溫泉在等我，可是你擋住我的路了！","I need a long soak now...":"現在我需要好好泡個澡……","Spoink bounces on its tail all day long. They say it never stops, not even to sleep!":"跳跳豬一整天都用尾巴蹦跳。聽說牠從來不停下來，連睡覺都不停！","Ahh... Being buried in the warm sand does wonders for old bones. You should try it!":"啊……把身體埋在熱沙裡，對老骨頭可好了。你也該試試！","People come from all over Hoenn for these hot springs. Even Pokémon love the warm sand!":"大家從豐緣各地來泡這裡的溫泉。連寶可夢都喜歡溫暖的沙子！","Flannery only just became the Gym Leader. Her grandfather was the Leader before her!":"亞莎才剛當上道館館主。在她之前，館主是她的爺爺！","The road east goes down a ledge to Route 112. From there you can take the cable car up Mt. Chimney again.":"往東的路順著崖坡下到112號道路。從那裡可以再搭纜車上煙囪山。","After a battle, a soak in the hot springs and a rest at the Pokémon Center. That is the Lavaridge way!":"對戰之後泡個溫泉，再去寶可夢中心休息。這就是釜炎鎮的生活方式！","Burn Heal is a must if you are going to battle Flannery. A burn saps your Pokémon's strength every turn!":"要挑戰亞莎的話一定要帶灼傷藥。灼傷每回合都會消耗寶可夢的體力！","My grandfather used to say Mt. Chimney sleeps with one eye open. As long as nobody pokes it, it stays quiet.":"我爺爺常說，煙囪山是睜著一隻眼睛睡覺的。只要沒人去惹它，它就會安安靜靜的。","Cole":"科爾","Feel the heat? This Gym is hotter than the hot springs outside!":"感覺到熱了嗎？這座道館比外面的溫泉還熱！","I got burned...":"我被燙傷了……","Flannery's Pokémon love the sunshine. When the sun is out, their Fire moves get even stronger.":"亞莎的寶可夢最喜歡陽光了。出太陽的時候，牠們的火屬性招式會變得更強。","Gerald":"傑拉德","I came here to train in the heat. Let us see if you can take it!":"我來這裡是為了在高溫中修行。看看你受不受得了！","You kept your cool...":"你還真沉得住氣……","Torkoal puffs out black smoke when it is angry. It does not like having its stats lowered, either.":"煤炭龜生氣時會噴出黑煙。牠也不喜歡自己的能力被降低。","Jace":"傑斯","Flannery is fired up today. You will have to get through me first!":"亞莎今天鬥志高昂。你得先過我這一關！","Burned out...":"燃燒殆盡了……","Flannery tries to act tough, but she is really kind. She just took over the Gym from her grandfather.":"亞莎總是裝出一副很兇的樣子，其實她人很好。她剛從爺爺手上接下道館。","Welcome! I am Flannery, the Leader of this Gym. I only just took over... but my Fire Pokémon and I will not hold back. Let us heat things up!":"歡迎！我是這座道館的館主亞莎。我才剛接手……不過我和我的火屬性寶可夢可不會手下留情。讓氣氛熱起來吧！","Oh... I tried so hard to act like a proper Leader. Maybe I should just be myself. You battled beautifully!":"唉……我拼命想表現得像個真正的館主。也許我該做回自己才對。你打得真漂亮！","A machine Team Magma left behind. There is an empty slot in it, just the size of a meteorite.":"熔岩隊留下的機器。上面有個空槽，大小剛好能放下一塊隕石。","Mt. Chimney. South: the Jagged Pass, down to Lavaridge Town.":"煙囪山。南：凹凸山道，下山通往釜炎鎮。","The Jagged Pass. A steep, rocky path down to Lavaridge Town. There is no climbing back up!":"凹凸山道。陡峭多石的山路，通往山下的釜炎鎮。下去就上不來了！","Lavaridge Town. Hot springs bubble up at the foot of Mt. Chimney.":"釜炎鎮。溫泉在煙囪山腳下汩汩湧出。","Lavaridge Town Pokémon Gym. Leader: Flannery, whose battles are as hot as the springs!":"釜炎鎮寶可夢道館。館主：亞莎，她的對戰就像溫泉一樣火熱！","Go on, {player}. I will keep training here. Someday I will make it to the Champion too!":"去吧，{player}。我會繼續在這裡修行。總有一天，我也要走到冠軍面前！","{player}! I knew I would catch up with you here.":"{player}！我就知道能在這裡追上你。","Since our battle in Mauville, I have trained every single day. My body is stronger now, and so are my Pokémon. We came through all of Victory Road!":"自從在紫堇市和你對戰以後，我每天都在修行。現在我的身體變強了，我的寶可夢也是。我們走完了整條冠軍之路！","Before you challenge the League, I want to know how far I have come. {player}, please battle me!":"在你挑戰聯盟之前，我想知道自己成長了多少。{player}，請和我對戰吧！","...I lost. But I am not sad. I can see now how strong you really are.":"……我輸了。但我並不難過。現在我終於明白你到底有多強了。","Go on, {player}. The League is right outside. I will cheer for you!":"去吧，{player}。聯盟就在外面。我會為你加油的！","Welcome, {player}. I have been waiting for you since that day in Sootopolis.":"歡迎你，{player}。自從那天在琉璃市以後，我就一直在等你。","I am Wallace, the Champion of the Hoenn region. The bond you share with your Pokémon was enough to calm the sky itself. Now let me see it with my own eyes, here at the summit!":"我是豐緣地區的冠軍米可利。你和寶可夢之間的羈絆，連天空都能平息。現在，就在這巔峰之上，讓我親眼見識一下吧！","...It is over. You and your Pokémon are truly beautiful together. From today, you are Hoenn's Champion.":"……結束了。你和你的寶可夢在一起，真的非常美麗。從今天起，你就是豐緣的冠軍了。","Come with me. The Hall of Fame is waiting to remember you and your team.":"跟我來吧。殿堂正等著記住你和你的隊伍。","Back again, Champion? My Pokémon have grown even more graceful. Let us dance once more!":"又來了嗎，冠軍？我的寶可夢變得更加優雅了。再來共舞一曲吧！","Still the Champion, and still beautiful. I will be waiting for the next time.":"依然是冠軍，依然那麼美麗。我會等著下一次的。","The names of Hoenn's Champions and their Pokémon are kept here forever. Today, yours join them.":"豐緣歷代冠軍和他們的寶可夢的名字，會永遠留在這裡。今天，你們的名字也加入了。","The land, the sea and the sky of Hoenn are at peace, thanks to you. Go home and rest, Champion. You have earned it.":"多虧了你，豐緣的大地、大海和天空都恢復了平靜。回家好好休息吧，冠軍。這是你應得的。","Go on. Phoebe is next, and she has a few spooky friends waiting for you.":"去吧。下一個是芙蓉，她有幾個嚇人的朋友在等著你。","Glacia waits in the next room. Wrap up warm!":"波妮在下一個房間等著你。多穿點衣服吧！","The last of the Elite Four is Drake. He sailed the seas for many years. Be ready.":"四天王的最後一位是源治。他在海上航行了很多年。做好準備吧。","Go on. The Champion is waiting beyond that door.":"去吧。冠軍就在那扇門後面等著你。","Beyond this door are the Elite Four of Hoenn. You battle all four in a row, and then the Champion.":"這扇門後面就是豐緣的四天王。你要連續挑戰四個人，然後是冠軍。","A guard blocks the mouth of the cave: \"Only Trainers with all eight of Hoenn's badges may enter Victory Road.\"":"一個警衛擋在洞口：「只有集齊豐緣八枚徽章的訓練家才能進入冠軍之路。」","Victory Road is a maze of rock and water. You will need Strength, Surf and a lot of nerve.":"冠軍之路是由岩石和水組成的迷宮。你需要怪力、衝浪，還有很大的勇氣。","You made it through Victory Road? Then the League is right there. Good luck!":"你闖過冠軍之路了？那聯盟就在那邊。祝你好運！","Only Trainers with all eight of Hoenn's badges may enter Victory Road. The guards check every one.":"只有集齊豐緣八枚徽章的訓練家才能進入冠軍之路。警衛會一枚一枚檢查。","Only the strongest Trainers make it through Victory Road. Are you one of them?":"只有最強的訓練家才能闖過冠軍之路。你是其中之一嗎？","The road goes down and across an underground river. Keep going!":"這條路會往下，穿過一條地下河。繼續前進吧！","I have come so far, and I am not turning back now!":"我都走了這麼遠了，現在絕不會回頭！","I will have to try again next year...":"只好明年再來挑戰了……","Altaria's cotton wings are softer than clouds. Its Dragon moves are not, though.":"七夕青鳥的棉花翅膀比雲還要柔軟。不過牠的龍屬性招式可一點都不軟。","The exit is right there, but you will have to get past me first!":"出口就在那邊，不過你得先過我這一關！","So close to the League, and I lost...":"離聯盟這麼近，我卻輸了……","The League is just outside. Heal up before you go in.":"聯盟就在外面。進去之前先恢復一下寶可夢吧。","Caroline":"卡羅琳","The river below Victory Road is the last test. And I am the test before it!":"冠軍之路底下的河是最後的考驗。而我就是那之前的考驗！","You passed. With flying colours.":"你通過了。而且是滿分。","Surf across the river. The ladder up to the exit is on the other side.":"用衝浪渡過河吧。通往出口的梯子在對岸。","Owen":"歐文","You crossed the river? Impressive. But can you get past me?":"你渡過河了？真厲害。不過你過得了我這關嗎？","The ladder up leads to the last stretch of Victory Road.":"往上的梯子通往冠軍之路的最後一段。","Hoenn's Elite Four use Dark, Ghost, Ice and Dragon Pokémon. And the Champion? Nobody ever says.":"豐緣的四天王用的是惡、幽靈、冰和龍屬性的寶可夢。那冠軍呢？從來沒有人說過。","Sidney of the Elite Four, at your service. You have got a fire in your eyes. Good! Let us have a battle nobody here will ever forget!":"我是四天王的花月，請多指教。你眼裡燃著火焰呢。很好！來一場誰都忘不了的對戰吧！","Well, look at that. You beat me fair and square.":"哎呀，你看看。你堂堂正正地贏了我。","Back again, Champion? My Dark Pokémon have been itching for a rematch!":"又來了嗎，冠軍？我的惡屬性寶可夢早就等不及要再戰一場了！","I am Phoebe of the Elite Four. I trained on Mt. Pyre, where the spirits rest, and my Ghost Pokémon and I share a bond deeper than words. Can you feel it?":"我是四天王的芙蓉。我在靈魂安息的送神山修行過，我和幽靈寶可夢之間的羈絆深得無法用言語形容。你感受得到嗎？","Oh... I lost. The bond between you and your Pokémon is strong too.":"哦……我輸了。你和寶可夢之間的羈絆也很強呢。","Welcome back, Champion. My Ghost Pokémon remember you well...":"歡迎回來，冠軍。我的幽靈寶可夢都還記得你呢……","I am Glacia of the Elite Four. I came to Hoenn looking for a Trainer whose fire could melt my ice. So far, none has. Will you be the first?":"我是四天王的波妮。我來到豐緣，是為了尋找能用熱情融化我的冰的訓練家。到現在還沒有一個人做到。你會是第一個嗎？","Such passion... Your fire melted my ice after all.":"好強的熱情……你的火焰終究還是融化了我的冰。","Champion. Has your fire grown hotter? My ice has only grown colder.":"冠軍。你的火焰變得更熾熱了嗎？我的冰可是變得更冷了。","I am Drake, the last of the Elite Four. To command Dragons, a Trainer needs a heart that is both strong and kind. Do you have one? Show me!":"我是四天王的最後一位，源治。要駕馭龍，訓練家需要一顆既堅強又溫柔的心。你有嗎？讓我看看！","Superb! You have earned the right to face the Champion.":"精彩！你贏得了挑戰冠軍的資格。","So, the Champion returns. My Dragons have grown fiercer. Show me your heart once again!":"冠軍又回來了啊。我的龍變得更加兇猛了。再讓我看看你的心吧！","Ever Grande City. The city of flowers and sea, where the best Trainers of Hoenn come to challenge the League.":"彩幽市。花與海之城，豐緣最強的訓練家們都來這裡挑戰聯盟。","A shelf of records: the names of every Champion of Hoenn's Pokémon League.":"一排記錄架：上面寫著豐緣寶可夢聯盟歷代冠軍的名字。","The Hall of Fame. Hoenn's Champions and their Pokémon are remembered here forever.":"殿堂。豐緣的冠軍和他們的寶可夢將在這裡被永遠銘記。","Groudon, Kyogre, Latias and Latios: every legend of Hoenn's land, sea and sky has met you now.":"固拉多、蓋歐卡、拉帝亞斯和拉帝歐斯：豐緣的大地、海洋與天空的傳說，都已經與你相遇了。","Every reading is calm now. The land and the sea of Hoenn are at rest.":"現在所有的讀數都很平穩。豐緣的大地與海洋都安靜下來了。","The skies have been calm since Rayquaza came down. Our instruments say it is still up there, watching from the Sky Pillar.":"自從烈空坐降臨以後，天空就一直很平靜。儀器顯示牠還在高處，從天空柱上守望著。","These readings are strange! A fierce drought around Route 114, and rain that never stops over Route 127.":"這些讀數好奇怪！114號道路一帶嚴重乾旱，127號道路上空卻下著停不了的雨。","It is just like the day Groudon and Kyogre woke. Could the two of them be resting somewhere near there?":"這和固拉多與蓋歐卡醒來的那天一模一樣。難道牠們就在那附近休息嗎？","{player}, welcome home, Champion! You have to hear this: the news just showed a Pokémon soaring over Hoenn, faster than a jet!":"{player}，歡迎回家，冠軍！你一定要聽聽這個：新聞剛剛播出一隻寶可夢飛過豐緣的天空，比噴射機還快！","The picture was all a blur, but its color stood out. Did you see it on TV too?":"畫面糊成一片，不過牠的顏色很顯眼。你也在電視上看到了嗎？","What color was the Pokémon?":"那隻寶可夢是什麼顏色的？","A blue one? Then it must have been {mon}! They say it is still flying all over Hoenn. Keep your eyes open on the routes!":"藍色的？那一定是{mon}！聽說牠還在豐緣各地飛來飛去。在道路上要多留意哦！","A red one? Then it must have been {mon}! They say it is still flying all over Hoenn. Keep your eyes open on the routes!":"紅色的？那一定是{mon}！聽說牠還在豐緣各地飛來飛去。在道路上要多留意哦！","Oh, and this came in the mail for you: a ticket with a picture of an island on it.":"對了，有你的信：一張畫著小島的船票。","The sailors at the harbor in Lilycove City would know where it goes.":"水靜市港口的水手應該知道它通往哪裡。","The Pokémon by the great tree turns to look at you. It does not seem afraid.":"大樹旁的寶可夢轉過頭來看著你。牠似乎一點也不害怕。","Waves of heat roll off the rock. The ground itself seems to breathe... Groudon opens its eyes!":"岩石冒出陣陣熱浪。大地彷彿在呼吸……固拉多睜開了眼睛！","The water of the pool swells and churns. Kyogre rises from the depths!":"水池的水翻騰湧動。蓋歐卡從深處浮上來了！","A crack runs through the rock. Hot, dry air seeps out of it, but it is far too narrow to get through.":"岩石上有一道裂縫。裡面滲出乾燥的熱風，可是太窄了，根本過不去。","A dark opening in the rock. A strong current pours out of it, too strong to swim against.":"岩石上有個黑漆漆的洞口。裡面湧出強勁的水流，根本沒辦法逆流游進去。","The ship sailed south over the calm sea...":"船在平靜的海面上向南航行……","Ready to sail back to Lilycove City?":"準備好回水靜市了嗎？","The ship sailed back north to Lilycove City.":"船向北航行，回到了水靜市。","The ferry is running again! Where would you like to sail?":"渡輪又開始航行了！你想去哪裡？","The ship sailed out to the island of the Battle Tower...":"船向對戰塔所在的小島駛去……","The ship sailed north, far beyond the seas of Hoenn...":"船向北駛去，遠遠離開了豐緣的海域……","Here we are: Sandgem Town, in the Sinnoh region. Mind the sand in your shoes!":"到了：神奧地區的真砂鎮。小心別讓沙子跑進鞋裡！","Professor Rowan's lab is the big building at the north end of town. You can't miss it.":"七灶博士的研究所是鎮子北邊那棟大建築，你不會錯過的。","{player}! I thought I might find you here. This store has everything, doesn't it?":"{player}！我就猜會在這裡遇到你。這家店什麼都有，對吧？","I came to buy supplies... but a battle first! I want to see how far we have both come.":"我是來買補給的……不過先對戰吧！我想看看我們倆都成長了多少。","Wow... I really thought I had you this time. You never stop surprising me.":"哇……我還以為這次能贏你呢。你總是讓我大吃一驚。","I did it! I finally beat you properly!":"我做到了！終於堂堂正正地贏了你！","Dad says Team Aqua and Team Magma were seen heading for Mt. Pyre, the island south of Route 121. Be careful, {player}.":"爸爸說有人看到海洋隊和熔岩隊往送神山去了，就是121號道路南邊的那座島。要小心哦，{player}。","Please, stop! Those orbs must never leave this mountain!":"求求你們住手！那些寶珠絕對不能離開這座山！","Oh, it is you again. Too late, kid. The Blue Orb is coming with me. With it, the master of the sea will wake from its long sleep.":"哦，又是你啊。太遲了，小鬼。靛藍色寶珠我帶走了。有了它，海洋之主就會從漫長的沉睡中醒來。","And the Red Orb is mine. The master of the land will rise, and the land will grow. This time, Archie, we shall see whose dream comes true.":"而朱紅色寶珠歸我。大地之主將會甦醒，陸地將會擴張。這一次，水梧桐，就看誰的夢想能實現吧。","Ha! We will see about that, Maxie. Team Aqua, move out!":"哈！走著瞧吧，赤焰松。海洋隊，撤！","Team Magma, we are leaving.":"熔岩隊，撤退。","The Red Orb and the Blue Orb... they hold the hearts of the two ancient Pokémon of land and sea. Long ago, those two fought until the whole world shook.":"朱紅色寶珠和靛藍色寶珠……裡面寄宿著大地與海洋的兩隻古代寶可夢的心。很久以前，牠們倆打得整個世界都在震動。","If they are woken... no one can say what will become of Hoenn. Young one, please, do whatever you can.":"要是牠們被喚醒……誰也說不準豐緣會變成什麼樣。年輕人，拜託你，盡你所能吧。","Welcome to the Lilycove Department Store! Poké Balls and medicine are right here. TMs and more are upstairs.":"歡迎光臨水靜百貨公司！精靈球和藥品就在這裡，招式學習器等商品在樓上。","The strongest TMs in Hoenn! Each one teaches its move as often as you like.":"豐緣最強的招式學習器！每一個都能無限次教會寶可夢招式。","X items raise your Pokémon's stats during a battle. Perfect for a tough opponent!":"能力提升道具能在對戰中提高寶可夢的能力。對付強敵最合適了！","Vitamins make your Pokémon stronger for good. A little expensive, but worth it!":"營養劑能讓寶可夢永久變強。雖然有點貴，但很值得！","I come here every week. There is always something new on the shelves!":"我每週都會來。貨架上總有新東西！","Max Potions and Full Restores cost a lot, but a Trainer heading into danger should carry a few.":"全滿藥和全復藥雖然很貴，但要去危險地方的訓練家應該帶上幾瓶。","TM15 is Hyper Beam! It is so strong, but my Pokémon has to rest after using it.":"招式學習器15是破壞光線！威力超強，可是用完之後我的寶可夢得休息一回合。","This cave belongs to Team Aqua! Nobody gets in. Now beat it, kid!":"這個洞窟是海洋隊的！誰都不准進。快滾吧，小鬼！","The Safari Zone is closed for repairs. Please come back another time.":"狩獵地帶正在整修，暫停開放。請改天再來。","Without the orbs, the mountain feels empty. I fear what those people will do with them.":"沒有了寶珠，這座山感覺空蕩蕩的。真擔心那些人會拿它們做什麼。","We have guarded these orbs all our lives. They must never leave this altar.":"我們一輩子都在守護這些寶珠。它們絕不能離開這座祭壇。","The two great Pokémon have slept for a very long time. Let us pray they stay asleep.":"那兩隻偉大的寶可夢已經沉睡了很久很久。祈禱牠們繼續睡下去吧。","The Red Orb and the Blue Orb rest here, side by side, keeping the peace between land and sea.":"朱紅色寶珠和靛藍色寶珠並排安放在這裡，守護著大地與海洋之間的和平。","Old Man":"老爺爺","Marcel":"馬塞爾","I am training on my way to Lilycove. You will make a good warm-up!":"我在去水靜市的路上修行。你正好拿來熱身！","Some warm-up that was...":"這熱身也太激烈了……","Lilycove has the biggest Department Store in Hoenn. Stock up before you go anywhere dangerous.":"水靜市有豐緣最大的百貨公司。去危險的地方之前，先在那裡補給好。","Cristin":"克里斯汀","My Loudred has the loudest voice on this road. Cover your ears!":"我的爆音怪是這條路上嗓門最大的。快摀住耳朵！","Ears still ringing...":"耳朵還在嗡嗡響……","Loudred can knock over a truck with its shout. Or so it likes to think.":"爆音怪喊一聲就能掀翻卡車。至少牠自己是這麼覺得的。","Jessica":"傑西卡","Did you see my Kecleon? No? That is because it is right behind you!":"你看到我的變隱龍了嗎？沒有？那是因為牠就在你身後！","Seen through...":"被看穿了……","Seviper's tail is as sharp as a blade. It keeps it polished on the rocks.":"飯匙蛇的尾巴像刀刃一樣鋒利。牠會在岩石上把尾巴磨亮。","Walter":"沃爾特","A stroll by the sea is lovely, but a battle by the sea is even better.":"在海邊散步很愜意，不過在海邊對戰更棒。","From the beach you can see Mt. Pyre out at sea. It always seems to be covered in mist.":"從海灘上能看到海中的送神山。那裡好像總是籠罩在霧裡。","The Department Store has five... no, two floors! It just feels like five when you are shopping with my mum.":"百貨公司有五層……不對，是兩層！只是跟媽媽一起逛的時候感覺像有五層。","Lilycove is where the land runs out. Past the beach, it is nothing but sea all the way to Mossdeep City.":"水靜市是陸地的盡頭。過了海灘，就只有一望無際的大海，一直延伸到綠嶺市。","The ferry is not running right now. Some trouble out at sea, they say. Sorry, kid.":"渡輪現在停駛了。聽說海上出了點狀況。抱歉啦，小鬼。","Wailmer swim into the bay at dawn. One day I will see a Wailord too: they are as big as a ship!":"吼吼鯨會在黎明時游進海灣。總有一天我也要看到吼鯨王：牠們跟船一樣大！","Mt. Pyre is the island you can see from the beach. People go there to remember the Pokémon who have passed away.":"從海灘上能看到的那座島就是送神山。人們會去那裡緬懷離世的寶可夢。","Welcome to the Lilycove Museum. Our gallery shows Pokémon as artists have seen them through the ages.":"歡迎來到水靜美術館。我們的展廳展示了歷代藝術家眼中的寶可夢。","Ships leave Lilycove's harbour for every corner of Hoenn. When the ferry runs again, you can sail anywhere!":"從水靜市的港口出發的船能開往豐緣的每個角落。等渡輪恢復了，你想去哪兒都行！","Long ago, they say, the sea and the land fought a terrible battle right here in Hoenn. The old folk on Mt. Pyre know the story.":"據說很久以前，大海和陸地就在豐緣這裡打了一場可怕的仗。送神山上的老人們知道這個故事。","Gabrielle":"加布里埃爾","The spirits here are restless today... Something is happening at the summit.":"今天這裡的靈魂很不安……山頂一定出了什麼事。","The spirits have gone quiet...":"靈魂安靜下來了……","People in red and people in blue climbed to the summit today. The spirits did not like them at all.":"今天有穿紅衣服和穿藍衣服的人爬上了山頂。靈魂們一點也不喜歡他們。","William":"威廉","I came here to meditate among the graves. My mind is clear... and ready for battle.":"我來這裡在墓碑間冥想。我的心很清明……隨時可以對戰。","My concentration...":"我的專注力……","Kirlia can feel the happiness of its Trainer. When I am calm, it is calm too.":"奇魯莉安能感受到訓練家的快樂。我平靜的時候，牠也很平靜。","Mt. Pyre is where people bring the Pokémon they have lost, so they can rest in peace. Walk quietly, please.":"送神山是人們安葬逝去寶可夢的地方，讓牠們能安息。請輕聲走路。","Our boss is busy up at the altar. Turn around, kid!":"我們老大正在祭壇那邊忙。小鬼，回去吧！","Sunk again...":"又沉下去了……","Once the boss has that orb, the sea will cover everything!":"只要老大拿到那顆寶珠，大海就會淹沒一切！","Team Magma got here first! Well, almost first. Out of the way!":"熔岩隊先到的！呃，差不多算先到。讓開！","Our leader says the orb will wake the master of the land. Then you will see!":"我們首領說那顆寶珠能喚醒大地之主。到時候你就知道了！","Route 121. North: Route 120. East: Lilycove City. South, across the sea: Route 122 and Mt. Pyre.":"121號道路。北：120號道路。東：水靜市。南邊隔著海：122號道路和送神山。","Safari Zone. Meet the Pokémon of all Hoenn in one place!":"狩獵地帶。在這裡就能遇見全豐緣的寶可夢！","Lilycove City. Where the land ends and the sea begins.":"水靜市。陸地的盡頭，大海的起點。","Lilycove Department Store. Everything a Trainer could wish for, under one roof!":"水靜百貨公司。訓練家想要的一切，這裡應有盡有！","A painting of a Wailord leaping out of a calm sea at sunset.":"一幅畫：夕陽下，一隻吼鯨王從平靜的海面躍起。","A painting of Mt. Pyre in the morning mist. It feels peaceful, and a little sad.":"一幅畫：晨霧中的送神山。讓人覺得寧靜，又有點感傷。","A painting of two huge Pokémon, one of the land and one of the sea, clashing under a stormy sky. The plate reads: \"The Ancient Battle\".":"一幅畫：一隻大地的巨大寶可夢和一隻海洋的巨大寶可夢，在暴風雨的天空下激烈交戰。銘牌上寫著：「遠古之戰」。","A sculpture of a Pokémon made of bright, curving lines. The plate has not been filled in yet.":"一座由明亮曲線構成的寶可夢雕塑。銘牌還是空白的。","A stone altar. Two hollows in it once held a red orb and a blue orb.":"一座石造祭壇。上面的兩個凹槽曾經放著一顆紅色寶珠和一顆藍色寶珠。","Lois & Hal":"路易絲和哈爾","We do everything together, and that includes battles!":"我們做什麼都在一起，對戰也一樣！","At least we lost as a team.":"至少我們是一起輸的。","In a double battle, a move that hits both foes is worth twice as much. Think about it!":"在雙打對戰裡，能同時打中兩個對手的招式價值翻倍。好好想想吧！","{player}! I hear you climbed Mt. Silver and beat {rival} at the top. Ho ho! My grandson talks of nothing else.":"{player}！聽說你登上了白銀山，在山頂打敗了{rival}。呵呵！我孫子整天都在說這件事呢。","Now, I have a letter from an old friend: Professor Birch. He studies Pokémon in the wild in Hoenn, a region far to the south.":"我這裡有一封老朋友寄來的信，他是小田卷博士。他在遙遠南方的豐緣地區，研究野生的寶可夢。","He is looking for a strong Trainer to help with his research, and I told him I know just the one!":"他想找一位厲害的訓練家幫忙做研究，我就跟他說，我正好認識一位！","The S.S. Aqua sails from Olivine City to Hoenn now. I have put your name on her list of passengers.":"現在S.S.水神號會從淺蔥市開往豐緣。我已經把你的名字寫進乘客名單了。","Take the S.S. Aqua from Olivine City's pier. Professor Birch will be waiting for you in Littleroot Town.":"到淺蔥市的碼頭搭S.S.水神號吧。小田卷博士會在未白鎮等你。","Professor Oak says you are the Champion of Kanto and Johto! Here in Hoenn, though, things work a little differently.":"大木博士說你是關都和城都的冠軍！不過在豐緣這裡，情況有點不一樣。","A Pokémon trained to a high level in another region only listens to a Trainer who has earned Hoenn's Gym badges. The more badges, the stronger the Pokémon that obey.":"在其他地區練到高等級的寶可夢，只聽擁有豐緣道館徽章的訓練家的話。徽章越多，聽話的寶可夢就越強。","So you will want a new partner. The Pokémon you battled with seems to like you: please, take it with you!":"所以你需要一個新夥伴。剛才和你一起戰鬥的寶可夢好像很喜歡你：請帶牠一起走吧！","{player} received {mon} from Prof. Birch!":"{player}從小田卷博士那裡得到了{mon}！","My child, {rival3}, is out on Route 103, north of Oldale Town, studying Pokémon. Why not go and say hello?":"我的孩子{rival3}正在古辰鎮北邊的103號道路研究寶可夢。你何不過去打個招呼？","So you two have met! {rival3} has been looking forward to it for days.":"你們見過面啦！{rival3}已經期待好幾天了。","{player}, may I have your Pokédex for a moment? ...There! Now it can record the Pokémon of Hoenn as well.":"{player}，能把圖鑑借我一下嗎？……好了！現在它也能記錄豐緣的寶可夢了。","{player}'s Pokédex was upgraded!":"{player}的圖鑑升級了！","And these are from me! You will need them to catch the Pokémon of Hoenn.":"這些是我送你的！要抓豐緣的寶可夢就用得著。","West of Oldale Town, Route 102 leads on to Petalburg City. Your journey through Hoenn starts there!":"從古辰鎮往西，102號道路通往橙華市。你在豐緣的旅程就從那裡開始！","{rival3} is on Route 103, north of Oldale Town. Go on, say hello!":"{rival3}在古辰鎮北邊的103號道路。去打個招呼吧！","Hoenn has Pokémon you know from Kanto and Johto, and many that live only here. Fill that Pokédex for me!":"豐緣有你在關都和城都見過的寶可夢，也有很多只住在這裡的。幫我把圖鑑填滿吧！","Remember: the more Hoenn badges you earn, the more of your Pokémon from home will listen to you.":"記住：豐緣的徽章拿得越多，你從家鄉帶來的寶可夢就越聽話。","The S.S. Aqua is fixed at last! She sails south to the Hoenn region now.":"S.S.水神號終於修好了！現在它會向南開往豐緣地區。","Only passengers on the list may board, though. Professor Oak in Kanto sends us their names.":"不過只有名單上的乘客才能上船。名單是關都的大木博士寄給我們的。","All aboard for Hoenn! Would you like to set sail?":"開往豐緣的船要出發了！要上船嗎？","The S.S. Aqua sounded her horn and put out to sea.":"S.S.水神號鳴響汽笛，駛向大海。","The ship sailed south through the night...":"船在夜裡一路往南航行……","Land ho! Welcome to Littleroot Town, in the Hoenn region.":"到岸啦！歡迎來到豐緣地區的未白鎮。","Professor Birch's lab is just up the path. His family lives in the house by the north road, and they love having guests.":"小田卷博士的研究所就在這條路上去。他的家人住在北邊路旁的房子裡，很歡迎客人。","Come back whenever you are ready.":"準備好了再來吧。","The S.S. Aqua sails north to Olivine City in Johto. Would you like to go back?":"S.S.水神號會向北開往城都的淺蔥市。要回去嗎？","The ship sailed north through the night...":"船在夜裡一路往北航行……","Professor Birch? He went out to do fieldwork on Route 101, north of town. He always forgets that the wild Pokémon bite!":"小田卷博士？他去鎮北邊的101號道路做野外調查了。他總是忘了野生寶可夢會咬人！","{player}, you look tired. Have a little rest.":"{player}，你看起來好累。稍微休息一下吧。","There! Off you go, and come home safe.":"好了！去吧，路上小心，要平安回來哦。","Oh! You must be {player}. Professor Oak wrote that you would be coming. Welcome to Littleroot!":"哎呀！你就是{player}吧。大木博士來信說你會來。歡迎來到未白鎮！","You will stay with us while you are in Hoenn. Your room is upstairs, next to {rival3}'s.":"你在豐緣的時候就住在我們家吧。你的房間在樓上，就在{rival3}房間的旁邊。","My husband? Out in the field, as always. Try Route 101, north of town.":"我丈夫？跟平常一樣在外面做調查。去鎮北邊的101號道路找找看吧。","Dad says you can stay with us as long as you like. Let's both fill our Pokédex, okay?":"爸爸說你想住多久都可以。我們一起把圖鑑填滿吧，好不好？","Prof. Birch":"小田卷博士","Professor Birch is never in his lab. He would rather be out in the grass with the Pokémon!":"小田卷博士從來都不在研究所。他更喜歡待在草叢裡和寶可夢在一起！","The S.S. Aqua docks at our little pier now. Imagine, a ship from Johto stopping in Littleroot!":"S.S.水神號現在會停靠我們的小碼頭。想不到吧，城都的船竟然會停在未白鎮！","An old tale says Hoenn's land and sea were shaped long ago, when two great Pokémon fought over them.":"古老的傳說裡說，很久以前兩隻巨大的寶可夢為了爭奪豐緣而戰，大地和海洋就是那時形成的。","Some Pokémon here are from Kanto and Johto, but lots of them live only in Hoenn. I want to see them all!":"這裡有些寶可夢來自關都和城都，不過很多只住在豐緣。我想全部都看一遍！","Littleroot Town. A small town where new journeys take root.":"未白鎮。新的旅程在這個小鎮生根發芽。","Professor Birch's Pokémon Lab.":"小田卷博士的寶可夢研究所。","Field notes: \"Many of Hoenn's Pokémon live nowhere else. Others came from far away, like the Trainers who follow them...\"":"野外調查筆記：「豐緣的許多寶可夢在別處都見不到。也有一些是從遠方來的，就像追隨牠們的訓練家一樣……」","Notebooks full of drawings of Pokémon, and the places where they were seen.":"筆記本裡畫滿了寶可夢，還有看到牠們的地方。","{player}! The Champion of Hoenn, and a friend of my family. I could not be prouder!":"{player}！豐緣的冠軍，也是我們家的朋友。我真是太驕傲了！","Now, an old friend of mine, Professor Rowan, studies how Pokémon evolve. He lives in Sandgem Town, in the Sinnoh region, far to the north.":"對了，我的老朋友七灶博士在研究寶可夢是怎麼進化的。他住在遙遠北方神奧地區的真砂鎮。","He wrote that he would like to meet a Trainer who knows Kanto, Johto and Hoenn. I told him I know just the one!":"他在信上說，想見一見熟悉關都、城都和豐緣的訓練家。我跟他說，我正好認識一位！","The ferry in Lilycove City's harbor sails to Sinnoh now. Professor Rowan's lab is in Sandgem Town, right by the pier.":"水靜市港口的渡輪現在開往神奧了。七灶博士的研究所就在真砂鎮，離碼頭很近。","Uncle, please! I want to challenge the Gym! Ralts and I have been training every day!":"叔叔，拜託！我想挑戰道館！我和拉魯拉絲每天都在訓練！","Wally, you only just caught your first Pokémon. A Gym Leader is a different matter.":"滿充，你才剛抓到第一隻寶可夢。道館館主可不是鬧著玩的。","Oh! {player}! You are the one who helped me catch Ralts!":"啊！{player}！就是你幫我抓到拉魯拉絲的！","Then this is the deal, Wally: battle {player}. If you can hold your own, we will talk about the Gym.":"那就這樣吧，滿充：跟{player}對戰。要是你撐得住，我們再談道館的事。","All right... {player}, please battle me! I want to see how strong Ralts has become!":"好……{player}，請跟我對戰！我想看看拉魯拉絲變得多強了！","I lost... But Ralts did its best. I will train more, and one day I will catch up with you!":"我輸了……不過拉魯拉絲已經盡力了。我會更努力訓練，總有一天會追上你！","That was a good battle, Wally. Come, let us go home to Verdanturf. {player}, thank you for being so kind to him.":"打得很好，滿充。走吧，我們回綠蔭鎮。{player}，謝謝你對他這麼好。","Wahahahah! Come back any time. My Gym and I will always have a jolt for you!":"哇哈哈哈！隨時歡迎再來。我和我的道館隨時準備給你來一下電擊！","The Game Corner is closed for renovations. \"Reopening soon!\" says a sign on the door.":"遊戲城正在裝修，暫停營業。門上的告示寫著：「即將重新開張！」","Welcome to Rydel's Cycles! The best bikes in Hoenn, made right here!":"歡迎光臨萊德自行車店！豐緣最好的自行車，就在這裡製造！","Oh, you already have a Bicycle from Kanto? Then you are all set. Ride safely, and come back when you want to talk bikes!":"哦，你已經有關都的自行車了？那就沒問題了。騎車注意安全，想聊自行車的時候再來吧！","Hmm, we are all sold out today. Come back another time!":"唔，今天全都賣完了。改天再來吧！","Yo, Champion! Wattson uses Electric-type Pokémon. Water and Flying types should stay away!":"嘿，冠軍！鐵旋用的是電屬性的寶可夢。水和飛行屬性的最好別上場！","Ground types do not take any damage from Electric moves. A Geodude from Granite Cave, or a Marshtomp, would laugh at this Gym!":"地面屬性完全不怕電屬性招式。石之洞窟的小拳石，或是沼躍魚，在這座道館裡都能笑著過關！","Watch out for paralysis, too. Bring Paralyze Heals!":"還要小心麻痺。記得帶解麻藥！","Wahahahah! Take the Dynamo Badge. You earned every spark of it!":"哇哈哈哈！收下紫電徽章吧。這每一道電光都是你應得的！","{player} received the Dynamo Badge from Wattson!":"{player}從鐵旋那裡得到了紫電徽章！","With three Hoenn badges, Pokémon up to level 35 will obey you, wherever they come from.":"有了三枚豐緣徽章，35級以下的寶可夢都會聽你的話，不管牠們來自哪裡。","And this one is on me: TM34, Shock Wave. An electric jolt that never misses! Wahahahah!":"這個是我送你的：招式學習器34，電擊波。百發百中的電擊！哇哈哈哈！","Wally's Uncle":"滿充的叔叔","Mauville is the crossroads of Hoenn. Roads go out in every direction from here!":"紫堇市是豐緣的交通要道。從這裡有路通往四面八方！","Wattson built a lot of this city himself. He laughs so loud you can hear him from the Pokémon Center!":"這座城市很多地方都是鐵旋親手建的。他笑得那麼大聲，在寶可夢中心都聽得到！","The Game Corner is closed while they rebuild it. Shame, I was on a lucky streak!":"遊戲城在重建，暫時關門了。真可惜，我正好手氣很旺呢！","Ground types cannot be hurt by Electric moves at all. Wattson hates seeing them walk into his Gym!":"電屬性招式對地面屬性完全無效。鐵旋最討厭看到牠們走進道館了！","Paralyze Heal is a must against Electric types. Being paralyzed is the worst!":"對付電屬性一定要帶解麻藥。被麻痺最慘了！","When I was young, Mauville was just a few houses at a crossroads. Then Wattson came, and the city lit up!":"我年輕時，紫堇市只是十字路口的幾間房子。後來鐵旋來了，整座城市就亮起來了！","My guitar and my Pokémon run on the same thing: pure electricity! Rock on!":"我的吉他和我的寶可夢靠的都是同一樣東西：純粹的電力！搖滾起來！","My strings snapped...":"弦斷了……","Wattson laughs every time he battles. Win or lose, he just loves it.":"鐵旋每次對戰都在笑。不管輸贏，他就是喜歡。","Vivian":"薇薇安","I came to this Gym to learn to fight against electricity. Let me show you what I learned!":"我來這座道館是為了學習怎麼對付電。讓你看看我學到了什麼！","Shocking...":"被電到了……","Magneton is three Magnemite stuck together. Its Electric and Steel types make it tough to hurt.":"三合一磁怪是三隻小磁怪連在一起。牠是電和鋼屬性，很難打傷。","Wahahahah! So you are the Champion everyone is talking about! I am Wattson, the Leader of the Mauville Gym. I will electrify you good!":"哇哈哈哈！原來你就是大家都在說的那位冠軍啊！我是紫堇道館的館主鐵旋。我要好好電你一下！","Wahahahah! Well, I was the one who got electrified! You are the real deal!":"哇哈哈哈！結果被電到的是我！你是真材實料！","Mauville City. The bright and shining city of fun!":"紫堇市。光彩奪目的歡樂之城！","Mauville City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Wattson, the cheerfully electrifying man!":"紫堇市寶可夢道館。館主：鐵旋，快樂放電的男人！","North: Route 111, to Route 112 and Mt. Chimney.":"北：111號道路，通往112號道路和煙囪山。","West: Route 117 and Verdanturf Town.":"西：117號道路和綠蔭鎮。","East: Route 118. You will need a Pokémon that can Surf to cross it.":"東：118號道路。需要會衝浪的寶可夢才能渡過。","Hahaha! You came all the way down here? Too late! The boss already left in the submarine we took from Slateport!":"哈哈哈！你居然下到這裡來了？太遲了！老大已經開著我們從凱那市搶來的潛水艇走了！","He is taking the Blue Orb to the bottom of the sea, to wake the master of the sea. Nothing can stop him now!":"他要把靛藍色寶珠帶到海底，喚醒海洋之主。現在誰也阻止不了他了！","Hah... whatever. You cannot catch a submarine anyway. Team Aqua, clear out!":"哼……隨便啦。反正你也追不上潛水艇。海洋隊，撤！","{player}, you came! Team Magma broke in. They want the rocket fuel to make Mt. Chimney erupt for good.":"{player}，你來了！熔岩隊闖進來了。他們想用火箭燃料讓煙囪山徹底噴發。","Here, let me heal your Pokémon first. Then let us stop them, together.":"來，我先幫你治療寶可夢。然後我們一起阻止他們。","{player}'s Pokémon were healed!":"{player}的寶可夢恢復了！","So, you again. Rocket fuel poured into Mt. Chimney would wake the volcano for good... and the Red Orb would do the rest.":"又是你。把火箭燃料倒進煙囪山，火山就會徹底甦醒……剩下的就交給朱紅色寶珠了。","...Even so, the Red Orb is mine. Team Magma, withdraw! We go where the master of the land sleeps.":"……即便如此，朱紅色寶珠還在我手上。熔岩隊，撤退！我們去大地之主沉睡的地方。","Thank you, {player}. The fuel is safe... but both teams now hold an orb. Something terrible is coming to Hoenn. Be ready.":"謝謝你，{player}。燃料保住了……可是兩個組織現在各有一顆寶珠。有可怕的事情要降臨豐緣了。做好準備吧。","Next time we will read your mind too! ...Probably.":"下次我們連你的心思也要讀出來！……大概吧。","Team Magma stormed in! They are after our rocket fuel! The director is upstairs!":"熔岩隊闖進來了！他們想搶我們的火箭燃料！所長在樓上！","We are getting ready for our next launch. The fuel for one rocket could light up a whole city!":"我們正在準備下一次發射。一枚火箭的燃料就能點亮整座城市！","You saved our fuel, and our launch. The whole Space Center thanks you!":"你保住了我們的燃料和發射計劃。整個宇宙中心都感謝你！","Please, stop them! If that fuel ends up inside a volcano...":"求求你阻止他們！要是那些燃料被倒進火山裡……","Welcome to the Space Center. One day, we hope to send a Pokémon to the stars.":"歡迎來到宇宙中心。我們希望有一天能把寶可夢送上星空。","We are two, but we battle as one. That is our strength!":"我們是兩個人，卻像一個人一樣戰鬥。這就是我們的力量！","Yo, Champion! Tate and Liza battle as a pair, and their Pokémon are Psychic and Rock types. Dark, Ghost and Water moves will serve you well!":"嘿，冠軍！小楓與小南是雙人搭檔，他們的寶可夢是超能力和岩石屬性。惡、幽靈和水屬性的招式會很有用！","Watch out for Solrock's Solar Beam once the sun comes out. And Claydol knows Earthquake!":"出太陽的時候要小心太陽岩的日光束。還有，念力土偶會地震！","You beat both of us at once! Here, the Mind Badge. You earned it.":"你一次打敗了我們兩個人！給你，心靈徽章。這是你應得的。","{player} received the Mind Badge from Tate and Liza!":"{player}從小楓與小南那裡得到了心靈徽章！","With seven Hoenn badges, Pokémon up to level 70 will obey you, wherever they come from.":"有了七枚豐緣徽章，70級以下的寶可夢都會聽你的話，不管牠們來自哪裡。","And take TM04, Calm Mind. It sharpens your Pokémon's mind: its Special Attack and Special Defense both go up.":"再拿上招式學習器04，冥想。它能讓寶可夢心神集中，特攻和特防都會提高。","Oh! The Space Center... We can feel something is wrong there. Hurry!":"啊！宇宙中心……我們感覺到那裡出事了。快去！","Tate & Liza":"小楓與小南","How did you find our hideout? Doesn't matter: you are not leaving!":"你怎麼找到我們基地的？算了，你別想出去！","Our hideout... breached...":"我們的基地……被攻破了……","The boss is not even here. You are too late, whatever you came for!":"老大根本不在這裡。不管你來幹嘛，都太遲了！","Intruder! Intruder in the hideout!":"有入侵者！基地裡有入侵者！","Somebody, help...":"誰來幫幫我……","Downstairs is the dock. Matt is down there. He will flatten you!":"樓下是碼頭。阿潮就在那裡。他會把你打扁的！","You came all the way down here? Then you can go swimming with my Sharpedo!":"你居然下來了？那就跟我的巨牙鯊一起游泳吧！","I got bitten instead...":"結果被咬的是我……","The submarine was docked right here. Was.":"潛水艇本來就停在這裡。本來。","Reed":"里德","The sea between Lilycove and Mossdeep is my training ground. Let me show you!":"水靜市和綠嶺市之間的大海就是我的訓練場。讓你見識一下！","I swallowed some seawater...":"嗆了一口海水……","Mossdeep City is straight east. Its Space Center sends rockets up into the sky!":"一直往東就是綠嶺市。那裡的宇宙中心會把火箭發射到天上！","Swimming all the way to Mossdeep? Let us race... I mean, battle!":"你要一路游到綠嶺市？來比賽……我是說，來對戰吧！","The water around here is deep and dark in places. Some people say there is a whole world down there.":"這一帶有些地方的海水又深又暗。有人說海底下藏著另一個世界。","The Space Center launches rockets from here! When one takes off, the whole island shakes.":"宇宙中心會從這裡發射火箭！每次發射，整座島都會搖晃。","The Gym Leaders are twins. They say they can read each other's minds in battle!":"這裡的道館館主是一對雙胞胎。聽說他們對戰時能讀懂彼此的心思！","A young man named Steven lives in that house. He is always away, looking for rare stones.":"那棟房子裡住著一個叫大吾的年輕人。他總是不在家，到處尋找稀有的石頭。","The sea around Mossdeep is full of currents. Only good swimmers come this far.":"綠嶺市周圍的海流很多。只有游泳好手才能來到這裡。","Psychic Pokémon are weak to Bug, Ghost and Dark moves. Rock types do not like Water or Grass, either.":"超能力屬性怕蟲、幽靈和惡屬性的招式。岩石屬性也怕水和草。","Everything here comes over by boat. That is why I always buy a little extra.":"這裡的東西全靠船運過來。所以我總會多買一點。","On a clear night you can see every star from Mossdeep. The scientists say the sky is clearer here than anywhere in Hoenn.":"晴朗的夜晚，在綠嶺市能看見滿天繁星。科學家說這裡的天空是全豐緣最清澈的。","I can read your next move! ...Probably.":"我能看穿你的下一步！……大概吧。","I did not see that coming. Literally.":"我完全沒預見到。字面意義上的。","Tate and Liza do not even need to talk. They just know what the other is thinking.":"小楓和小南根本不用說話。他們就是知道對方在想什麼。","Clifford":"克利福德","I come to this Gym to train my mind, not just my Pokémon. Shall we?":"我來這座道館是為了修煉心靈，不只是訓練寶可夢。開始吧？","A clear mind, and still I lost.":"心如明鏡，還是輸了。","Lunatone and Solrock: the moon and the sun. The twins keep one of each.":"月石和太陽岩：月亮與太陽。雙胞胎各有一隻。","The twins are strong, but you will have to get past me first!":"雙胞胎很強，不過你得先過我這關！","My vision was clouded...":"我的預見被矇蔽了……","Solrock shines brighter in the sunshine. Watch out if the twins call up the sun.":"太陽岩在陽光下會更耀眼。雙胞胎要是召來晴天就要小心了。","We are Tate and Liza, the Leaders of this Gym! We knew you were coming: we could feel it. Our minds work as one, so you will have to beat both of us!":"我們是這座道館的館主小楓與小南！我們早就知道你會來：我們感覺得到。我們心意相通，所以你得同時打敗我們兩個！","We lost... We could read every move our Pokémon would make, but we could not read yours!":"我們輸了……我們能讀懂自己寶可夢的每一步，卻讀不懂你的！","Team Magma is borrowing this place's rocket fuel. Stay out of it!":"熔岩隊要借用這裡的火箭燃料。少管閒事！","Fizzled out...":"熄火了……","Our leader is upstairs. You cannot stop him now!":"我們首領在樓上。你已經阻止不了他了！","Not one step further! The fuel is ours!":"不准再往前一步！燃料是我們的！","With enough fuel, the volcano will wake for good. Then the land will grow!":"只要燃料夠多，火山就會徹底甦醒。然後陸地就會擴張！","Mossdeep City. An island town where the stars feel close enough to touch.":"綠嶺市。星星近得彷彿伸手可及的島上城鎮。","Mossdeep City Pokémon Gym. Leaders: Tate and Liza, twins who think as one.":"綠嶺市寶可夢道館。館主：小楓與小南，心意相通的雙胞胎。","Mossdeep Space Center. Our window on the stars.":"綠嶺宇宙中心。我們眺望星空的窗口。","A letter lies on the table: \"I am off on a journey again. Whoever finds this, feel free to rest here. - Steven\"":"桌上放著一封信：「我又出門旅行了。不論是誰看到這封信，都可以在這裡休息。——大吾」","{player}, welcome to my home. Thank you again for what you did at the Space Center.":"{player}，歡迎來我家。再次感謝你在宇宙中心所做的一切。","While we were busy with Team Magma, Team Aqua's submarine slipped away to the south of Mossdeep. I think they mean to go under the sea.":"我們忙著對付熔岩隊的時候，海洋隊的潛水艇悄悄往綠嶺市南邊去了。我想他們是打算潛到海底。","Take this. With it, you can follow them.":"收下這個。有了它，你就能追上他們。","HM08 is Dive. With the Mind Badge, a Pokémon that knows it can take you down from deep, dark water to the sea floor.":"秘傳學習器08是潛水。有了心靈徽章，會這招的寶可夢就能帶你從幽暗的深水潛到海底。","The submarine was last seen over the dark water of Route 128, south of Route 127. Be careful down there, {player}.":"最後有人看到潛水艇，是在127號道路南邊、128號道路的幽暗海面上。到了下面要小心，{player}。","Rita & Sam":"麗塔和薩姆","Big sister and me, against you! Ready?":"姐姐和我一起對付你！準備好了嗎？","Sis, we lost!":"姐姐，我們輸了！","Some moves hit both foes at once. Surf is one of them!":"有些招式能同時打中兩個對手。衝浪就是其中之一！","A letter lies on the table beside a Poké Ball: \"Congratulations, Champion. I met this Pokémon on my travels. Please look after it for me. - Steven\"":"桌上的精靈球旁邊放著一封信：「恭喜你成為冠軍。這是我在旅途中遇到的寶可夢。請替我好好照顧牠。——大吾」","Two of them now? Then the boss and I will crush them both together!":"現在變成兩個人了？那我和老大就一起把他們都打垮！","{player}, we fight them side by side. Choose three of your Pokémon, and I will bring three of mine.":"{player}，我們並肩作戰吧。選出你的三隻寶可夢，我也派出我的三隻。","Get ready quickly, {player}. Talk to me when you are set.":"{player}，快點準備好。準備好了就來跟我說。","Maxie and Tabitha":"赤焰松和火村","My Pokémon know what to do. I just watch!":"我的寶可夢知道該怎麼做。我只要看著就好！","In the Palace, you find out who your Pokémon really are.":"在宮殿裡，你會看清自己的寶可夢真正是什麼樣子。","I trust my Pokémon completely. Do you?":"我完全信任我的寶可夢。你呢？","No orders here. Only character!":"這裡沒有指令，只有性格！","Let us see whose Pokémon have the stronger spirit!":"來看看誰的寶可夢精神更強大吧！","Your Pokémon have a strong spirit...":"你的寶可夢精神真堅強……","Mine did their best. I am proud of them.":"我的寶可夢已經盡力了。我為牠們驕傲。","I should get to know my Pokémon better.":"我應該更了解我的寶可夢才對。","Their natures beat mine today.":"今天是牠們的性格贏了。","So you are the Trainer who keeps winning in my Palace. I am Spenser, the Palace Maven. Here, Pokémon show who they truly are. Let us see yours!":"原來在我的宮殿裡連連獲勝的訓練家就是你。我是宮殿守護者鬱金。在這裡，寶可夢會展現出真正的自己。讓我看看你的寶可夢吧！","You have returned. Then let my Pokémon speak for me once more.":"你又來了。那就再讓我的寶可夢替我說話吧。","Your Pokémon fight with heart, just as you do. Take this.":"你的寶可夢和你一樣，用心在戰鬥。收下這個吧。","I have nothing left to teach you. Your bond with your Pokémon is the real thing.":"我已經沒有什麼能教你的了。你和寶可夢之間的羈絆是真的。","Welcome to the Battle Palace! Here, Pokémon choose their own moves.":"歡迎來到對戰宮殿！在這裡，寶可夢會自己決定用什麼招式。","Enter three Pokémon. In battle you cannot give them orders: each one picks its moves as its nature tells it. You may only switch them.":"請報名 3 隻寶可夢。對戰中不能下指令：每隻寶可夢會按自己的性格選擇招式。你只能替換牠們。","The Palace Maven has come to battle you himself!":"宮殿守護者親自前來和你對戰了！","Spenser recognizes your spirit. You earned the Silver Spirit Symbol!":"鬱金認可了你的精神。你得到了銀色精神象徵！","Spenser recognizes your spirit. You earned the Gold Spirit Symbol!":"鬱金認可了你的精神。你得到了金色精神象徵！","In the Palace, Pokémon choose their own moves. Each one goes for attacking, defending or supporting moves, as its nature makes it want to.":"在宮殿裡，寶可夢會自己選擇招式。每隻寶可夢會按性格，傾向於使用攻擊、防守或輔助類的招式。","When its HP falls below half, many a Pokémon changes its habits completely.":"HP 降到一半以下時，很多寶可夢的習慣會完全改變。","A Pokémon that wants a kind of move it does not know may simply hesitate. Give each one moves its nature likes!":"如果寶可夢想用的那類招式牠不會，牠就可能只是猶豫不動。給每隻寶可夢配上合牠性格的招式吧！","They say the Palace Maven himself appears before Trainers who win twenty-one battles in a row.":"聽說連勝 21 場的訓練家，宮殿守護者會親自出現在他們面前。","Welcome to the Battle Palace! This counter is for the double battle halls.":"歡迎來到對戰宮殿！這個櫃檯負責雙打大廳。","Enter three Pokémon. Two of them battle at once, and each one chooses its moves, and whom to hit, as its nature tells it. You may only switch them.":"請報名 3 隻寶可夢。兩隻會同時上場，每隻都會依照自己的性格決定用什麼招式、攻擊誰。你只能替換牠們。","In the double battle halls, though, he never shows himself. There, two Pokémon fight side by side, each choosing whom to strike.":"不過在雙打大廳，他從不現身。在那裡，兩隻寶可夢並肩作戰，各自決定要攻擊誰。","Welcome to the Petalburg Gym. You must be the Trainer from Kanto that Professor Birch told me about.":"歡迎來到橙華道館。你就是小田卷博士說的那位從關都來的訓練家吧。","I am Norman, the Leader of this Gym. I would gladly battle a Champion, but in Hoenn I only accept challengers who hold four badges.":"我是這座道館的館主千里。我很想和冠軍對戰，不過在豐緣，我只接受擁有四枚徽章的挑戰者。","Earn them, and come back. I will be waiting.":"拿到以後再來吧。我會等你的。","Um... excuse me...":"那個……打擾一下……","My name is Wally. I am not very strong, so I am going to live with my relatives in Verdanturf Town, where the air is cleaner.":"我叫滿充。我身體不太好，所以要搬去綠蔭鎮的親戚家住，那裡的空氣比較乾淨。","I would like a Pokémon to keep me company. But I have never caught one...":"我想要一隻寶可夢陪著我。可是我從來沒有抓過……","Then take my Zigzagoon and this Poké Ball, Wally.":"那就帶上我的蛇紋熊和這個精靈球吧，滿充。","{player}, would you go with him to Route 102 and make sure he is all right?":"{player}，你能陪他去102號道路，照看他一下嗎？","Here I go... Go, Zigzagoon!":"我要上了……去吧，蛇紋熊！","A wild Ralts appeared! Wally's Zigzagoon battles it bravely...":"野生的拉魯拉絲出現了！滿充的蛇紋熊勇敢地戰鬥著……","Wally threw the Poké Ball! ...One, two, three... Gotcha!":"滿充扔出了精靈球！……一、二、三……抓到了！","Wally caught Ralts!":"滿充抓到了拉魯拉絲！","I did it! A Pokémon of my very own! Thank you for coming with me, {player}.":"我做到了！我自己的寶可夢！謝謝你陪我來，{player}。","I will take Zigzagoon back to Norman. Maybe someday Ralts and I can battle you!":"我要把蛇紋熊還給千里先生。也許有一天，我和拉魯拉絲能和你對戰！","Wally looked so happy with his Ralts. Thank you, {player}.":"滿充和他的拉魯拉絲看起來好開心。謝謝你，{player}。","Rustboro City is north of here, past Route 104 and Petalburg Woods. Its Leader, Roxanne, is a fine first challenge in Hoenn.":"從這裡往北，經過104號道路和橙華森林就是卡那茲市。那裡的館主杜娟很適合當你在豐緣的第一個挑戰。","Come back when you hold four badges. Then we will see what a Champion can do.":"等你有了四枚徽章再來吧。到時候就讓我看看冠軍的實力。","Wally caught a Pokémon with your help? Thank you! He has not smiled like that in a long time.":"滿充在你的幫助下抓到寶可夢了？謝謝你！他已經很久沒有笑得這麼開心了。","My son Wally has always been sickly. He is leaving for Verdanturf Town soon, where the air is clean.":"我兒子滿充一直體弱多病。他很快就要搬去空氣乾淨的綠蔭鎮了。","I do hope he finds a friend to keep him company there.":"真希望他在那裡能找到一個陪伴他的朋友。","Hey, a new face! You have to battle me if our eyes meet. Those are the rules!":"嘿，生面孔！只要視線對上了就得對戰。這是規矩！","Aww, I lost!":"啊，輸了！","If you get stronger, will you battle me again sometime?":"等你變得更強了，還會再和我對戰嗎？","My Wurmple are going to grow up into something amazing. Want to see them now?":"我的刺尾蟲會長成很厲害的寶可夢。要現在看看嗎？","They will be amazing someday, I promise!":"總有一天牠們會很厲害的，我保證！","A Wurmple can evolve into two different Pokémon. Nobody knows which one until it happens!":"刺尾蟲可以進化成兩種不同的寶可夢。不到進化的那一刻，誰也不知道會是哪一種！","Tiana":"緹娜","I caught these two all by myself! Let me show you how strong they are!":"這兩隻都是我自己抓的！讓你看看牠們有多強！","You are really good...":"你真厲害……","Shroomish spreads spores. If they touch your Pokémon, it might get poisoned or fall asleep!":"蘑蘑菇會散播孢子。碰到的話，你的寶可夢可能會中毒或睡著！","I just started my journey too! Let us both do our best... by battling!":"我也才剛開始旅行！我們一起加油吧……用對戰的方式！","Wow, you are strong!":"哇，你好強！","I am going back to Oldale to heal my Pokémon. See you!":"我要回古辰鎮治療寶可夢了。再見！","Ah, a new Trainer! Norman, our Gym Leader, asks that every new Trainer drop by the Gym first. It is just up the road.":"啊，新來的訓練家！我們的道館館主千里先生說，新來的訓練家都要先去道館一趟。道館就在路的那頭。","Norman is really strong. Even Trainers with lots of badges lose to him!":"千里先生真的很強。就連有很多徽章的訓練家也會輸給他！","West of town, Route 104 runs along the beach and up into Petalburg Woods. Rustboro City is on the other side.":"城鎮西邊的104號道路沿著海灘一直通到橙華森林。卡那茲市就在森林另一邊。","Pokémon from far away often will not obey a Trainer with too few badges. Hoenn's Gyms fix that, one badge at a time!":"從遠方來的寶可夢，常常不聽徽章太少的訓練家的話。豐緣的道館會一枚一枚地幫你解決！","X items raise a stat for the rest of a battle. Very handy against a tough Gym Leader!":"能力強化道具能在整場對戰中提高一項能力。對付難纏的道館館主很有用！","They say Norman came to Petalburg from far away, a bit like you. Now nobody here can imagine the town without him.":"聽說千里先生也是從遠方搬來橙華市的，有點像你。現在這裡的人都想像不出沒有他的橙華市了。","Some Pokémon only come out when you Surf on the water. The pond in town has a few!":"有些寶可夢只有衝浪時才會出現。鎮上的池塘裡就有幾隻！","Route 102. West: Petalburg City. East: Oldale Town.":"102號道路。西：橙華市。東：古辰鎮。","Trainer tips: a Pokémon that is badly hurt is easier to catch. Weaken it first, then throw!":"訓練家小提示：傷得越重的寶可夢越容易抓。先削弱牠，再扔球！","Petalburg City. Where people live in harmony with the green of nature.":"橙華市。人們與大自然的綠意和諧共處的城市。","Petalburg City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Norman, a father who knows what real strength is.":"橙華市寶可夢道館。館主：千里，懂得何謂真正強大的父親。","Wally writes to me from Verdanturf. He says he grows stronger every day. I think you had something to do with that.":"滿充從綠蔭鎮給我寫信了。他說自己一天比一天強壯。我想這和你脫不了關係。","Yo, Champion! Norman uses Normal-type Pokémon. Fighting moves hit them hard, and his Normal moves cannot touch a Ghost type!":"嘿，冠軍！千里用的是一般屬性的寶可夢。格鬥屬性招式對牠們效果拔群，而牠們的一般屬性招式打不中幽靈屬性！","Watch out for his Slaking. It hits like a falling boulder... but it is so lazy that it only attacks every other turn.":"小心他的請假王。牠的攻擊像落石一樣猛……不過牠懶得只會隔一回合才攻擊一次。","This is the Balance Badge. You earned it in a battle I will not soon forget.":"這是平衡徽章。你在一場讓我難忘的對戰中贏得了它。","{player} received the Balance Badge from Norman!":"{player}從千里那裡得到了平衡徽章！","With five Hoenn badges, Pokémon up to level 50 will obey you, wherever they come from.":"有了五枚豐緣徽章，50級以下的寶可夢都會聽你的話，不管牠們來自哪裡。","And take this: TM42, Facade. If your Pokémon is burned, poisoned or paralyzed, it hits twice as hard.":"還有這個：招式學習器42，硬撐。如果你的寶可夢處於灼傷、中毒或麻痺狀態，威力會變成兩倍。","East of Mauville, Route 118 crosses the sea. If one of your Pokémon knows Surf, the road beyond is yours.":"紫堇市東邊的118號道路要渡海。只要你有寶可夢會衝浪，前面的路就任你走了。","Norman taught me that speed decides most battles. Let me show you!":"千里教會我，速度決定大多數對戰的勝負。讓我證明給你看！","Norman is strong, and he is fair. Losing to him always teaches you something.":"千里很強，也很公正。輸給他總能學到些什麼。","Every Pokémon in this Gym is a Normal type. Normal does not mean weak!":"這座道館裡的寶可夢全是一般屬性。一般可不代表弱！","Hmm, not bad at all.":"嗯，還真不賴。","Normal types can learn moves of many other types. Never assume you know what is coming!":"一般屬性能學會許多其他屬性的招式。千萬別以為你猜得到對手會出什麼！","George":"喬治","My Slakoth looks lazy, but just wait until it gets going!":"我的懶人獺看起來懶洋洋的，等牠動起來你就知道厲害了！","Still yawning...":"還在打哈欠……","Slakoth sleeps most of the day. Its evolution, Vigoroth, cannot keep still at all!":"懶人獺一天到晚都在睡覺。牠進化後的過動猿卻一刻也靜不下來！","So you hold four badges now. Then I will battle you, not as the man who welcomed you to Hoenn, but as a Gym Leader. Show me everything you have!":"你已經有四枚徽章了啊。那我就不以迎接你來豐緣的人，而是以道館館主的身分和你對戰。把你的全部實力都拿出來吧！","...I lost. You have grown even stronger since you came to Hoenn. I am proud to have battled you.":"……我輸了。你來到豐緣之後變得更強了。能和你對戰，我很自豪。","So you picked my door. Bad luck for you!":"原來你選了我這扇門。真是倒楣啊！","Nobody gets through this room without a battle!":"誰都別想不戰鬥就通過這個房間！","The pike is long, and your Pokémon look tired already.":"水管還很長，你的寶可夢看起來已經累了。","I have been waiting in this room for ages. Let us battle!":"我在這個房間裡等了好久。來對戰吧！","Go on, then. The next door awaits.":"去吧。下一扇門在等著你。","Your luck held this time...":"這次你的運氣不錯……","I hope the next room is kinder to you.":"希望下一個房間對你好一點。","...So you made it this far. I am Lucy, the Pike Queen. Luck brought you here. Let us see if it carries you past me.":"……你居然走到了這裡。我是水管皇后小薊。是運氣把你帶到這裡的。看看它能不能讓你越過我吧。","...You again. This time, luck will not be enough.":"……又是你。這次光靠運氣可不夠。","...Your luck is real. Take it.":"……你的運氣是真的。收下吧。","...I see. It was never only luck with you.":"……原來如此。你靠的從來不只是運氣。","Do not mind me. I am only resting my feet.":"別管我。我只是在歇歇腳。","I took the wrong door three times in a row. Good luck to you!":"我連續選錯了三次門。祝你好運！","This pike goes on and on... Which way was out again?":"這水管怎麼走都走不完……出口在哪邊來著？","A strong Trainer blocks the way!":"一位很強的訓練家擋住了去路！","Your Pokémon were all restored to full health!":"你的寶可夢全都完全恢復了！","Two Trainers are waiting together!":"兩位訓練家一起在等著！","The Pike Queen has come to battle you herself!":"水管皇后親自前來和你對戰了！","Lucy recognizes your luck. You earned the Silver Luck Symbol!":"小薊認可了你的運氣。你得到了銀色運氣象徵！","Lucy recognizes your luck. You earned the Gold Luck Symbol!":"小薊認可了你的運氣。你得到了金色運氣象徵！","The room is full of tall grass... Something is moving in it!":"房間裡長滿了高高的草……裡面有東西在動！","A {mon} jumped out and attacked!":"{mon}突然跳了出來發動攻擊！","A nurse is waiting here to look after your Pokémon.":"這裡有位護士在等著照顧你的寶可夢。","{mon} was restored to full health!":"{mon}完全恢復了！","Left door":"左邊的門","Middle door":"中間的門","Right door":"右邊的門","That door... I sense someone waiting behind it.":"那扇門……我感覺後面有人在等著。","That door... it fills me with a strange nostalgia.":"那扇門……讓我有種奇怪的懷念感。","That door... I can hear whispering behind it.":"那扇門……我聽到後面有人在小聲說話。","That door... there is a scent of Pokémon behind it.":"那扇門……後面有寶可夢的氣味。","All three doors... something terrible waits behind every one of them.":"三扇門……每一扇後面都有可怕的東西在等著。","Welcome to the Battle Pike! Choose your way through fourteen rooms.":"歡迎來到對戰水管！請選擇你的路線，穿過 14 個房間。","Enter three Pokémon. In every other room you pick one of three doors. Behind it may be a battle, a wild Pokémon, a nurse... or something worse.":"請報名 3 隻寶可夢。每隔一個房間，你要從三扇門裡選一扇。門後可能是對戰、野生寶可夢、護士……也可能是更糟的事。","Your Pokémon are not healed between rooms: only a healing room will help them. If all three faint, your challenge is over.":"房間之間寶可夢不會回復，只有回復房間能幫上忙。3 隻都倒下的話，挑戰就結束了。","Get through all fourteen rooms to finish a pass and earn Battle Points. Pokémon above level 50 battle at level 50, and items from the Bag cannot be used.":"穿過全部 14 個房間就算走完一趟，可以獲得對戰點數。超過 50 級的寶可夢按 50 級對戰，不能使用背包裡的道具。","Passes in a row: {n}. Your best: {best}.":"連續走完的趟數：{n}。最佳紀錄：{best}。","Good luck in the Pike!":"祝你在水管裡好運！","Room {n} of 14.":"第 {n} 個房間（共 14 個）。","Which door will you take?":"要走哪扇門？","You retired from the Pike.":"你退出了水管。","All your Pokémon fainted. Your challenge is over. Please try again!":"你的寶可夢全都倒下了。挑戰結束。請再接再厲！","Congratulations! You made it through the Pike!":"恭喜！你走完了水管！","Choose a door, and good luck.":"請選一扇門，祝你好運。","Listen to the maid. Her hint is about one door, and the other two will never be the same kind of room.":"好好聽女僕的話。她的提示只說一扇門，另外兩扇門絕不會是同一類房間。","If your Pokémon are worn out, a door with a strange nostalgia or with someone waiting behind it may hold a nurse.":"如果你的寶可夢累壞了，讓人懷念的門、或是後面有人在等的門，說不定會有護士。","They say the Pike Queen waits at the end of the second pass for a Trainer whose luck holds.":"聽說對於運氣一直不錯的訓練家，水管皇后會在第二趟的終點等著。","I will keep looking for rare stones here. If you find one on your travels, show me, {player}!":"我會繼續在這裡尋找稀有的石頭。如果你在旅途中找到了，記得給我看看，{player}！","{player}! So the new Champion of Hoenn found my hiding place.":"{player}！原來是豐緣的新冠軍找到了我的藏身之處。","I come to Meteor Falls to look for stones that fell from the sky. Every one of them has a story, like the meteorite Team Magma took.":"我來流星瀑布尋找從天上掉下來的石頭。每一塊都有自己的故事，就像被熔岩隊拿走的那塊隕石一樣。","Wallace told me how you battled him. I have wanted to see it for myself ever since we met in Granite Cave. Show me, {player}!":"米可利跟我說了你和他對戰的樣子。自從我們在石之洞窟見面以後，我就一直想親眼看看。讓我見識一下吧，{player}！","...Magnificent. I knew you were strong, but this... You truly are the Champion of Hoenn.":"……太精彩了。我知道你很強，但沒想到這麼強……你真不愧是豐緣的冠軍。","I left something for you at my house in Mossdeep: a Pokémon I met on my travels. I think it would be happy with a Trainer like you.":"我在綠嶺市的家裡給你留了點東西：一隻我在旅途中遇到的寶可夢。我想牠跟著你這樣的訓練家會很幸福。","Gilbert":"吉爾伯特","The currents here are a free ride west! Going east is the hard part. Let us battle!":"這裡的激流能免費把你帶往西邊！往東走才難呢。來對戰吧！","I got carried away...":"我被沖走了……","Stay in the calm water between the currents if you want to swim east.":"想往東游的話，就待在激流之間平靜的水面上吧。","I swim against the current every morning. A battle will be easy after that!":"我每天早上都逆著激流游泳。比起那個，對戰輕鬆多了！","Swept away, for once...":"難得被沖走了一次……","The currents all flow toward Slateport. Pacifidlog is the hard way.":"所有的激流都流向凱那市。去暮水鎮才是難的那條路。","Lisa & Ray":"莉莎和雷","My little brother and I never lose in the water! Two against two!":"我和弟弟在水裡從來沒輸過！二對二！","We lost... even in the water.":"我們輸了……連在水裡都輸了。","Next time we will train in the currents. Then we will win!":"下次我們要在激流裡訓練。那樣就能贏了！","Out here, the big ones bite. Like you!":"在這裡上鉤的都是大傢伙。比如你！","The currents bring the fish right to this islet. I never have to move.":"激流會把魚直接帶到這座小島來。我根本不用挪地方。","Slateport is right there, but you will not get past me!":"凱那市就在前面了，不過你別想從我這裡過去！","You swim like a Kingdra...":"你游得像刺龍王一樣……","Slateport's beach is just west. The currents make the trip from Pacifidlog so fast!":"凱那市的海灘就在西邊。有激流的話，從暮水鎮過來快得很！","I train where the currents meet the open sea. Ready?":"我在激流和大海交匯的地方修行。準備好了嗎？","Pulled under...":"被拖到水底了……","Some say a Pokémon as old as the sea itself sleeps somewhere around here.":"聽說這附近沉睡著一隻和大海一樣古老的寶可夢。","It is dark in here, but I saw you coming!":"這裡很暗，不過我早就看到你過來了！","You will not reach the top past me!":"有我在，你別想到達頂端！","One Pokémon is all I need for you.":"對付你，一隻寶可夢就夠了。","Lost in the dark? Then let us battle!":"在黑暗裡迷路了？那就來對戰吧！","Beaten in the dark...":"在黑暗中輸掉了……","Go on, the top is still far.":"去吧，離頂端還遠著呢。","Your Pokémon see better than mine in here.":"在這裡，你的寶可夢比我的看得更清楚。","Your Battle Bag holds ten kinds of items at most. Left behind: {items}.":"對戰包包最多只能放 10 種道具。捨棄了：{items}。","Welcome to the Battle Pyramid! Climb seven dark floors to reach the top.":"歡迎來到對戰金字塔！爬過 7 層黑暗的樓層，就能到達頂端。","Enter three Pokémon. Inside, your own Bag stays here: you get the Battle Bag, and whatever you find goes into it and stays there for next time.":"請登記 3 隻寶可夢。你自己的背包要留在這裡：裡面用的是對戰包包，撿到的東西都會放進去，下次挑戰還在。","Pokémon above level 50 battle at level 50, and held items stay with your own Pokémon. You cannot save inside.":"超過 50 級的寶可夢會以 50 級參加對戰，攜帶的道具會留在你自己的寶可夢身上。裡面不能存檔。","Rounds in a row: {n}. Your best: {best}.":"連續登頂的輪數：{n}。最佳紀錄：{best}。","Here is your Battle Bag. Good luck in the dark!":"這是你的對戰包包。祝你在黑暗中好運！","Floor {n} cleared.":"第 {n} 層通過了。","Floor {n} is next. Will you keep climbing?":"接下來是第 {n} 層。要繼續往上爬嗎？","Keep climbing":"繼續往上","You retired from the Pyramid.":"你退出了金字塔。","Floor {n}. It is pitch-dark...":"第 {n} 層。伸手不見五指……","Ha! You made it to the top! I am Brandon, the Pyramid King. You climbed in the dark; now show me your courage in the light!":"哈！你爬到頂端了！我是金字塔法老神代。你在黑暗中爬了上來，現在就在光明下讓我看看你的勇氣吧！","Back at the top again! Then the time for holding back is over!":"又爬到頂端來了！那我也不必再手下留情了！","What courage! You have earned this.":"好勇氣！這是你應得的。","Splendid! Nobody has climbed like you.":"太精彩了！從沒有人像你這樣爬上來過。","The Pyramid King is waiting at the top!":"金字塔法老在頂端等著你！","Brandon recognizes your courage. You earned the Silver Brave Symbol!":"神代認可了你的勇氣。你得到了銀色勇氣象徵！","Brandon recognizes your courage. You earned the Gold Brave Symbol!":"神代認可了你的勇氣。你得到了金色勇氣象徵！","Congratulations! You reached the top of the Pyramid!":"恭喜！你到達了金字塔的頂端！","All your Pokémon fainted in the dark. Your challenge is over.":"你的寶可夢在黑暗中全部倒下了。挑戰結束。","On this floor there are still {t} Trainers and {i} items. The ladder up is somewhere in the dark...":"這一層還有 {t} 個訓練家和 {i} 個道具。往上的梯子就在黑暗中的某個地方……","Every win lights up the dark a little. Beat the Trainers and you will see the way up more easily.":"每贏一場，黑暗就會亮一點。打敗訓練家，就更容易找到往上的路。","Talk to a Trainer you have beaten: they will tell you how many Trainers and items are left on that floor.":"跟打敗過的訓練家說話，他們會告訴你這一層還剩幾個訓練家和道具。","They say the Pyramid King waits at the very top for Trainers who climb three times in a row.":"聽說連續爬到頂端 3 次的訓練家，會在最頂上遇到金字塔法老。","The ladder leads up into the dark.":"梯子通往上方的黑暗。","In there, your Pokémon heal only with the items you find, and with a short rest on each landing between floors. Every battle you win lets you see a little farther in the dark.":"在裡面，寶可夢只能靠撿到的道具回復，另外每層之間的平台上可以稍作休息。每贏一場對戰，在黑暗中就能看得更遠一點。","You rest on the landing. Your Pokémon get their PP back, and any that fainted get up with half their HP.":"你在平台上休息了一下。寶可夢的 PP 都回復了，倒下的寶可夢也恢復了一半 HP。","Brandon restored your Pokémon to full health.":"神代讓你的寶可夢完全恢復了。","Fortune-teller":"占卜師","Let me read what waits for you in the Pyramid...":"讓我來看看金字塔裡有什麼在等著你……","Believe it or not, as you like. The dark keeps its own secrets.":"信不信由你。黑暗自有它的祕密。","A tingling, a crackle... The wild Pokémon ahead will try to leave yours unable to move. Paralysis!":"一陣酥麻，一陣劈啪……前面的野生寶可夢會想讓你的寶可夢動彈不得。是麻痺！","A sickly purple haze... The wild Pokémon ahead carry poison. Beware!":"一片令人作嘔的紫色煙霧……前面的野生寶可夢帶著毒。要小心！","Flames, so many flames... The wild Pokémon ahead will try to burn yours.":"火焰，好多火焰……前面的野生寶可夢會想灼傷你的寶可夢。","I see moves running dry... The wild Pokémon ahead love to drain your moves of their PP.":"我看到招式一點一點用盡……前面的野生寶可夢最愛耗光你招式的 PP。","Something floating, never touching the ground... The wild Pokémon ahead do not fear {type}-type moves.":"有什麼飄浮著，從不著地……前面的野生寶可夢不怕{type}屬性的招式。","A trap that will not let go... Some wild Pokémon ahead will not let yours run away.":"一個不會鬆開的陷阱……前面有些野生寶可夢不會讓你的寶可夢逃走。","A bitter chill... The wild Pokémon ahead bring the cold, and may freeze yours solid.":"一股刺骨的寒意……前面的野生寶可夢帶來寒冷，可能會把你的寶可夢凍住。","A flash, a roar... Some wild Pokémon ahead would rather blow themselves up than lose.":"一道閃光，一聲巨響……前面有些野生寶可夢寧可自爆也不願認輸。","A mind reaching into yours... The wild Pokémon ahead wield psychic power.":"有一股意念伸進你的腦海……前面的野生寶可夢擁有超能力。","Hard, heavy stone... {type}-type Pokémon wait in the dark ahead.":"堅硬又沉重的石頭……{type}屬性的寶可夢在前方的黑暗中等著。","Fists and fury... {type}-type Pokémon wait in the dark ahead.":"拳頭與怒火……{type}屬性的寶可夢在前方的黑暗中等著。","Rain, sun, sand, hail... The wild Pokémon ahead will change the weather to suit themselves.":"雨、陽光、沙塵、冰雹……前面的野生寶可夢會把天氣變成對自己有利。","A buzzing, a skittering... {type}-type Pokémon wait in the dark ahead.":"嗡嗡聲，窸窣聲……{type}屬性的寶可夢在前方的黑暗中等著。","A shadow within the shadows... {type}-type Pokémon wait ahead.":"影子裡的影子……{type}屬性的寶可夢在前方等著。","The sound of waves, deep in the desert... {type}-type Pokémon wait ahead.":"沙漠深處竟有海浪聲……{type}屬性的寶可夢在前方等著。","Cold breath on your neck... {type}-type Pokémon haunt the dark ahead.":"脖子後面一陣冷氣……{type}屬性的寶可夢在前方的黑暗中徘徊。","The gleam of metal... {type}-type Pokémon wait ahead.":"金屬的光澤……{type}屬性的寶可夢在前方等著。","Wings, and scales... {a}- and {b}-type Pokémon wait ahead.":"翅膀，還有鱗片……{a}屬性和{b}屬性的寶可夢在前方等著。","I see stones that changed the ones who touched them... The wild Pokémon ahead evolved by a stone.":"我看到改變了觸碰者的石頭……前面的野生寶可夢都是靠石頭進化的。","Nothing strange at all... Plain {type}-type Pokémon wait ahead. Do not let your guard down!":"沒什麼特別的……前面只是普通的{type}屬性寶可夢。可別大意！","Raised dots are carved into the wall: {braille}":"牆上刻著凸起的點：{braille}","Nothing stirs. The wall feels lifeless, as if something far away still holds it shut.":"什麼都沒有發生。牆壁毫無動靜，好像遠方還有什麼東西把它封住了。","With a deep rumble, the wall at the back of the room slides aside!":"伴隨著低沉的轟隆聲，房間深處的牆壁移開了！","Let Wailord lead the way, and let Relicanth follow at the very end.":"讓吼鯨王走在最前面，讓古空棘魚跟在最後面。","The whole chamber trembles! Far away, something heavy groans and shifts...":"整個石室都在震動！遠方有什麼沉重的東西發出聲響，移動了……","It sounded like three great doors opening, somewhere across Hoenn.":"聽起來像是豐緣某處有三扇巨大的門打開了。","Lights flicker across the ancient body. The Pokémon stirs and rises!":"古老的身體上閃起了點點光芒。寶可夢動了起來，站起身來！","All three ancient Pokémon are awake. A deep silence settles over the old ruins of Hoenn.":"三隻古代寶可夢都已經醒來。豐緣的古老遺跡重歸寂靜。","Walk once all the way around the edge of this room.":"沿著這個房間的邊緣走一整圈。","From here, two steps right and two steps down. Then show your Strength.":"從這裡往右走兩步，再往下走兩步。然後展現你的怪力。","Let a light shine in the very middle of this room.":"在這個房間的正中央，讓光芒閃耀。","Dig here.":"在此挖掘。","Long ago our people lived here by the sea, side by side with Pokémon.":"很久以前，我們的族人住在這片海邊，與寶可夢一同生活。","We feared the power of three great Pokémon, so we shut them away in three far places.":"我們畏懼三隻偉大寶可夢的力量，於是把牠們封印在三個遙遠的地方。","Rock, ice and steel: the three sleep until the giants of the sea call them.":"岩石、冰與鋼鐵：三者將一直沉睡，直到大海的巨物呼喚牠們。","The key to every door lies under the sea.":"打開每一扇門的關鍵，就在海底。","Here, in the sand, sleeps the one made of rock.":"在這片沙中，沉睡著岩石之軀者。","Here, by the sea, sleeps the one made of ice.":"在這片海邊，沉睡著寒冰之軀者。","Here, in the tomb, sleeps the one made of steel.":"在這座墓穴中，沉睡著鋼鐵之軀者。","Did you feel that rumble? The walls with the dots... something behind them is awake now!":"你感覺到剛才的震動了嗎？那些刻著點的牆壁……後面有什麼東西醒過來了！","Ruins with dotted writing hide all over Hoenn: in this cave, in the desert north of Route 111, and in a tomb on Route 120.":"豐緣各地都藏著刻有點字的遺跡：這個洞穴、111號道路北邊的沙漠，還有120號道路上的一座墓穴。","The dots are braille. I can read them, but the doors never open. They say the key sleeps in a chamber under the sea of Route 134.":"那些點是點字。我看得懂，可是門從來沒打開過。聽說關鍵沉睡在134號道路海底的一間石室裡。","These ruins have woken up! Read the wall inside again: it tells you how to open the door.":"這座遺跡甦醒了！再去讀一次裡面的牆壁吧，上面寫著開門的方法。","An old book says the three ruins answer to one chamber under the sea. Dive where the water turns deep on Route 134.":"一本古書上說，三座遺跡都聽命於海底的一間石室。到134號道路水變深的地方潛下去吧。","Inside, they say, you need the two great Pokémon of the sea: Wailord and Relicanth.":"聽說在裡面，需要大海的兩隻大寶可夢：吼鯨王和古空棘魚。","Imani":"伊瑪妮","The sea between Petalburg and Dewford is my swimming pool. Race you to a battle!":"橙華市和武鬥鎮之間的大海就是我的游泳池。來比比誰先開始對戰吧！","There is a little island to the south with a cave on it. Nobody I know has seen the back of it.":"南邊有座小島，島上有個洞穴。我認識的人裡，沒人見過洞穴深處。","Dominik":"多米尼克","A Trainer out at sea! You will not get past without a battle.":"海上有訓練家！不對戰的話可別想過去。","Washed up...":"被沖上岸了……","Wailmer grows up into Wailord, the biggest Pokémon in the sea. Can you imagine riding one?":"吼吼鯨長大會變成吼鯨王，是海裡最大的寶可夢。你能想像騎在牠背上嗎？","Beverly":"貝弗莉","My Pokémon and I swim here every day. Let us see how strong you are!":"我和我的寶可夢每天都在這裡游泳。讓我看看你有多強吧！","You were too strong for us...":"你對我們來說太強了……","Dewford is just east of here. Swim along Route 106 and you are there.":"武鬥鎮就在東邊。沿著106號道路游過去就到了。","A doorway of carved stone is set into the rock. Rows of little dots run around its frame.":"岩石上嵌著一道雕刻過的石門。門框四周刻著一排排小點。","H-help! Somebody, help me!":"救、救命啊！誰來救救我！","You there! This Zigzagoon will not leave me alone! My bag, there on the ground: take a Poké Ball and send out the Pokémon in it!":"你！這隻蛇紋熊一直纏著我！我的包就掉在地上：拿出一個精靈球，派出裡面的寶可夢！","Which Pokémon will you send out?":"要派出哪隻寶可夢？","Whew... You saved me! Thank you so much.":"呼……你救了我！太感謝了。","Whew... It ran off. Thank you for standing up to it!":"呼……牠跑掉了。謝謝你挺身而出！","I am Professor Birch. And you must be {player}, the Trainer Professor Oak wrote to me about! Come to my lab: we can talk there.":"我是小田卷博士。你就是大木博士信裡提到的訓練家{player}吧！到我的研究所來，我們在那裡聊。","Oh! You must be {player}! Dad told me all about you. I am {rival3}.":"哦！你就是{player}吧！爸爸跟我說過你的事了。我是{rival3}。","I am helping my dad keep track of Hoenn's Pokémon. You are the Champion from far away, right?":"我在幫爸爸記錄豐緣的寶可夢。你就是那位從遠方來的冠軍，對吧？","Then let me see how you battle! My Pokémon and I will not go easy on you!":"那就讓我看看你是怎麼對戰的！我和我的寶可夢可不會手下留情哦！","Wow... You really are strong! Now I see why Dad wanted your help.":"哇……你真的好強！我終於明白爸爸為什麼想找你幫忙了。","I won? Your Pokémon from home did not want to listen, did they? Hoenn's badges will fix that!":"我贏了？你從家鄉帶來的寶可夢不太聽話吧？拿到豐緣的徽章就好了！","Let's head back to the lab. Dad will want to hear about this!":"我們回研究所吧。爸爸一定很想知道！","Shh! Do not step there! I am sketching the footprints of a rare Pokémon.":"噓！別踩那裡！我正在描一隻稀有寶可夢的腳印。","Route 102 and Petalburg City are that way, but you will have to wait until I am done. It may take a while...":"102號道路和橙華市在那邊，不過你得等我畫完。可能還要好一陣子……","Professor Birch says Hoenn has more water than land. Pokémon that swim must love it here!":"小田卷博士說豐緣的水比陸地還多。會游泳的寶可夢一定很喜歡這裡！","The Pokémon Center heals your Pokémon for free. Pokémon Centers are the same in every region!":"寶可夢中心會免費治療你的寶可夢。每個地區的寶可夢中心都一樣！","Route 103 is north of here. Its pond is full of Pokémon, if you can cross the water.":"103號道路在這裡的北邊。如果能渡過水面，池塘裡有好多寶可夢。","The PC here connects to the same storage system as the ones in Kanto and Johto. Handy, isn't it?":"這裡的電腦和關都、城都的電腦連著同一個保管系統。很方便吧？","Potions and Poké Balls: that is all a new Trainer needs. Well, and a little courage!":"傷藥和精靈球：新手訓練家需要的就這些。嗯，再加上一點勇氣！","Zigzagoon zigzag through the grass, picking things up as they go. Sometimes they bring back something nice!":"蛇紋熊會在草叢裡歪歪扭扭地跑來跑去，一路撿東西。有時還會帶回好東西呢！","Route 101. North: Oldale Town. South: Littleroot Town.":"101號道路。北：古辰鎮。南：未白鎮。","Oldale Town. A town where things begin, and where they come back to.":"古辰鎮。一切從這裡開始，也會回到這裡。","Route 103. South: Oldale Town.":"103號道路。南：古辰鎮。","My sketch is finished! The road west to Petalburg City is all yours. Mind the footprints!":"我的素描畫好了！往西去橙華市的路隨你走。小心別踩到腳印哦！","There are seven more Gyms in Hoenn. Each one will teach you something new, I am sure of it.":"豐緣還有七座道館。我相信每一座都會教會你新的東西。","Devon Corporation. The doors are locked: visitors by appointment only.":"得文公司。大門鎖著：訪客須預約。","Hey, Champion! Welcome to Hoenn's first Gym. Roxanne uses Rock-type Pokémon.":"嘿，冠軍！歡迎來到豐緣的第一座道館。杜娟用的是岩石屬性的寶可夢。","Water and Grass moves work great on them. Fire, Normal and Flying moves barely scratch them.":"水屬性和草屬性的招式對牠們效果很好。火、一般和飛行屬性的招式幾乎傷不了牠們。","Picked Torchic? Train it until it evolves: Combusken's Fighting moves crack rocks. A Shroomish from Petalburg Woods helps, too.":"選了火稚雞？那就練到牠進化吧：力壯雞的格鬥屬性招式能擊碎岩石。從橙華森林抓隻蘑蘑菇也很有幫助。","And remember: above level 20, your Pokémon from home may not listen to you yet!":"還有別忘了：超過20級的話，你從家鄉帶來的寶可夢可能還不會聽你的話！","A Quick Claw sometimes lets its holder move first. Let a slow Pokémon hold it!":"先制之爪有時能讓攜帶牠的寶可夢先出手。讓慢吞吞的寶可夢帶著吧！","Welcome to the Trainers' School! Here, everyone learns the basics of battling. Even a Champion can review them!":"歡迎來到訓練家學校！大家在這裡學習對戰的基礎。就算是冠軍也可以來複習一下！","Please take this. Our best students get one.":"請收下這個。我們最優秀的學生都有一個。","This is the Stone Badge. You have earned it.":"這是原石徽章。這是你應得的。","{player} received the Stone Badge from Roxanne!":"{player}從杜娟那裡得到了原石徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 25 will obey you here in Hoenn, even ones raised far away.":"有了它，在豐緣，25級以下的寶可夢都會聽你的話，就算是在遠方長大的也一樣。","And please take this, too. TM39 is Rock Tomb: it drops boulders on the foe and slows it down.":"請也收下這個。招式學習器39是岩石封鎖：讓岩石砸向對手，還能降低對手的速度。","The Devon Corporation is the pride of Rustboro. Half the Poké Balls in Hoenn are made in that building!":"得文公司是卡那茲市的驕傲。豐緣一半的精靈球都是在那棟樓裡做的！","Roxanne is the best student the Trainers' School ever had. Now she teaches there when she is not at the Gym!":"杜娟是訓練家學校有史以來最優秀的學生。現在她不在道館的時候，就在學校教課！","They are digging a tunnel east of town, out on Route 116. Nobody gets through until it is safe.":"他們正在城東的116號道路挖隧道。在安全之前誰都不能過去。","Roxanne's Rock types shrug off Normal and Fire moves. Water and Grass wash them away!":"杜娟的岩石屬性寶可夢不怕一般和火屬性的招式。水和草屬性就能把牠們沖垮！","Great Balls catch Pokémon more easily than Poké Balls. They make them right here in Rustboro!":"超級球比精靈球更容易抓到寶可夢。就是在卡那茲市這裡做的！","I work at Devon. Someone tried to steal our research papers in Petalburg Woods! Thank goodness a Trainer stepped in.":"我在得文公司工作。有人想在橙華森林搶走我們的研究文件！幸好有一位訓練家出手相救。","Today we learned about type matchups. Water beats Fire, Fire beats Grass, Grass beats Water. Easy!":"今天我們學了屬性相剋。水剋火，火剋草，草剋水。很簡單！","Did you know some Pokémon have abilities that help in battle? Gyarados scares the Pokémon in front of it!":"你知道嗎？有些寶可夢擁有在對戰中派得上用場的特性。暴鯉龍會嚇唬面前的寶可夢！","You have to get past me before you see Roxanne. My Geodude is solid as a rock!":"想見杜娟，得先過我這一關。我的小拳石可是硬得像石頭一樣！","Crumbled...":"碎掉了……","Roxanne studied everything about Rock types. She is really smart.":"杜娟把岩石屬性研究得透透的。她真的很聰明。","Rocks and mountains! That is what I love. Let me show you why!":"岩石和高山！這就是我的最愛。讓你看看為什麼！","Even a mountain can fall...":"就連高山也會倒下……","Roxanne is up ahead. Her Nosepass always points north, did you know?":"杜娟就在前面。你知道嗎？她的朝北鼻永遠指著北方。","Hello, I am Roxanne, the Leader of the Rustboro Gym. I became a Leader to put what I learned at school into practice. A Champion from Kanto? Then let me learn from you, too!":"你好，我是卡那茲道館的館主杜娟。我當上館主，是為了把在學校學到的東西付諸實踐。關都來的冠軍？那就讓我也向你學習吧！","So... I lost. It seems I still have a great deal to learn.":"原來……我輸了。看來我要學的東西還有很多。","Rustboro City. A city of stone, where nature and science go hand in hand.":"卡那茲市。自然與科學攜手並進的石之城。","Rustboro City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Roxanne, the top student who loves rocks.":"卡那茲市寶可夢道館。館主：杜娟，熱愛岩石的優等生。","Devon Corporation. From Poké Balls to the newest gadgets: technology for Trainers.":"得文公司。從精靈球到最新的小工具：為訓練家打造的科技。","The blackboard says: \"A sleeping or frozen Pokémon cannot move. A paralyzed one is slower, and may not move.\"":"黑板上寫著：「睡著或冰凍的寶可夢無法行動。麻痺的寶可夢速度會變慢，有時無法行動。」","Sorry, the road east is closed while we move the tunnel machines. Come back a little later.":"抱歉，我們正在搬運挖隧道的機器，往東的路暫時封閉。請晚點再來。","That Team Aqua grunt ran east, toward Route 116 and the Rusturf Tunnel. Please, get our Devon Goods back!":"那個海洋隊手下往東逃了，朝116號道路和石頭隧道去了。請幫我們把得文貨物搶回來！","East: Route 116 and the Rusturf Tunnel. North: Route 115, closed for now.":"東：116號道路和石頭隧道。北：115號道路，目前封閉。","Out of my way! These Devon Goods belong to Team Aqua now!":"讓開！這些得文貨物現在是海洋隊的了！","Stop! Thief! Somebody stop him!":"站住！小偷！快攔住他！","Oh, it is you, the Trainer from Petalburg Woods! That man stole the Devon Goods, the parts we were about to ship!":"啊，是你，在橙華森林幫過我的訓練家！那個人偷走了得文貨物，那是我們正準備寄出的零件！","He ran east, toward Route 116 and the Rusturf Tunnel. Please, get them back!":"他往東邊的116號道路和石頭隧道跑了。拜託你把東西搶回來！","What? You followed me all the way in here? This tunnel does not even go anywhere!":"什麼？你居然一路追到這裡來了？這條隧道根本哪兒都通不到啊！","Fine! You want the Goods and this noisy bird back? Then beat me!":"好啊！想要回貨物和這隻吵死人的鳥？那就打贏我！","Argh! Take your stupid parts. I am out of here!":"可惡！破零件還你就是了。我閃人了！","{player} got the {item} back!":"{player}奪回了{item}！","Peeko! There you are, my girl!":"Peeko！原來你在這裡！","Peeko flew happily back to Mr. Briney.":"Peeko開心地飛回了哈奇老人身邊。","Thank you, young one! I am Briney, an old sailor. If you ever need to cross the sea, come to my cottage on Route 104. My boat is yours!":"謝謝你，年輕人！我是哈奇，一個老水手。要是你想渡海，就來104號道路的小屋找我。我的船隨你用！","Thanks to you, the Devon Goods are safe. Please take good care of them on the way to Slateport!":"多虧了你，得文貨物平安無事。去凱那市的路上請好好保管！","You got the Devon Goods back! Thank you! Our president wants to thank you himself. His office is upstairs.":"你把得文貨物搶回來了！謝謝你！我們總裁想親自向你道謝。他的辦公室在樓上。","You gave Steven my letter? Thank you. That boy is always off somewhere, looking at rocks.":"你把信交給大吾了？謝謝你。那孩子總是跑到哪裡去看石頭。","My son Steven is in Granite Cave, near Dewford Town. Mr. Briney's boat can take you across the sea.":"我兒子大吾在武鬥鎮附近的石之洞窟。哈奇老人的船可以載你渡海。","So you are the Trainer who saved our research in the woods, and then the Devon Goods! I am the president of the Devon Corporation. You have my thanks.":"原來你就是在森林裡保住了我們的研究、又搶回得文貨物的訓練家！我是得文公司的總裁。真是太感謝你了。","May I ask two favours of you? First, this letter is for my son, Steven. He is in Dewford Town, exploring Granite Cave as usual.":"我能拜託你兩件事嗎？第一，這封信是給我兒子大吾的。他在武鬥鎮，又跑去石之洞窟探險了。","Second, the Devon Goods must reach the Oceanic Museum in Slateport City. Would you take them there for us?":"第二，得文貨物必須送到凱那市的海洋博物館。你能幫我們送過去嗎？","Old Mr. Briney on Route 104 still has his boat. I am sure he would take you across the sea.":"104號道路的哈奇老人還有一艘船。他一定願意載你渡海。","Devon President":"得文公司總裁","My Machop trains every single day. Want to see how strong it got?":"我的腕力每天都在鍛鍊。想看看牠變得有多強嗎？","Machop, we need more training!":"腕力，我們還得多練練！","Fighting types hit Normal and Rock types hard. Remember that!":"格鬥屬性對一般和岩石屬性很有效。要記住哦！","I just finished class at the Trainers' School. Time to test what I learned!":"我剛在訓練家學校下課。來試試我學到的東西吧！","I should have studied harder...":"我應該再用功一點的……","The teacher says a Trainer should always know which types their Pokémon are weak to.":"老師說，訓練家一定要知道自己的寶可夢怕哪些屬性。","Did you know Nincada lives underground? I dug this one up myself!":"你知道土居忍士住在地底下嗎？這隻是我親手挖出來的！","Back into the ground...":"回地底下去吧……","They say when Nincada evolves, something strange happens. I cannot wait to see it!":"聽說土居忍士進化的時候會發生奇怪的事。我等不及想看看了！","Peeko! My Peeko! A man in a striped shirt grabbed her and ran into that tunnel! Please, young one, help an old sailor!":"Peeko！我的Peeko！一個穿條紋衣服的人抓走了牠，跑進那條隧道了！年輕人，求你幫幫我這個老水手！","Hold it! I am looking for a good rock to rest on. A battle will do too!":"站住！我在找塊好石頭歇歇腳。來場對戰也不錯！","Rocks rolled away...":"石頭滾走了……","They have been digging this tunnel for ages. The rock past here is too hard for their machines.":"他們挖這條隧道挖了好久了。再往前的岩石太硬，機器都挖不動。","We are digging toward Verdanturf Town, but the rock is too hard. If only we had a Pokémon strong enough to smash it...":"我們正在往綠蔭鎮的方向挖，可是岩石太硬了。要是有寶可夢能把它敲碎就好了……","Welcome to the Devon Corporation. Our president's office is on the third floor.":"歡迎光臨得文公司。總裁辦公室在三樓。","Route 116. East: the Rusturf Tunnel. West: Rustboro City.":"116號道路。東：石頭隧道。西：卡那茲市。","Kelsey":"凱爾西","There it is... the master of the sea, asleep at the bottom of the world. Kyogre.":"就在那裡……海洋之主，沉睡在世界的最深處。蓋歐卡。","Well, well. The kid who keeps turning up. You followed us all the way to the sea floor?":"哎呀呀，又是那個老是冒出來的小鬼。你居然一路追到海底來了？","When Kyogre wakes, the seas will rise and every Pokémon of the sea will have room to live. That is Team Aqua's dream, and you will not sink it!":"等蓋歐卡醒來，海面就會上漲，所有海裡的寶可夢都能有地方生活。這就是海洋隊的夢想，我可不會讓你把它弄沉！","Hah... You are tough, kid, I will give you that. But you are too late. The Blue Orb has been shining since we came down here.":"哈……小鬼，你確實很強，這點我承認。但你來得太遲了。從我們下到這裡開始，靛藍色寶珠就一直在發光。","Archie raises the Blue Orb. It glows with a deep blue light!":"水梧桐高高舉起靛藍色寶珠。寶珠發出了深藍色的光芒！","The water of the pool heaves. The huge Pokémon opens its eyes!":"水池裡的水翻湧起來。那隻巨大的寶可夢睜開了眼睛！","Kyogre dived into the depths and disappeared!":"蓋歐卡潛入深處，消失得無影無蹤！","Where are you going? Kyogre! I am the one who woke you!":"你要去哪裡？蓋歐卡！是我把你喚醒的啊！","Boss! The people on the surface are calling! A storm came out of nowhere, and the rain will not stop!":"老大！海面上的人傳來消息！突然來了一場暴風雨，雨一直下個不停！","Archie! Do you see what you have done? The rain up there is drowning the land!":"水梧桐！你看看你幹了什麼好事？上面的大雨快要把陸地淹沒了！","Maxie... You are one to talk. You took the Red Orb into the mountain, did you not?":"赤焰松……你還好意思說我。你不也把朱紅色寶珠帶進山裡去了嗎？","...I did. Groudon woke in the heart of the mountain, and then it was gone, just like your Kyogre. Neither of them obeys an orb, it seems.":"……沒錯。固拉多在山的深處醒來，然後就和你的蓋歐卡一樣消失了。看來牠們倆都不會聽寶珠的話。","If the master of the land and the master of the sea meet... Team Aqua, Team Magma, to the surface! We have to find them!":"要是大地之主和海洋之主碰面的話……海洋隊、熔岩隊，全員回到海面！我們得找到牠們！","Rain is pouring down from a sky as dark as night. Somewhere out at sea, Kyogre is awake.":"大雨從黑得像夜晚一樣的天空傾瀉而下。在大海的某處，蓋歐卡已經醒了。","I train on this islet where nobody bothers me. Nobody but you, it seems!":"我在這個沒人打擾的小島上修行。看來除了你以外是沒人了！","My fists hit nothing but sea spray...":"我的拳頭只打中了浪花……","Have you noticed the darker water around here? That is where the sea is deepest.":"你注意到這附近顏色比較深的海水了嗎？那裡就是海最深的地方。","Camden":"卡姆登","The currents south of Mossdeep are the best workout there is!":"綠嶺市南邊的海流是最棒的鍛鍊！","I got swept off my rhythm...":"我被沖亂了節奏……","I saw a submarine heading south the other day. Strange thing to see out here.":"前幾天我看到一艘潛水艇往南邊開去了。在這種地方看到真奇怪。","Jonah":"約拿","Something big is biting today! Is it you?":"今天有大傢伙上鉤了！是你嗎？","With a Super Rod you can hook real monsters out here.":"用厲害釣竿的話，在這裡能釣到真正的大傢伙。","Donna":"唐娜","Swimming this far from land? You must be good. Let us see!":"游到離陸地這麼遠的地方？你一定很厲害。讓我看看吧！","I need to catch my breath...":"我得喘口氣……","Route 128 is just south. The water there turns dark over something under the sea.":"128號道路就在南邊。那裡有片海水顏色很深，底下好像藏著什麼。","This reef is my secret fishing spot. Now that you know, you have to battle me!":"這片礁石是我的祕密釣點。既然被你知道了，就得跟我對戰！","Reeled in and beaten...":"被釣上來，還被打敗了……","Some days the sea goes quiet, as if something huge were sleeping under it.":"有些日子大海會變得特別安靜，就好像底下睡著什麼巨大的東西。","Kat":"凱特","Dark water like this gives me the shivers. A battle will warm me up!":"這麼深色的海水讓我直發抖。來場對戰暖暖身吧！","Brrr... I lost and I am still cold.":"嗚……輸了，而且還是好冷。","People say the dark water hides a way into a cave under the sea.":"聽說那片深色的海水底下，藏著通往海底洞窟的路。","I swam all the way from Ever Grande City. Let us see if you can keep up!":"我從彩幽市一路游過來的。看看你跟不跟得上！","You leave a big wake...":"你掀起的浪花真大……","Ever Grande City is far to the east. The strongest Trainers in Hoenn gather there.":"彩幽市在很遠的東邊。豐緣最強的訓練家都聚集在那裡。","Huh? How did you get down here without a submarine? ...Never mind, the boss went on ahead. You are too late!":"嗯？你沒有潛水艇是怎麼下來的？……算了，老大已經先走了。你來得太遲了！","This cavern is Team Aqua's now! Turn around and swim home!":"這個洞窟現在是海洋隊的了！快掉頭游回家吧！","Sunk like a stone...":"像石頭一樣沉下去了……","The boss has the Blue Orb. Once he reaches the deepest chamber, it is all over.":"老大拿著靛藍色寶珠。等他到了最深處的洞穴，一切就結束了。","You smashed your way through? Then I will smash you!":"你是把石頭砸開過來的？那我就把你也砸扁！","How are you this strong?":"你怎麼會這麼強？","There is a boulder in the way down. Good luck moving it!":"往下走的路上有塊大岩石擋著。祝你推得動！","Down here, nobody can hear you call for help!":"在這底下，就算你喊救命也沒人聽得見！","Nobody heard me lose either, I hope...":"希望也沒人聽見我輸了……","Shelly is waiting up ahead. She is still angry about the Weather Institute.":"阿泉就在前面等著。她還在為天氣研究所的事生氣呢。","Ahaha! You again? You ruined my plans at the Weather Institute. Not this time: the boss is about to wake the master of the sea!":"啊哈哈！又是你？你在天氣研究所壞了我的好事。這次可不會了：老大馬上就要喚醒海洋之主了！","Ahaha... Beaten again. Go on, then. You will see what the boss is made of.":"啊哈哈……又輸了。那你去吧。你會見識到老大的厲害的。","Go on. The boss is in the deepest chamber. Ahaha... I wonder what you will find there.":"去吧。老大就在最深處的洞穴裡。啊哈哈……真想知道你會在那裡看到什麼。","A huge Pokémon lies still at the bottom of the pool. It seems to be asleep.":"一隻巨大的寶可夢靜靜地躺在水池底部。牠好像在睡覺。","A dark opening in the rock. Bubbles rise from inside it.":"岩石上有個黑漆漆的洞口。有氣泡從裡面冒出來。","Team Aqua's submarine is moored at the rock. Its hatch is open, and nobody is aboard.":"海洋隊的潛水艇停靠在岩石邊。艙門開著，裡面一個人也沒有。","{player}! You made it out of the cavern. I saw the sky turn black from Mossdeep and came as fast as I could.":"{player}！你從洞窟裡出來了。我在綠嶺市看到天空變黑，就盡快趕過來了。","Kyogre is not the only one awake. Groudon has risen too, and both of them are heading for Sootopolis City.":"醒來的不只是蓋歐卡。固拉多也甦醒了，牠們倆正朝著琉璃市前進。","Sootopolis lies inside a crater on Route 126, west of Route 127. By sea, the only way in is under the water: Dive in the deep water south of the crater and you will come up in the city's lake.":"琉璃市位於127號道路西邊、126號道路上的一個火山口裡。從海上進去的唯一辦法就是走水下：在火山口南邊的深水處潛水，就能從城市的湖裡浮上來。","I will fly ahead. Hurry, {player}!":"我先飛過去。快點，{player}！","John & Jay":"約翰和傑伊","We have battled side by side for fifty years. Shall we show you how it is done?":"我們並肩對戰已經五十年了。要不要讓你見識一下？","Fifty years, and still learning.":"五十年了，還在學習呢。","A good partner covers your weaknesses. That goes for Pokémon too.":"好搭檔能彌補你的弱點。寶可夢也是一樣。","Ah, those are the parts from Devon? Splendid! I am the captain of this museum's research ship. Thank you for bringing them all this way.":"這就是得文公司的零件嗎？太好了！我是這間博物館研究船的船長。謝謝你一路送過來。","Hold it right there! Those Devon parts are coming with us. Team Aqua needs them more than some museum does!":"站住！那些得文公司的零件要跟我們走。海洋隊可比什麼博物館更需要它們！","Huh? You again, the kid from the tunnel? Fine. This time we are two!":"嗯？又是你，隧道裡那個小鬼？好啊。這次我們有兩個人！","No way... Hey, your turn! Do not let this kid get away with it!":"怎麼可能……喂，換你上！別讓這小鬼得逞！","Enough. So you are the one who keeps getting in our way.":"夠了。原來一直在妨礙我們的就是你。","I am Archie, the leader of Team Aqua. Every Pokémon, and every person, was born from the sea. We want to give it back the space it once had.":"我是海洋隊的首領水梧桐。所有的寶可夢和人類，都誕生於大海。我們要把大海曾經擁有的空間還給它。","Keep your parts, then. But know this: nobody stands between Team Aqua and the sea. Let us go!":"零件就留給你們吧。不過記住：誰也別想擋在海洋隊和大海之間。我們走！","{player} handed over the {item}.":"{player}交出了{item}。","What a scare! Thank you. With these parts, our submarine will reach the bottom of the sea. Team Aqua must never get their hands on it.":"真是嚇死人了！謝謝你。有了這些零件，我們的潛水艇就能到達海底了。絕不能讓海洋隊得到它。","If you are heading north, Route 110 leads to Mauville City. Its Gym Leader, Wattson, is a cheerful old man who loves electricity.":"要往北走的話，110號道路通往紫堇市。那裡的道館館主鐵旋是個熱愛電力的開朗老爺爺。","{player}! I heard you got the Devon Goods to Slateport. Dad told me everything!":"{player}！聽說你把得文貨物送到凱那市了。爸爸都跟我說了！","My Pokémon and I have grown a lot since Route 103. Let's see whose team is stronger now!":"從103號道路到現在，我和我的寶可夢都成長了很多。來看看現在誰的隊伍更強吧！","Wow... You are still way ahead of me. But I am catching up, just you wait!":"哇……你還是比我強好多。不過我會追上你的，等著瞧吧！","Yes! I won! Your Pokémon from home still will not listen, will they?":"太好了！我贏了！你從家鄉帶來的寶可夢還是不聽話吧？","Mauville City is just up ahead. Good luck with Wattson. See you around!":"紫堇市就在前面了。祝你挑戰鐵旋順利。再見！","Thanks to you, our submarine will soon explore the deepest sea. Team Aqua will not get near it, I promise you that.":"多虧了你，我們的潛水艇很快就能探索最深的海底了。我保證不會讓海洋隊靠近它。","I am waiting for some important parts from the Devon Corporation. Without them, our submarine cannot dive.":"我在等得文公司送來的重要零件。沒有它們，我們的潛水艇就沒辦法下潛。","Ships from all over the world dock in Slateport. You can smell the sea in every street!":"世界各地的船都會停靠凱那市。每條街上都聞得到大海的味道！","The captain of the Oceanic Museum is building a submarine to explore the bottom of the sea. Imagine what lives down there!":"海洋博物館的船長正在造一艘潛水艇，要去探索海底。真想知道那下面住著什麼！","Route 110 is north of town. Follow it and you will reach Mauville City, the biggest city in Hoenn.":"城北就是110號道路。順著走就能到達豐緣最大的城市紫堇市。","Some people wear blue bandanas around town lately. They say they want to give the land back to the sea. Strange...":"最近鎮上有些人戴著藍色頭巾。聽說他們想把陸地還給大海。真奇怪……","Super Potions heal more than Potions. Worth every coin before a big battle!":"好傷藥比傷藥回復得多。大戰之前花這個錢很值得！","This is the museum's shipyard. We are building a submarine here! The captain is at the Oceanic Museum today.":"這裡是博物館的造船廠。我們在這裡造潛水艇！船長今天在海洋博物館。","With the parts from Devon, our submarine will be able to dive deeper than any before it.":"有了得文公司的零件，我們的潛水艇就能潛得比以往任何潛水艇都深。","The sea gives us everything: fish, salt, the wind for our ships. I could never live anywhere else.":"大海給了我們一切：魚、鹽，還有吹動船帆的風。我在別的地方可活不下去。","Welcome to the Oceanic Museum! The exhibits on the second floor are about the sea and the Pokémon that live in it.":"歡迎來到海洋博物館！二樓的展覽介紹大海和生活在海裡的寶可夢。","The boss told us to wait here. ...What? I am just looking at the exhibits!":"老大叫我們在這裡等著。……幹嘛？我只是在看展覽啦！","Hey, quit staring. Go and look at the fish or something.":"喂，別盯著看了。去看你的魚吧。","Isabel":"伊莎貝爾","Plusle and Minun always cheer each other on. Watch them work together!":"正電拍拍和負電拍拍總是互相加油。看牠們聯手吧！","Even with all that cheering...":"就算那麼努力加油……","When Plusle and Minun fight side by side, they make each other stronger. One on one, not so much.":"正電拍拍和負電拍拍並肩作戰時會互相增強。一對一的話就沒那麼厲害了。","Edward":"愛德華","I saw you coming in my mind. I also saw myself winning!":"我在腦海中看到你來了。也看到了我贏的樣子！","Abra teleports away when it senses danger. Catching one takes quick thinking.":"凱西一感覺到危險就會瞬間移動逃走。想抓到牠得反應很快才行。","Dale":"戴爾","This pond has the best fish this side of Slateport. Here, meet my catch!":"這個池塘的魚是凱那市這一帶最棒的。來看看我釣到的！","Washed away...":"被沖走了……","Wailmer can blow water out of its nostrils. It is bigger than it looks, too!":"吼吼鯨會從鼻孔噴水。而且牠比看起來還要大！","Mauville is just up the road! But you are not getting past me without a battle!":"紫堇市就在前面！不過不跟我對戰，你別想過去！","Zapped...":"被電暈了……","Wattson's Gym is full of Electric types. Something that can block electricity would help!":"鐵旋的道館全是電屬性的寶可夢。要是有能擋住電的寶可夢就好了！","Slateport City. The port where people and the sea meet.":"凱那市。人與大海相遇的港口。","The Oceanic Museum. Learn all about the wonders of the sea!":"海洋博物館。來認識大海的奇妙吧！","A model of the deep sea floor. It is so dark down there that some Pokémon make their own light.":"深海海底的模型。那裡暗得連一些寶可夢都會自己發光。","A model of a sea current. Currents carry warm water from the south seas all the way to Hoenn.":"洋流的模型。洋流把南方海域的溫暖海水一路帶到豐緣。","A model of a submarine. Below it, a note: \"Built in Slateport. Diving soon.\"":"潛水艇的模型。下面有張紙條：「凱那市製造。即將下潛。」","A model of a sea basin. Long ago, they say, the seas of Hoenn were wider than they are today.":"海盆的模型。據說很久以前，豐緣的海比現在還要寬廣。","Fossils of ancient sea Pokémon. Some lived millions of years ago.":"古代海洋寶可夢的化石。有些生活在幾百萬年前。","Route 110. North: Mauville City. South: Slateport City.":"110號道路。北：紫堇市。南：凱那市。","Route 110. North: Mauville City.":"110號道路。北：紫堇市。","Black clouds hang over the crater. In the middle of the city, two enormous Pokémon face each other!":"烏雲籠罩著火山口。在城市中央，兩隻巨大的寶可夢正互相對峙！","Groudon, the master of the land, and Kyogre, the master of the sea. Rain and scorching sun battle over Sootopolis.":"大地之主固拉多，與海洋之主蓋歐卡。暴雨與烈日在琉璃市上空交替肆虐。","A roar splits the clouds. Rayquaza swoops down over the crater!":"一聲咆哮撕裂了雲層。烈空坐朝著火山口俯衝而下！","Rayquaza roars again. Groudon and Kyogre fall still, and the fury goes out of them.":"烈空坐再次咆哮。固拉多和蓋歐卡停了下來，怒氣也隨之消散。","Kyogre sank back into the sea, Groudon went back into the earth, and Rayquaza flew off into the sky. The clouds over Sootopolis break apart.":"蓋歐卡沉回了大海，固拉多回到了大地深處，烈空坐也飛向了天空。琉璃市上空的烏雲散開了。","It is over. You woke Rayquaza and brought it here, {player}. Hoenn owes you its skies and its seas.":"結束了。是你喚醒了烈空坐，把牠帶到了這裡，{player}。豐緣的天空與大海都要感謝你。","My teacher Juan is back in the Gym. Go and earn the last badge. Then come to Ever Grande City: I will be waiting there.":"我的老師亞當已經回到道館了。去贏得最後一枚徽章吧。然後來彩幽市，我會在那裡等你。","I knew you could do it. Thank you, {player}. I will be watching your journey to the League.":"我就知道你做得到。謝謝你，{player}。我會關注你前往聯盟的旅程。","You must be {player}. Steven told me about you. I am Wallace. I used to lead this city's Gym.":"你就是{player}吧。大吾跟我提過你。我是米可利，以前是這座城市的道館館主。","Groudon and Kyogre will not stop until one of them falls, and Hoenn will fall with them. Long ago, only one Pokémon could end their fight: Rayquaza, who lives above the clouds.":"固拉多和蓋歐卡不分出勝負是不會停下的，豐緣也會跟著毀滅。很久以前，能平息牠們戰鬥的只有一隻寶可夢：住在雲層之上的烈空坐。","Rayquaza rests at the top of the Sky Pillar, on Route 131. Sail west from Route 128, across Routes 129 and 130.":"烈空坐在131號道路的天空柱頂端休息。從128號道路往西，穿過129號和130號道路就能到。","I will go ahead and unseal the tower's door. Meet me there, {player}!":"我先過去解開塔門的封印。我們在那裡會合吧，{player}！","A long green Pokémon lies coiled at the very top of the pillar, as if it had slept here for a thousand years.":"一隻修長的綠色寶可夢盤臥在天空柱的最頂端，彷彿已經在這裡沉睡了一千年。","Rayquaza opened its eyes! It looked toward Sootopolis... and shot up into the clouds!":"烈空坐睜開了眼睛！牠望向琉璃市的方向……然後衝進了雲層！","It is flying to Sootopolis City. Hurry back!":"牠正飛往琉璃市。快回去吧！","Rayquaza has come back to the top of the pillar. It looks down at you, waiting.":"烈空坐回到了天空柱的頂端。牠俯視著你，像是在等待著什麼。","Rayquaza is still there, watching you.":"烈空坐還在那裡，注視著你。","The wind at the top of the Sky Pillar falls quiet.":"天空柱頂端的風靜了下來。","The League awaits you at Ever Grande City. Go and show them the beauty I saw today.":"聯盟在彩幽市等著你。去讓他們見識一下我今天看到的那份美吧。","Wallace went to the Sky Pillar? Then go after him, {player}. I will keep watch over the city.":"米可利去天空柱了？那你快追上去吧，{player}。我會守著這座城市。","{player}! Look at them... If Groudon and Kyogre keep fighting, the rain and the drought will swallow all of Hoenn.":"{player}！你看牠們……如果固拉多和蓋歐卡繼續打下去，暴雨和乾旱會吞沒整個豐緣。","There is someone who knows the old legends: Wallace, who once led this city's Gym. He went into the Cave of Origin, just behind me. Please, talk to him.":"有個人了解古老的傳說：米可利，他以前是這座城市的道館館主。他進了我身後的覺醒祠堂。拜託你去找他談談。","The Gym's door is shut. A note on it says: \"Closed until the storm passes.\"":"道館的門關著。上面貼著一張紙條：「暴風雨過去之前暫停開放。」","Yo, Champion! Juan uses Water-type Pokémon. Grass and Electric moves are your best friends here!":"嗨，未來的冠軍！亞當用的是水屬性寶可夢。在這裡，草屬性和電屬性的招式就是你最好的朋友！","Watch out for his Kingdra: it is part Dragon, so only Dragon moves hit it hard. And slide carefully on the ice!":"小心他的刺龍王：牠也是龍屬性，只有龍屬性招式才能重創牠。還有，在冰上滑的時候要小心！","The Rain Badge is yours. It is the last of Hoenn's eight badges.":"雨滴徽章是你的了。這是豐緣八枚徽章中的最後一枚。","{player} received the Rain Badge from Juan!":"{player}從亞當那裡得到了雨滴徽章！","With all eight Hoenn badges, every Pokémon will obey you, whatever its level.":"有了豐緣的全部八枚徽章，無論多少級的寶可夢都會聽你的話。","And take TM03, Water Pulse. Its ripples can leave your opponent confused.":"還有，收下招式學習器03，水之波動。它的波紋有時會讓對手混亂。","Now go east along Route 128 to Ever Grande City. The Pokémon League waits for you beyond Victory Road.":"現在沿著128號道路往東去彩幽市吧。寶可夢聯盟就在冠軍之路的另一頭等著你。","The tower's door is sealed shut. Old letters are carved deep into the stone.":"塔門被封得死死的。石頭上深深刻著古老的文字。","Dean":"迪恩","A storm like this is a swimmer's worst nightmare. Or best training!":"這種暴風雨是游泳選手最可怕的噩夢。也可以說是最好的訓練！","I got pulled under...":"我被捲到水底下了……","Sootopolis City is inside that crater. You can only get in from under the water.":"琉璃市就在那個火山口裡。只能從水底下進去。","The rain will not stop! Let us battle while we wait for it to clear.":"雨一直下個不停！趁著等雨停，我們來對戰吧。","The dark water south of the crater is where the divers go down.":"潛水的人都是從火山口南邊那片深色的海水下去的。","Merle":"默爾","The fish bite like crazy before a storm. What did I hook this time?":"暴風雨來之前，魚咬鉤咬得特別兇。這次我釣到什麼了？","Snapped my line!":"魚線斷了！","My grandfather said the storms of legend came when the masters of land and sea fought.":"我爺爺說過，傳說中的暴風雨，都是大地和海洋之主打起來的時候出現的。","Kyogre glares across the lake, calling down the rain.":"蓋歐卡在湖中怒視著對岸，召喚著大雨。","Groudon roars, and the air around it burns with heat.":"固拉多發出咆哮，周圍的空氣熱得發燙。","The sky is blue again! For a while I thought the sea and the land would swallow the whole city.":"天空又變藍了！有一陣子我還以為大海和大地要把整座城市吞沒了。","They say a Pokémon that lives in the sky calmed the storm. Sootopolis has never seen anything like it.":"聽說是一隻住在天上的寶可夢平息了暴風雨。琉璃市從來沒見過這種事。","Sootopolis is built inside a crater. Without a Pokémon that can Dive or Fly, you cannot even get here!":"琉璃市建在火山口裡。沒有會潛水或飛翔的寶可夢，連來都來不了！","Max Potions and Revives. In a city at the bottom of a crater, it pays to be ready.":"全滿藥和活力碎片。住在火山口底部的城市，還是有備無患比較好。","The legends say the masters of land and sea once fought until the sky itself stepped in. I never thought I would see it.":"傳說中，大地與海洋之主曾經一直打到天空親自出手為止。我從沒想過能親眼看到。","Juan is the best Gym Leader in Hoenn! He even taught Wallace, and Wallace is amazing.":"亞當是豐緣最厲害的道館館主！他還當過米可利的老師呢，米可利超厲害的。","Olivia":"奧莉維亞","You crossed the ice without falling? How graceful. Let us see if your battling is as pretty.":"你走過冰面都沒有摔倒？真優雅。讓我看看你的對戰是不是也一樣漂亮。","Not a hair out of place, and still I lost...":"我連頭髮都沒亂，竟然還是輸了……","Juan says a battle should flow like water. Beauty and strength, together.":"亞當說過，對戰應該像流水一樣。美麗與力量，兩者兼備。","Bethany":"貝瑟妮","My Azumarill is the cutest Water type in Hoenn! And the strongest!":"我的瑪力露麗是豐緣最可愛的水屬性寶可夢！也是最強的！","My darlings...":"我的寶貝們……","Azumarill's ears can hear the smallest ripple. Juan's Pokémon are just as sharp.":"瑪力露麗的耳朵連最小的水波聲都聽得到。亞當的寶可夢也一樣敏銳。","Slipping on the ice already? A battle will help you find your feet.":"已經在冰上打滑了？來場對戰幫你站穩腳跟吧。","I am the one who slipped...":"摔倒的是我才對……","Slide until something stops you. The rocks on the ice are your friends.":"一直滑到被東西擋住為止。冰上的岩石就是你的好幫手。","Crissy":"克莉希","I came to Juan's Gym to learn the art of Water types. Watch this!":"我來亞當的道館學習水屬性的技藝。看好了！","I still have so much to learn.":"我要學的東西還多著呢。","Juan's Kingdra is part Dragon. Normal Water-type weaknesses do not work on it.":"亞當的刺龍王也是龍屬性。水屬性的一般弱點對牠不管用。","Ah, so you are the Trainer who brought the sky's master to our city. I am Juan, the Leader of this Gym, and Wallace's teacher. Water and I move as one. Show me the elegance of the bond between you and your Pokémon!":"啊，原來你就是把天空之主帶到我們城市的訓練家。我是這座道館的館主亞當，也是米可利的老師。水與我融為一體。讓我看看你和寶可夢之間那份優雅的羈絆吧！","Ahahaha! Splendid! Your battle washed over me like a great wave. I have nothing left to teach you.":"啊哈哈哈！精彩！你的對戰就像巨浪一樣朝我撲來。我已經沒有什麼可以教你的了。","Reese":"里斯","Heading west? The storm thins out the farther you swim. Battle me first!":"要往西去嗎？越往西游，暴風雨就越小。先跟我對戰吧！","Out of the storm and out of luck...":"躲過了暴風雨，卻沒躲過失敗……","Past Route 130 is Route 131. You can see the Sky Pillar from there on a clear day.":"過了130號道路就是131號道路。天氣好的時候，從那裡能看到天空柱。","Tara":"塔拉","My Starmie's core shines like a star even in the rain!":"就算在雨中，我的寶石海星的核心也像星星一樣閃耀！","My star went out...":"我的星星熄滅了……","A Starmie's core glows brighter the stronger it gets.":"寶石海星越強，牠的核心就越亮。","This patch of sea is my training ground. Let us see what you have!":"這片海域是我的訓練場。讓我看看你的本事！","That was a real workout...":"這才叫真正的鍛鍊……","Katie":"凱蒂","The sun is out over here! Perfect weather for a battle!":"這邊出太陽了！正是對戰的好天氣！","At least I have a nice tan...":"至少我曬出了漂亮的膚色……","Pacifidlog Town floats on the sea, just past Route 131.":"暮水鎮就漂浮在131號道路過去一點的海面上。","I have unsealed the door of the Sky Pillar. Rayquaza sleeps at the very top. Go, {player}!":"我已經解開天空柱大門的封印了。烈空坐就在最頂層沉睡。去吧，{player}！","Kevin":"凱文","That tower is the Sky Pillar. Nobody has opened its door in ages. But first, a battle!":"那座塔就是天空柱。好多年都沒人打開過它的門了。不過先來對戰吧！","You swim and battle like a pro.":"你游泳和對戰都像個高手。","They say a dragon of the sky sleeps at the top of the Sky Pillar.":"聽說天空柱的頂端睡著一條天空之龍。","Talia":"塔莉亞","Pacifidlog is just west of here. Show me how strong you are before you go!":"暮水鎮就在西邊。走之前讓我看看你有多強！","Sunk!":"沉下去了！","Pacifidlog has a Pokémon Center. Rest there before you climb the Sky Pillar.":"暮水鎮有寶可夢中心。爬天空柱之前先去那裡休息一下吧。","West of here the currents run so strong that nobody can swim against them. Maybe someday...":"從這裡往西，海流強得誰都游不過去。也許總有一天……","I swam here from Route 131. The Sky Pillar is just east, on the island in the south.":"我是從131號道路游過來的。天空柱就在東邊，在南邊的那座島上。","Our town was built on the backs of Corsola long ago, or so my grandmother told me. Now we live on logs.":"我奶奶說，很久以前我們的鎮子是建在太陽珊瑚背上的。現在我們住在木頭上。","The Sky Pillar? My father said its door has been sealed since before anyone can remember.":"天空柱？我爸爸說，它的門從沒人記得的年代起就一直封著。","Sootopolis City. A town of white stone in the heart of an old crater.":"琉璃市。位於古老火山口中心的白石之城。","Pacifidlog Town. Where the morning sun shines on the floating logs.":"暮水鎮。晨光灑落在漂浮木頭上的小鎮。","Look out of my window! There is an island out on Route 130 today. It is not on any map, you know.":"從我的窗戶往外看！今天130號道路上有一座島。那座島可不在任何地圖上哦。","Some days it is there, most days it is not. Go and see it before the sea takes it back!":"有些日子它在，大多數日子都不在。趁大海還沒把它收回去，快去看看吧！","Some days I see an island from this window, out on Route 130. Not today, though.":"有些日子，我從這扇窗戶能看到130號道路上有一座島。不過今天看不到。","They say it shows itself to Trainers who bring the right Pokémon along. Try others with you, or come back tomorrow.":"聽說只有帶著合適的寶可夢的訓練家才看得到它。換幾隻寶可夢帶在身邊試試，或者明天再來吧。","An island that is on no map. The grass is soft, and something small is moving in it.":"一座不在任何地圖上的島。草地軟軟的，裡面有什麼小東西在動。","Mirage Island. Tomorrow it may be gone again, but you were here.":"幻影島。明天它也許又會消失，但你確實來過這裡。","Some days an island with grass on it shows up out here. Other days there is only the sea.":"有些日子這裡會冒出一座長著草的小島，有些日子又只剩下大海。","I have trained for this tower for years. Let us see what you have!":"我為了這座塔訓練了好多年。讓我看看你的實力吧！","Only the strongest climb this tower. Show me you belong here!":"只有最強的人才能登上這座塔。證明你有資格站在這裡吧！","My team is ready. Is yours?":"我的隊伍已經準備好了。你的呢？","A new challenger? Do not expect me to go easy on you.":"新的挑戰者？可別指望我會手下留情。","Every battle here is a test, and I intend to pass mine!":"在這裡，每場對戰都是考驗，而我打算通過我的考驗！","I heard about your streak. It ends with me!":"我聽說你連勝的事了。就讓我來終結它！","I see... You really are strong.":"原來如此……你真的很強。","My training was not enough...":"我的訓練還不夠……","What a battle! Keep climbing.":"真是一場好對戰！繼續往上爬吧。","Beaten... but I learned something today.":"輸了……不過今天我學到了東西。","Your streak goes on. Impressive.":"你的連勝還在繼續。真厲害。","So you are the one climbing my tower. I am Anabel, the Salon Maiden. Let me see how deep your bond with your Pokémon runs.":"原來正在攀登我這座塔的人就是你。我是沙龍女主人莉拉。讓我看看你和寶可夢之間的羈絆有多深吧。","You came back. This time I will not hold anything back.":"你回來了。這次我會全力以赴。","...Impressive. Your Pokémon trust you completely.":"……真了不起。你的寶可夢完全信任你。","There is nothing left for me to test. You are truly strong.":"我已經沒有什麼可以考驗你的了。你真的很強。","Welcome to the Battle Tower! This counter is for double battles.":"歡迎來到對戰塔！這個櫃台受理雙打對戰。","Welcome to the Battle Tower! This counter is for single battles.":"歡迎來到對戰塔！這個櫃台受理單打對戰。","In the Battle Tower, you battle Trainers one after another. Win seven in a row to finish a set and earn Battle Points.":"在對戰塔裡，你要一個接一個地和訓練家對戰。連贏七場就完成一輪，可以得到對戰點數。","Enter three Pokémon for single battles, or four for double battles. They must all be different species holding different items, and some legendary Pokémon cannot enter.":"單打要報名三隻寶可夢，雙打要報名四隻。牠們必須是不同種類、攜帶不同道具，而且有些傳說寶可夢不能參加。","Here, Pokémon above level 50 battle at level 50, and items from the Bag cannot be used. Win or lose, your Pokémon will be just as they were.":"在這裡，超過50級的寶可夢會以50級出戰，而且不能使用背包裡的道具。不論輸贏，你的寶可夢都會保持原樣。","Wins in a row: {n}. Your best: {best}.":"目前連勝：{n}場。最高紀錄：{best}場。","Would you like to take the challenge?":"要接受挑戰嗎？","You need at least {n} Pokémon that can enter.":"你需要至少{n}隻可以參加的寶可夢。","Cannot enter":"不能參加","Same species":"同種寶可夢","Same item":"道具重複","Choose Pokémon {k} of {n}.":"請選擇第{k}隻寶可夢（共{n}隻）。","No. {k}":"第{k}隻","Thank you. Please follow me to the battle room.":"謝謝。請跟我到對戰室來。","The Salon Maiden has come to battle you herself!":"沙龍女主人親自前來和你對戰了！","Battle No. {n}! Here comes your opponent.":"第{n}場對戰！對手來了。","Your streak is over. Wins in a row: {n}. Please try again!":"你的連勝結束了。連勝：{n}場。請再接再厲！","Anabel recognizes your strength. You earned the Silver Print!":"莉拉認可了你的實力。你得到了銀色印記！","Anabel recognizes your strength. You earned the Gold Print!":"莉拉認可了你的實力。你得到了金色印記！","{player} earned {n} BP!":"{player}得到了{n}BP！","Congratulations! You won seven battles in a row!":"恭喜！你取得了七連勝！","Battle No. {n} is next. Will you keep going?":"下一場是第{n}場對戰。要繼續嗎？","Retire":"放棄","You retired. Wins in a row: {n}.":"你放棄了挑戰。連勝：{n}場。","Your streak goes on: next time, you will start from battle No. {n}.":"你的連勝會繼續：下次將從第{n}場對戰開始。","This is the Exchange Service Corner. Your Battle Points can be traded for prizes here.":"這裡是兌換服務處。你可以用對戰點數兌換獎品。","You have {n} BP. What would you like?":"你有{n}BP。想要什麼呢？","Which one would you like?":"你想要哪一個？","{item} · {n} BP":"{item} · {n}BP","You do not have enough BP.":"你的BP不夠。","The door to the battle room. Challengers must register at one of the counters first.":"通往對戰室的門。挑戰者必須先到櫃台報名。","{player}! We meet again. I came to look at the stones along this shore.":"{player}！我們又見面了。我是來看這片岸邊的石頭的。","I heard what happened on Mt. Chimney. Team Magma wants more land, Team Aqua wants more sea... Either way, Hoenn would never be the same.":"我聽說了煙囪山發生的事。熔岩隊想要更多陸地，海洋隊想要更多海洋……不管哪一方得逞，豐緣都會面目全非。","The weather has been strange lately, too: sudden droughts, sudden storms. North of here, Route 119 leads to the Weather Institute, where they study exactly that.":"最近的天氣也很奇怪：一下子乾旱，一下子暴雨。從這裡往北，119號道路通往天氣研究所，那裡就在研究這件事。","Fortree City lies beyond it. Its Gym Leader, Winona, soars through the sky with her bird Pokémon. I am sure you will meet her soon.":"再往前就是茵鬱市。那裡的道館館主娜琪和她的鳥寶可夢一起在天空翱翔。我相信你很快就會見到她。","Until next time, {player}. Take good care of your Pokémon.":"下次見，{player}。好好照顧你的寶可夢。","{player}! You came to visit? The air here is so clean, I already feel stronger.":"{player}！你來看我啦？這裡的空氣好乾淨，我已經覺得自己變強了。","Ralts and I train every day. One day we will battle you again, and that time we will not lose!":"我和拉魯拉絲每天都在訓練。總有一天我們會再跟你對戰，那時我們一定不會輸！","Oh, {player}! The air in Verdanturf is so clean. Ralts and I go for a walk every morning.":"啊，{player}！綠蔭鎮的空氣好乾淨。我和拉魯拉絲每天早上都去散步。","Wally talks about you all the time. Thank you for being such a good friend to him.":"滿充總是提起你。謝謝你對他這麼好。","My boyfriend is digging a tunnel all the way from Rustboro, just so he can come and see me.":"我男朋友為了來見我，從卡那茲市一路挖隧道過來。","But they hit a rock nobody can break. He says only a Pokémon could smash it... I hope someone helps him.":"可是他們挖到了一塊誰也敲不碎的岩石。他說只有寶可夢才能把它擊碎……希望有人能幫幫他。","Wally's Aunt":"滿充的阿姨","Lydia":"莉迪亞","The flowers along Route 117 are my favourite. My Pokémon love them too!":"117號道路邊的花是我的最愛。我的寶可夢也很喜歡！","My petals fell...":"花瓣都掉了……","Roselia has a red rose on one hand and a blue one on the other. Their scent can make you sleepy!":"毒薔薇一隻手上是紅玫瑰，另一隻手上是藍玫瑰。牠們的香氣會讓人想睡覺！","Dylan":"迪倫","I run along this road every morning with Linoone. Keep up if you can!":"我每天早上都和直衝熊在這條路上跑步。跟得上就來吧！","Linoone runs very fast, but only in straight lines. Corners are its weak spot!":"直衝熊跑得很快，可是只會跑直線。轉彎是牠的弱點！","Volbeat and Illumise light up the night together. Want to see?":"電螢蟲和甜甜螢會一起照亮夜空。想看看嗎？","The lights went out...":"燈光熄滅了……","Volbeat follows the sweet scent of Illumise. At night they draw shapes in the sky with their lights.":"電螢蟲會追著甜甜螢的香甜氣味飛。到了晚上，牠們會用光在夜空中畫出圖案。","Some people come all the way to Route 117 just for the flowers. I come for the quiet.":"有人專程來117號道路看花。我是來享受清靜的。","The mountains around Verdanturf keep the ash from Mt. Chimney away. That is why our air is so clean!":"綠蔭鎮周圍的群山擋住了煙囪山的火山灰。所以我們這裡的空氣才這麼乾淨！","A sickly boy moved here not long ago. He walks with his Ralts every morning, and he looks better every day.":"前不久有個體弱的男孩搬來這裡。他每天早上都和拉魯拉絲散步，氣色一天比一天好。","The Rusturf Tunnel goes west to Route 116 and Rustboro City. They stopped digging when they hit a rock too hard to break.":"石頭隧道往西通往116號道路和卡那茲市。挖到一塊硬得敲不碎的岩石後就停工了。","People come to Verdanturf to rest and get well. Even the Pokémon here seem calmer.":"大家來綠蔭鎮休養身體。連這裡的寶可夢好像都比較安詳。","Escape Rope takes you straight out of a cave. Handy in the Rusturf Tunnel!":"離洞繩能讓你馬上離開洞窟。在石頭隧道裡很好用！","Deandre":"迪安德烈","Mauville is right behind me. Show me what a Trainer from the big city can do!":"紫堇市就在我身後。讓我看看大城市來的訓練家有什麼本事！","I should have stayed in town...":"我應該待在城裡的……","You need a Pokémon that can Surf to cross the water. Then the whole road is yours.":"要渡過這片水，得有會衝浪的寶可夢。之後整條路就任你走了。","Barny":"巴尼","This channel is full of fish that bite. So are my Pokémon!":"這條水道裡全是會咬人的魚。我的寶可夢也一樣！","Snapped my line...":"釣線斷了……","Carvanha swim in packs and bite anything that comes too close. Mind your fingers when you Surf!":"利牙魚成群游動，什麼東西靠得太近都會被咬。衝浪的時候小心你的手指！","Chester":"切斯特","My birds watched you Surf all the way across. Now let us see how you battle!":"我的鳥寶可夢看著你一路衝浪過來。現在來看看你對戰的本事！","Swellow fly south when the seasons change. They always come back to the same nest.":"季節變換時，大王燕會飛往南方。牠們總會回到同一個巢。","I came over on a boat to have lunch on this side. Nobody bothers me here... until now!":"我坐船來對岸吃午飯。這裡從來沒人打擾我……直到現在！","Lunch is ruined...":"午飯泡湯了……","They say Route 119 gets so much rain that the grass grows taller than a person!":"聽說119號道路雨下得特別多，草長得比人還高！","Do you like flowers? My Pokémon smell wonderful. Let me show you!":"你喜歡花嗎？我的寶可夢可香了。讓你見識一下！","Wilted...":"枯萎了……","Roselia's thorns are poisonous. Look, but do not touch!":"毒薔薇的刺有毒。只能看，不能摸！","Route 117. West: Verdanturf Town. East: Mauville City.":"117號道路。西：綠蔭鎮。東：紫堇市。","Verdanturf Town. A town of fresh air, sheltered from the ash of Mt. Chimney.":"綠蔭鎮。空氣清新，不受煙囪山火山灰影響的小鎮。","Route 118. West: Mauville City. The road goes on across the water.":"118號道路。西：紫堇市。道路在水的另一邊繼續延伸。","North: Route 119, to the Weather Institute and Fortree City.":"北：119號道路，通往天氣研究所和茵鬱市。","Anna & Meg":"安娜和梅格","Our Plusle and Minun cheer each other on! They get stronger when they are together!":"我們的正電拍拍和負電拍拍會互相加油！牠們在一起的時候會變得更強！","They cheered so hard...":"牠們那麼努力地加油了……","Plusle and Minun power each other up, side by side. Do you have a pair like that?":"正電拍拍和負電拍拍肩並肩時會互相增強力量。你也有這樣的搭檔嗎？","Hmm... No Shroomish here either. I was so sure they lived in these woods...":"唔……這裡也沒有蘑蘑菇。我還以為牠們一定住在這片森林裡……","There you are, Devon researcher! Hand over the papers you are carrying, nice and easy.":"找到你了，得文公司的研究員！乖乖把你身上的文件交出來。","N-no! These are important! You there, please help me!":"不、不行！這些很重要！那邊的，請幫幫我！","What? A kid wants to get in the way of Team Aqua? You asked for it!":"什麼？一個小鬼想妨礙海洋隊？這是你自找的！","Grr... You are tougher than you look. Fine, keep the papers. Team Aqua will not forget your face!":"可惡……你比看起來還厲害。好吧，文件就留給你。海洋隊不會忘記你這張臉的！","Thank you! Those papers are very important to the Devon Corporation. Please, take this.":"謝謝你！這些文件對得文公司非常重要。請收下這個。","Team Aqua... I must warn the company. I will hurry back to Rustboro City!":"海洋隊……我得通知公司。我要趕快回卡那茲市！","A Miracle Seed makes Grass-type moves stronger. Let your Pokémon hold it!":"奇蹟種子能讓草屬性的招式變強。讓寶可夢帶著吧！","Oh, you are a Trainer? I found this in the woods, but I do not have any Grass-type Pokémon. Here, you have it!":"哦，你是訓練家？我在森林裡撿到了這個，可是我沒有草屬性的寶可夢。給你吧！","Welcome to the Pretty Petal flower shop! Flowers and berries make everybody smile.":"歡迎光臨美麗花瓣花店！花和樹果能讓大家都露出笑容。","Welcome to the Pretty Petal flower shop! Our berries grow right outside. Here, a little gift for your Pokémon!":"歡迎光臨美麗花瓣花店！我們的樹果就種在門外。這個是送給你的寶可夢的小禮物！","Let a Pokémon hold an Oran Berry, and it will eat it in battle when its HP runs low.":"讓寶可夢帶著橙橙果，牠在對戰中HP變少時就會吃掉。","Devon Researcher":"得文公司的研究員","The sea breeze makes my Pokémon so lively! Let me show you!":"海風讓我的寶可夢精神十足！讓你見識一下！","Oh, the wind changed...":"哎呀，風向變了……","Lotad loves the rain. When it rains, it moves twice as fast!":"蓮葉童子最喜歡下雨。一下雨，牠的速度就會變成兩倍！","Billy":"比利","I have been waiting for a strong Trainer to walk by. That is you, right?":"我一直在等厲害的訓練家經過。就是你吧？","You really were strong!":"你果然很強！","Seedot looks just like an acorn. Sometimes I forget it is a Pokémon!":"橡實果長得跟橡子一模一樣。有時候我都忘了牠是寶可夢！","Darian":"達利安","The fish are not biting. A battle will pass the time!":"魚都不上鉤。來場對戰打發時間吧！","Even my Magikarp gave it everything...":"就連我的鯉魚王都拼盡全力了……","One day this Magikarp will be a Gyarados. I just have to be patient.":"總有一天這隻鯉魚王會變成暴鯉龍。我只要有耐心就好。","That cottage on the beach belongs to Mr. Briney. He was a famous sailor once. Now he just watches the waves with his Wingull.":"海灘上那間小屋是哈奇老人的。他以前是有名的水手，現在只和他的長翅鷗一起看海浪。","Ahoy! I am Briney. I sailed every sea in Hoenn in my day, but these old bones have hung up their sea legs. Now Peeko and I just enjoy the view.":"喂！我是哈奇。我年輕時航行過豐緣的每一片海，不過這把老骨頭已經不出海了。現在我只和Peeko一起看看風景。","Peeko the Wingull flaps its wings and cries happily.":"長翅鷗Peeko開心地拍著翅膀叫了起來。","Lyle":"萊爾","The woods are full of Bug Pokémon. And I have caught the best ones!":"森林裡到處都是蟲屬性寶可夢。而我抓到的是最棒的！","Bugs are still the best!":"蟲子還是最棒的！","Wurmple turns into Silcoon or Cascoon. Which one? That is the big mystery!":"刺尾蟲會變成甲殼繭或盾甲繭。會是哪一種呢？這就是最大的謎團！","Rustboro is just across the bridge! But first, a battle!":"過了橋就是卡那茲市！不過先來對戰吧！","Hmph, you are good.":"哼，你挺厲害的。","There is a school for Trainers in Rustboro. I learned everything there!":"卡那茲市有一所訓練家學校。我所有的本領都是在那裡學的！","Three Magikarp, three times the fun!":"三隻鯉魚王，三倍的樂趣！","Splash, splash, splash...":"躍起、躍起、躍起……","This river is full of Magikarp. Where do they all come from?":"這條河裡到處都是鯉魚王。牠們都是從哪裡來的啊？","I caught a Taillow in the woods! Well, it caught me first...":"我在森林裡抓到了傲骨燕！嗯，其實是牠先抓到我的……","Ow, ow, ow!":"痛痛痛！","Taillow is small, but it never gives up, even against a bigger foe.":"傲骨燕雖然個子小，就算對手比牠大也絕不放棄。","Berries grow on trees all over Hoenn. Pick them, and a new crop grows the next day!":"豐緣到處都有長著樹果的樹。摘下來以後，第二天又會結出新的！","Route 104. North: Petalburg Woods. East: Petalburg City.":"104號道路。北：橙華森林。東：橙華市。","Route 104. North: Rustboro City. South: Petalburg Woods.":"104號道路。北：卡那茲市。南：橙華森林。","Gina & Mia":"吉娜和米亞","We are twins, so we always battle together! Two against two!":"我們是雙胞胎，所以總是一起對戰！二對二！","We lost together too...":"我們也是一起輸的……","When we battle side by side, we think the same thoughts. Most of the time.":"我們並肩對戰的時候，想的都是同一件事。大部分時候是。","Sunny":"大晴天","The opponents":"查看對手","Ranks":"等級","We hope to see you on stage soon!":"期待早日在舞台上見到你！","In the Dance round, each Pokémon leads one dance and copies the others: step in time with the beat.":"在舞蹈審查中，每隻寶可夢領舞一次，其餘時候跟著跳：要踩準節拍。","In the Acting round, your Pokémon performs its moves for one of three judges, four times. The most hearts in all wins a ribbon.":"在演技審查中，寶可夢對三位評審之一使出招式，共四次。總分最多的能得到獎章。","Would you like to enter a contest?":"要參加比賽嗎？","Which category?":"哪一個類別？","Which Pokémon will enter?":"派哪隻寶可夢參賽？","Which rank?":"哪一個等級？","Thank you! Please go on stage. The contest begins now!":"謝謝！請上台。比賽馬上開始！","{mon} came in at number {n}. Train hard and try again!":"{mon}得了第 {n} 名。好好練習，再來挑戰吧！","Congratulations! {mon} won the {ribbon}!":"恭喜！{mon}得到了{ribbon}！","Congratulations! {mon} won again!":"恭喜！{mon}又贏了！","Each flavor brings out one quality: spicy for Cool, dry for Beauty, sweet for Cute, bitter for Smart, sour for Tough.":"每種口味提升一種狀態：辣是帥氣，澀是美麗，甜是可愛，苦是聰明，酸是強壯。","Choose up to {n} berries.":"最多選 {n} 顆樹果。","Feed it to which Pokémon?":"餵給哪隻寶可夢？","{mon}'s {list} went up!":"{mon}的{list}提升了！","{mon} looks completely full.":"{mon}看起來已經吃得飽飽的了。","Receptionist":"接待員","In the Acting round, watch the judges. A judge nobody else picks gives the most hearts, and filling a judge's voltage is worth even more.":"演技審查時要注意評審。沒有別人選的評審給的心最多，讓評審的興奮度滿了更有價值。","A poster: \"Cool, Beauty, Cute, Smart, Tough. Which will your Pokémon be?\"":"海報：「帥氣、美麗、可愛、聰明、強壯。你的寶可夢是哪一種？」","Level 50":"50 級","Anna":"安娜","Felix":"費利克斯","{mon} received the Artist Ribbon!":"{mon}得到了肖像獎章！","Your team received the Champion Ribbon!":"你的隊伍得到了冠軍獎章！","Fifty-six wins in a row! Your Pokémon received the Winning Ribbon!":"五十六連勝！你的寶可夢得到了優勝獎章！"},"zh-Hant",""]);
